(1674762, 226625, 20679, '<td valign="top">Entering any image with a sloping horizon open you up to criticism on this site and I''m afraid the composition is not strong enough to redeem that either. It has potential with a lower viewpoint and closer crop.</td>', 'Entering any image with a sloping horizon open you up to criticism on this site and I''m afraid the composition is not strong enough to redeem that either. It has potential with a lower viewpoint and closer crop.', '2005-09-05 01:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
