(1674764, 224793, 34547, '<td valign="top">The image feels a bit soft where I''m wanting more crispness. It is tough to pick it out, though, because it looks very in focus...perhaps the bright areas bleeding into the darker areas. Asside from that, I like it a lot. Cute kid, just one of those moments that you look fondly at and think about life and growing older.</td>', 'The image feels a bit soft where I''m wanting more crispness. It is tough to pick it out, though, because it looks very in focus...perhaps the bright areas bleeding into the darker areas. Asside from that, I like it a lot. Cute kid, just one of those moments that you look fondly at and think about life and growing older.', '2005-09-05 01:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674765, 227022, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. I love his baggy wet jeans.  The glimmer on the water is great.  IT has an old timey sense to it. Great shot.</td>', 'This is a great shot. I love his baggy wet jeans.  The glimmer on the water is great.  IT has an old timey sense to it. Great shot.', '2005-09-05 01:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674767, 226838, 20679, '<td valign="top">Nice use of high contrast. You have made the image dramatic as a result.</td>', 'Nice use of high contrast. You have made the image dramatic as a result.', '2005-09-05 01:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674768, 226758, 16241, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2005-09-05 01:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674772, 227016, 10080, '<td valign="top">Great score just for the scare factor/ I like the composition, but its just a bit flat? 6</td>', 'Great score just for the scare factor/ I like the composition, but its just a bit flat? 6', '2005-09-05 01:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674774, 225405, 33361, '<td valign="top">looks a bit overworked...</td>', 'looks a bit overworked...', '2005-09-05 01:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674775, 226547, 18197, '<td valign="top">I was prepared to like this a lot but I am distracted by the asymetrical border. And the crop could be more effective if it weren''t so tight on the right and so generous on the left. Probably lost 2 points over these distractions. Otherwise, very nice subject, capture, post processing and presentation.</td>', 'I was prepared to like this a lot but I am distracted by the asymetrical border. And the crop could be more effective if it weren''t so tight on the right and so generous on the left. Probably lost 2 points over these distractions. Otherwise, very nice subject, capture, post processing and presentation.', '2005-09-05 01:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674777, 225164, 10080, '<td valign="top">Nice blinds! Very clean! 5</td>', 'Nice blinds! Very clean! 5', '2005-09-05 01:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674778, 225905, 15711, '<td valign="top">Another great one, Joey!!!  Excellent idea.  You can even grunge yourself with pain balls!!! The symmetry and color is awesome.</td>', 'Another great one, Joey!!!  Excellent idea.  You can even grunge yourself with pain balls!!! The symmetry and color is awesome.', '2005-09-05 01:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674783, 226961, 18197, '<td valign="top">It may be an optical illusion, but the photo feels tilted. Suggest re-editing to see if straightening the horizon would help.</td>', 'It may be an optical illusion, but the photo feels tilted. Suggest re-editing to see if straightening the horizon would help.', '2005-09-05 01:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674784, 226802, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is high contrast but almost to the point of over exposure. I love her eyes and the semi profile of the shot. Maybe tone it down a smidge.</td>', 'This is high contrast but almost to the point of over exposure. I love her eyes and the semi profile of the shot. Maybe tone it down a smidge.', '2005-09-05 01:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674787, 227056, 10080, '<td valign="top">Very cute! Nice contrast, beautiful eyes! That one hair makes me want to itch my nose! But nicely done! 8</td>', 'Very cute! Nice contrast, beautiful eyes! That one hair makes me want to itch my nose! But nicely done! 8', '2005-09-05 01:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674790, 226144, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the water distorts her and makes her almost look one dimensional.  Cool illusion and I love the colors and the grid on the pool floor!!!</td>', 'Interesting how the water distorts her and makes her almost look one dimensional.  Cool illusion and I love the colors and the grid on the pool floor!!!', '2005-09-05 01:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674793, 226358, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite so far.  His eyes are so clear and your focus is dead on. I love the crop.  His whiskers are wonderful 10</td>', 'This is my favorite so far.  His eyes are so clear and your focus is dead on. I love the crop.  His whiskers are wonderful 10', '2005-09-05 02:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674799, 227072, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great colors. I love the boats!!! What a luscious sky color too.  This is wonderful.</td>', 'Great colors. I love the boats!!! What a luscious sky color too.  This is wonderful.', '2005-09-05 02:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674802, 225164, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the minmalist approach you took. The hat is great!!!</td>', 'I love the minmalist approach you took. The hat is great!!!', '2005-09-05 02:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
