(1675332, 225904, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting really makes the most of the form and texture here. Personally I''d crop the right side out further, pretty much on the vertical line of the corner behind - I find the tree slightly too centred within the square frame. Lovely shot.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting really makes the most of the form and texture here. Personally I''d crop the right side out further, pretty much on the vertical line of the corner behind - I find the tree slightly too centred within the square frame. Lovely shot.', '2005-09-05 10:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675333, 224855, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great subject matter - high contrast treatment fits it perfectly. Solid black background also just right. Not sure about patterned pillow case but everything else works well - eye contact is great!</td>', 'Great subject matter - high contrast treatment fits it perfectly. Solid black background also just right. Not sure about patterned pillow case but everything else works well - eye contact is great!', '2005-09-05 10:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675334, 225239, 36616, '<td valign="top">You have chosen red and magenta as your contrasting colours. Technically cyan contrasts with red and green contrasts with magenta. <br/>However you have produced a striking pic in a unique style - not to my taste but an interesting take on the challenge, good luck</td>', 'You have chosen red and magenta as your contrasting colours. Technically cyan contrasts with red and green contrasts with magenta. However you have produced a striking pic in a unique style - not to my taste but an interesting take on the challenge, good luck', '2005-09-05 10:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675335, 225273, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic use of strong light and shadow combined with high contrast processing. Excellent composition aided by unusual viewpoint and strong architectural lines. Love it!</td>', 'What a fantastic use of strong light and shadow combined with high contrast processing. Excellent composition aided by unusual viewpoint and strong architectural lines. Love it!', '2005-09-05 10:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675338, 225248, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is one of those occasions where I think the eye contact "rule" would definitely improve the image - I think it would be more striking if all members of the band were looking directly at the photographer. Still works reasonably well though.</td>', 'This is one of those occasions where I think the eye contact "rule" would definitely improve the image - I think it would be more striking if all members of the band were looking directly at the photographer. Still works reasonably well though.', '2005-09-05 10:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675342, 226939, 36616, '<td valign="top">This is exactly the colour combination I wanted but never found. Great contrast.<br/>Pic is on the better side of average, giving a good overall score.</td>', 'This is exactly the colour combination I wanted but never found. Great contrast.Pic is on the better side of average, giving a good overall score.', '2005-09-05 10:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675343, 226676, 3087, '<td valign="top">Locely portrait - great lighting and eye contact and nice use of negative space - I like how the gritty texture of the wall behind adds to the feel of the photo - it gives it a solidity.</td>', 'Locely portrait - great lighting and eye contact and nice use of negative space - I like how the gritty texture of the wall behind adds to the feel of the photo - it gives it a solidity.', '2005-09-05 10:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675347, 226665, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrast and excellent curved composition - model makes a great focal point. Not sure about the strange colours but certainly interesting. Model has a strange pale halo all around him - is it from sharpening?</td>', 'Excellent contrast and excellent curved composition - model makes a great focal point. Not sure about the strange colours but certainly interesting. Model has a strange pale halo all around him - is it from sharpening?', '2005-09-05 10:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
