(1675501, 226652, 15922, '<td valign="top">This is OK, but I think it might have been good to have some focal point as well - e.g. a person/pet/object/whatever, in the bottom right corner. I don''t feel there''s anything saying "Look at this first!" if you know what I mean. 5</td>', 'This is OK, but I think it might have been good to have some focal point as well - e.g. a person/pet/object/whatever, in the bottom right corner. I don''t feel there''s anything saying "Look at this first!" if you know what I mean. 5', '2005-09-05 11:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675502, 225316, 27763, '<td valign="top">Ooohhh.... fun with IR!   Very beautiful and dramatic.  Personally, I would like to see less noise, particularly in the clouds, but that''s just personal taste.  Nice one!</td>', 'Ooohhh.... fun with IR!   Very beautiful and dramatic.  Personally, I would like to see less noise, particularly in the clouds, but that''s just personal taste.  Nice one!', '2005-09-05 11:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
