(1675504, 225093, 32338, '<td valign="top">This is eerie.  Is the woman a mannequin?  The shadow has me thinking extraterrestrial.  This image is far from being the ''same ol'' stuff.''</td>', 'This is eerie.  Is the woman a mannequin?  The shadow has me thinking extraterrestrial.  This image is far from being the ''same ol'' stuff.''', '2005-09-05 11:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
