(1675598, 226706, 13026, '<td valign="top">Dodge and burn that sky a little, and you would have a totally Icelandic-style shot here, Zoom.  : )  <br/> <br/>Seriously, I think this is a wonderful b&amp;w, focus is right on, the light is perfect-o, it''s a kind of mysterious-feeling image...<br/> <br/>Dare I say that this is one of the best b&amp;w shots I''ve seen from you?  : )</td>', 'Dodge and burn that sky a little, and you would have a totally Icelandic-style shot here, Zoom.  : )   Seriously, I think this is a wonderful b&w, focus is right on, the light is perfect-o, it''s a kind of mysterious-feeling image... Dare I say that this is one of the best b&w shots I''ve seen from you?  : )', '2005-09-05 11:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
