(1675651, 226935, 11738, '<td valign="top">From my understanding of what high contrast image is, this does not fit the bill.  It''s very dark throughout with the slightest of light on your subjects.  I find this to be a dark photo rather than a high contrast photo.</td>', 'From my understanding of what high contrast image is, this does not fit the bill.  It''s very dark throughout with the slightest of light on your subjects.  I find this to be a dark photo rather than a high contrast photo.', '2005-09-05 12:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
