(1675779, 226999, 11738, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice high contrast colour image.  One of the best I have seen so far.  Very strong image composition as well.  Looks like gothic glow was used on this one.  If I had to take a guess, I''d say that this is one of bear_music''s shots.  If not, consider it a compliment, since he is quite good.</td>', 'Very, very nice high contrast colour image.  One of the best I have seen so far.  Very strong image composition as well.  Looks like gothic glow was used on this one.  If I had to take a guess, I''d say that this is one of bear_music''s shots.  If not, consider it a compliment, since he is quite good.', '2005-09-05 12:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
