(1675802, 225675, 27514, '<td valign="top">very nice image, I like how it''s simple yet nice to look at. Only think i would have done different is change the light angle you can see a glare on the black</td>', 'very nice image, I like how it''s simple yet nice to look at. Only think i would have done different is change the light angle you can see a glare on the black', '2005-09-05 12:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675803, 224631, 11738, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get the title link.  Focus seems a bit off as the little girl''s eyes are a bit blurry.  May have been caused by gausian blur(?)</td>', 'I don''t quite get the title link.  Focus seems a bit off as the little girl''s eyes are a bit blurry.  May have been caused by gausian blur(?)', '2005-09-05 12:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675804, 226930, 34659, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a painting.  Beautiful rich colors and composition.</td>', 'This almost looks like a painting.  Beautiful rich colors and composition.', '2005-09-05 12:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675808, 225969, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...</td>', 'Beautiful...', '2005-09-05 12:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675811, 226916, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great rich tones and composition.  Not crazy about the white spot (light source reflection) on the guitar though.  Still, very nice image.</td>', 'Great rich tones and composition.  Not crazy about the white spot (light source reflection) on the guitar though.  Still, very nice image.', '2005-09-05 12:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675814, 226557, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus &amp; movement.  Great crop too.  Nice rich tones.</td>', 'Beautiful focus & movement.  Great crop too.  Nice rich tones.', '2005-09-05 13:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675817, 224484, 34659, '<td valign="top">Like the contrasting colors, but focus seems a bit off to me.  Good composition.</td>', 'Like the contrasting colors, but focus seems a bit off to me.  Good composition.', '2005-09-05 13:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675819, 227109, 27514, '<td valign="top">ohh very nice shot, I love what your trying to make here. There are a few problems though, the lighting just makes glare on the wooden things and the eye goes stright to that, there is a spot on the background that looks like it''s been cloned and not very much time was spent on doing that. the lights are to light and the darks are to dark and it loses some sharpness in the front. Next time take a meter reading for the white and a meter reading for the black and then take the average. also to, move your lights farther back or but a diffuser of some sort on them, (tolit paper works well, the cheap kind) and mabey clean the dust from the sensor and it would be great, keep shooting!</td>', 'ohh very nice shot, I love what your trying to make here. There are a few problems though, the lighting just makes glare on the wooden things and the eye goes stright to that, there is a spot on the background that looks like it''s been cloned and not very much time was spent on doing that. the lights are to light and the darks are to dark and it loses some sharpness in the front. Next time take a meter reading for the white and a meter reading for the black and then take the average. also to, move your lights farther back or but a diffuser of some sort on them, (tolit paper works well, the cheap kind) and mabey clean the dust from the sensor and it would be great, keep shooting!', '2005-09-05 13:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675820, 224911, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really like how the astrological signs almost glow on the sculpture.  Nice contrasting tones.</td>', 'Really like how the astrological signs almost glow on the sculpture.  Nice contrasting tones.', '2005-09-05 13:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675823, 227110, 27514, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, good use of dop and contrast. though I''m afriad that there will be 6 million flower entries and overall you may get voted down due to that. I love it though 7</td>', 'very nice shot, good use of dop and contrast. though I''m afriad that there will be 6 million flower entries and overall you may get voted down due to that. I love it though 7', '2005-09-05 13:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675825, 225947, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I''m not fond of the clarity of the statue tho.  I find it has a soft or OoF feel to it.  I really like the way you have stopped the water tho and think that is very well done.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Nice photo.  I''m not fond of the clarity of the statue tho.  I find it has a soft or OoF feel to it.  I really like the way you have stopped the water tho and think that is very well done.  Good luck in this challenge.  <6>', '2005-09-05 13:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675827, 225141, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love the idea and B/W portions of the cat.  The eyes are overprocessed IMHO - causing them to look drawn or painted on.</td>', 'Love the idea and B/W portions of the cat.  The eyes are overprocessed IMHO - causing them to look drawn or painted on.', '2005-09-05 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675828, 225948, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot - love the background colors too.</td>', 'Very cool shot - love the background colors too.', '2005-09-05 13:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675830, 224736, 11738, '<td valign="top">Good job, old bear.  This is a very nice example of a high-contrast colour image.  I like this one a lot.  I love how it goes from light to dark when travelling right to left.<br/> <br/>Edit: spelling<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-12 07:06:27.</i></td>', 'Good job, old bear.  This is a very nice example of a high-contrast colour image.  I like this one a lot.  I love how it goes from light to dark when travelling right to left. Edit: spelling', '2005-09-05 13:04:47.000000', '2005-09-12 08:06:27.000000', 1),
(1675833, 226535, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice heavy contrast.  Not sure the composition really grabs me though - I think the crop is a bit tight at the top.</td>', 'Nice heavy contrast.  Not sure the composition really grabs me though - I think the crop is a bit tight at the top.', '2005-09-05 13:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675838, 225952, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I think the lighting worked against you here though.  Yes, there is contrast, but the highlights are pretty blown.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I think the lighting worked against you here though.  Yes, there is contrast, but the highlights are pretty blown.', '2005-09-05 13:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675839, 226889, 14671, '<td valign="top">The angle of the tombstones are off.  The horizon is level but the stone are the ones that should be.  Perhaps a 1degree rotation CCW would have corrected this and made for a more appealing photo.  I do like the elongated shadow tho.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;4&gt;</td>', 'The angle of the tombstones are off.  The horizon is level but the stone are the ones that should be.  Perhaps a 1degree rotation CCW would have corrected this and made for a more appealing photo.  I do like the elongated shadow tho.  Good luck in this challenge.  <4>', '2005-09-05 13:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675842, 226214, 34192, '<td valign="top">This eye looks vaguely familiar.  Could be way off.  At any rate, I love the POV and believe the DOF works well here.  The starkness of the image is great.</td>', 'This eye looks vaguely familiar.  Could be way off.  At any rate, I love the POV and believe the DOF works well here.  The starkness of the image is great.', '2005-09-05 13:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675843, 227016, 24951, '<td valign="top">Love taking pictures of these guys - though they make me nervous- but they have such odd behaviors and movements/dances. (Well odd to us, they know what their doing)</td>', 'Love taking pictures of these guys - though they make me nervous- but they have such odd behaviors and movements/dances. (Well odd to us, they know what their doing)', '2005-09-05 13:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675844, 224971, 11738, '<td valign="top">Superb high contrast portrait.  Very well done.</td>', 'Superb high contrast portrait.  Very well done.', '2005-09-05 13:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675848, 225239, 24951, '<td valign="top">Mmmm . . .I think this would have been better with different colours.</td>', 'Mmmm . . .I think this would have been better with different colours.', '2005-09-05 13:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675850, 226786, 34659, '<td valign="top">Certainly high contrast, but not crazy about the composition.  The colors seem more random than actually part of the objects they are on.</td>', 'Certainly high contrast, but not crazy about the composition.  The colors seem more random than actually part of the objects they are on.', '2005-09-05 13:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675851, 226936, 36616, '<td valign="top">Nice BW pic but not high contrast.<br/>An even spread of grays shows up in the histogram whereas a spike at both the black and the white extremeswould have given a high contrast. I don''t think that this is the best subject for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice BW pic but not high contrast.An even spread of grays shows up in the histogram whereas a spike at both the black and the white extremeswould have given a high contrast. I don''t think that this is the best subject for this challenge.', '2005-09-05 13:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675852, 225443, 14671, '<td valign="top">A very soft feel to this photo and I find it fits the challenge well.  Excellent clarity and great comp.  Wel done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'A very soft feel to this photo and I find it fits the challenge well.  Excellent clarity and great comp.  Wel done and good luck in this challenge.  <8>', '2005-09-05 13:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675854, 227085, 16241, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2005-09-05 13:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675855, 226932, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the focus is a distraction.</td>', 'Nice composition, but the focus is a distraction.', '2005-09-05 13:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675859, 226939, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wow - that''s certainly high contrast!  The image really jumps out at you.  Although after the initial shock, it''s really a pleasing shot and technically quite good.  Nice job.</td>', 'Wow - that''s certainly high contrast!  The image really jumps out at you.  Although after the initial shock, it''s really a pleasing shot and technically quite good.  Nice job.', '2005-09-05 13:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675863, 226078, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful range of deep rich colors.  The horizon line bothers me a tad, but it''s hard to take your eyes off the fantastic sky.</td>', 'Beautiful range of deep rich colors.  The horizon line bothers me a tad, but it''s hard to take your eyes off the fantastic sky.', '2005-09-05 13:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675867, 226802, 34659, '<td valign="top">Certainly high contrast, but IMHO the light areas are too bright - and there''s too much darkness/shadows to be high key (to justify the highlights).</td>', 'Certainly high contrast, but IMHO the light areas are too bright - and there''s too much darkness/shadows to be high key (to justify the highlights).', '2005-09-05 13:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675871, 226914, 34659, '<td valign="top">Man!  Could that be any crisper focus?  Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Man!  Could that be any crisper focus?  Beautiful shot.', '2005-09-05 13:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675872, 226375, 36309, '<td valign="top">Great shot - I love the leading lines.  A little more detail and focus on the rock in the foreground would have made it even better I think.</td>', 'Great shot - I love the leading lines.  A little more detail and focus on the rock in the foreground would have made it even better I think.', '2005-09-05 13:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675873, 226903, 41087, '<td valign="top">Like the photo, only problem I see is the angel is a little too low and it''s not cropped very well.</td>', 'Like the photo, only problem I see is the angel is a little too low and it''s not cropped very well.', '2005-09-05 13:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675874, 225864, 36309, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, captures the emotions</td>', 'Nice portrait, captures the emotions', '2005-09-05 13:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675879, 227040, 34659, '<td valign="top">Lovely rich tones and contrast.  Nice reflection too.  My only suggestion would be to take the flower out of the center.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'Lovely rich tones and contrast.  Nice reflection too.  My only suggestion would be to take the flower out of the center.  Very nice shot.', '2005-09-05 13:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675880, 226836, 36309, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better with a little bit of detail in the eyes</td>', 'I think this would have been better with a little bit of detail in the eyes', '2005-09-05 13:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675881, 226602, 34659, '<td valign="top">Yes, there''s some contrast here, but the subject matter/composition just isn''t very interesting to me personally.</td>', 'Yes, there''s some contrast here, but the subject matter/composition just isn''t very interesting to me personally.', '2005-09-05 13:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675884, 226107, 36309, '<td valign="top">Piercing eyes, which you have picked out well.</td>', 'Piercing eyes, which you have picked out well.', '2005-09-05 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675885, 226375, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a spectacular image!  The water is like glass.  Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Wow - what a spectacular image!  The water is like glass.  Beautiful shot.', '2005-09-05 13:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675886, 226663, 36616, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea to tone down the contrast by leaving in reds and some yellow. I like the result very much but find it difficult to score.<br/>Edit Stupid comment above - easy to score - high</td>', 'Interesting idea to tone down the contrast by leaving in reds and some yellow. I like the result very much but find it difficult to score.Edit Stupid comment above - easy to score - high', '2005-09-05 13:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675888, 226779, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast against the dark background, but I think that some more severe shadowing on the flower might improve the high contrast feel to the shot.</td>', 'Nice contrast against the dark background, but I think that some more severe shadowing on the flower might improve the high contrast feel to the shot.', '2005-09-05 13:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675889, 226895, 36309, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, however I think it would have been even better if we were able to see her left pupil rather than it being hidden behind her hair.</td>', 'Very nice portrait, however I think it would have been even better if we were able to see her left pupil rather than it being hidden behind her hair.', '2005-09-05 13:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675892, 226915, 34659, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  The title makes me think too much of Joey Lawrence''s image though.  :-)  Great contrast and focus.</td>', 'Good shot.  The title makes me think too much of Joey Lawrence''s image though.  :-)  Great contrast and focus.', '2005-09-05 13:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675895, 225529, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines.  Looks a tad oversharpened and I think you could have bumped up the tones a bit more.</td>', 'Beautiful lines.  Looks a tad oversharpened and I think you could have bumped up the tones a bit more.', '2005-09-05 13:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675896, 227084, 34659, '<td valign="top">The focus of the person seems out of place with the focus of the rest of the image.  Nice deep tones, but not crazy about the soft effect in this particular shot.</td>', 'The focus of the person seems out of place with the focus of the rest of the image.  Nice deep tones, but not crazy about the soft effect in this particular shot.', '2005-09-05 13:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675898, 227086, 42714, '<td valign="top">Digging on the concept of skin on white.  I would, however, say that this could benefit from a tad more contrast, and perhaps sharpening.</td>', 'Digging on the concept of skin on white.  I would, however, say that this could benefit from a tad more contrast, and perhaps sharpening.', '2005-09-05 13:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675899, 226760, 36309, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, which is very striking, but would this have benefited from a little sharper focus on the eye?</td>', 'I like the concept, which is very striking, but would this have benefited from a little sharper focus on the eye?', '2005-09-05 13:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675900, 225443, 36616, '<td valign="top">Some good contrasts here but maybe not as high as some would like for this theme.</td>', 'Some good contrasts here but maybe not as high as some would like for this theme.', '2005-09-05 13:21:08.000000', NULL, 1);
