(1675917, 227074, 14671, '<td valign="top">Good subject and great clarity.  This will be the next way peple travel with these gas prices.  I think the title suits the photo very well and I don''t usually take titles into consideration but in this case it fits so well I have to.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Good subject and great clarity.  This will be the next way peple travel with these gas prices.  I think the title suits the photo very well and I don''t usually take titles into consideration but in this case it fits so well I have to.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <9>', '2005-09-05 13:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675918, 226665, 36616, '<td valign="top">So there is water and humanoids on the moon.<br/>Excellent contrasts in all areas and across the range.</td>', 'So there is water and humanoids on the moon.Excellent contrasts in all areas and across the range.', '2005-09-05 13:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
