(1675922, 226586, 34659, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the composition here.  Think you could bump up the sky tones for contrast too.  Still, well focused shot and the colors/shadows on the flower are nice.</td>', 'Not crazy about the composition here.  Think you could bump up the sky tones for contrast too.  Still, well focused shot and the colors/shadows on the flower are nice.', '2005-09-05 13:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
