(1675928, 226656, 26464, '<td valign="top">now thats cool... and also kind of creepy.. i like it 8<br/></td>', 'now thats cool... and also kind of creepy.. i like it 8', '2005-09-05 13:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675929, 225904, 42714, '<td valign="top">This trunk is very human, even feminine in profile.  The contrast really accentuates this...good greyscale and a good catch.</td>', 'This trunk is very human, even feminine in profile.  The contrast really accentuates this...good greyscale and a good catch.', '2005-09-05 13:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675932, 226178, 14671, '<td valign="top">To me the photo doesn''t suggest high contrast.  IMO it says needed a entry for the challenge.  The water tower also appears to le leaning to the right a little and could have been corrected using a .5 or 1 degree rotation CCW.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'To me the photo doesn''t suggest high contrast.  IMO it says needed a entry for the challenge.  The water tower also appears to le leaning to the right a little and could have been corrected using a .5 or 1 degree rotation CCW.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-09-05 13:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675933, 226914, 27514, '<td valign="top">wow, very nicely done. it''s great to see someone use a light meter in this challenge. only thing I can find fault with this shot is the nasty shadows across the statue at the top, and I know that is something that is hard and almost imposable to avoid. The detail is great, though a slight unsharpen mask may have helped this shot, I love it 9 out of 10</td>', 'wow, very nicely done. it''s great to see someone use a light meter in this challenge. only thing I can find fault with this shot is the nasty shadows across the statue at the top, and I know that is something that is hard and almost imposable to avoid. The detail is great, though a slight unsharpen mask may have helped this shot, I love it 9 out of 10', '2005-09-05 13:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675935, 226676, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and contrast.  The model and flowers seem to have a very different feel than the background though (and I don''t mean contrasting, but in processing).</td>', 'Beautiful composition and contrast.  The model and flowers seem to have a very different feel than the background though (and I don''t mean contrasting, but in processing).', '2005-09-05 13:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
