(1676287, 227096, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting balance between light and dark in the water. The busy birds lead the eye along the top whereafter you go down to the lonely one, leaving the viewer wondering why he''s no part of the group.<br/>Good composition, interesting light and contrast, I like the mood of the tone. Restful. 8</td>', 'Interesting balance between light and dark in the water. The busy birds lead the eye along the top whereafter you go down to the lonely one, leaving the viewer wondering why he''s no part of the group.Good composition, interesting light and contrast, I like the mood of the tone. Restful. 8', '2005-09-05 15:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
