(1676792, 226823, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the nostalgic sense of this shot.  It seems like a foreign land to me as an American. I love it. The trees diping up and over create almost a perfect frame to the man and the boy.</td>', 'I love the nostalgic sense of this shot.  It seems like a foreign land to me as an American. I love it. The trees diping up and over create almost a perfect frame to the man and the boy.', '2005-09-05 19:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676793, 225127, 14671, '<td valign="top">The portrait of the model fills the frame nicely. The glasses on the right eye of the model is making it hard to look at.  It gives a double eye look, kinda like looking at someone with a cockeye and not knowing which eye to look at when talking to them.  I really wished I could have seen both eyes as there is a nice green tone in them that is highlighted by the blouse(sorry if thats spelled wrong but I am a guy).  I do like how the neck strap draws the eyes into the clevage area and right into a very high contrast part.  The pinkish hue from the check tends to be a nice touch in another high contrast area and softens the look of the red hair.  The model overall does have great sex appeal but perhaps could have place the left hand below the waist as to not have it in the shot.  The photo definately sparked a response and has both excellent color and clarity and fits the challenge well.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;6&gt;<br/> <br/>My appologies if I''ve picked apart your model or photo but this is what I see when I looked at it in hopes that what I say will help you correct things in the future or for future portraits.  Can''t wait to see you in the next self color portrait challenge.</td>', 'The portrait of the model fills the frame nicely. The glasses on the right eye of the model is making it hard to look at.  It gives a double eye look, kinda like looking at someone with a cockeye and not knowing which eye to look at when talking to them.  I really wished I could have seen both eyes as there is a nice green tone in them that is highlighted by the blouse(sorry if thats spelled wrong but I am a guy).  I do like how the neck strap draws the eyes into the clevage area and right into a very high contrast part.  The pinkish hue from the check tends to be a nice touch in another high contrast area and softens the look of the red hair.  The model overall does have great sex appeal but perhaps could have place the left hand below the waist as to not have it in the shot.  The photo definately sparked a response and has both excellent color and clarity and fits the challenge well.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <6> My appologies if I''ve picked apart your model or photo but this is what I see when I looked at it in hopes that what I say will help you correct things in the future or for future portraits.  Can''t wait to see you in the next self color portrait challenge.', '2005-09-05 19:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
