(1676961, 226826, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good contrasting colors: white shirt, popsicle colors and dark tree background. For me, this would also have worked well in the color portrait challenge.</td>', 'Good contrasting colors: white shirt, popsicle colors and dark tree background. For me, this would also have worked well in the color portrait challenge.', '2005-09-05 20:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676963, 226657, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love the light, shadows, &amp; tones here.  Interesting composition too.  Good job.</td>', 'Love the light, shadows, & tones here.  Interesting composition too.  Good job.', '2005-09-05 20:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676966, 226910, 41675, '<td valign="top">While there is contrast at the top of your photo, for me, the bottom two-thirds are very close in tonal range.</td>', 'While there is contrast at the top of your photo, for me, the bottom two-thirds are very close in tonal range.', '2005-09-05 20:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676969, 226524, 34659, '<td valign="top">Vibrant shot.  The slight tilt of the perspective is a bit distracting IMHO, but I like the colors and idea otherwise.</td>', 'Vibrant shot.  The slight tilt of the perspective is a bit distracting IMHO, but I like the colors and idea otherwise.', '2005-09-05 20:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676970, 226589, 35602, '<td valign="top">The very large black area on the left seems too heavy for the photo.  I think more midtones in the dark areas may have given it a bit more detail.  The most attractive part of the photo seems to be the head and lit side of the statue.  I would have liked to see more conrast along those lines.</td>', 'The very large black area on the left seems too heavy for the photo.  I think more midtones in the dark areas may have given it a bit more detail.  The most attractive part of the photo seems to be the head and lit side of the statue.  I would have liked to see more conrast along those lines.', '2005-09-05 20:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676971, 226729, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow - you definitely found two contrasting colors. Maybe a bit too much red, but I like the graphic composition.</td>', 'Wow - you definitely found two contrasting colors. Maybe a bit too much red, but I like the graphic composition.', '2005-09-05 20:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676972, 227022, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great crop.  I even like the border.  Very well presented shot.</td>', 'Great crop.  I even like the border.  Very well presented shot.', '2005-09-05 20:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676976, 226589, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the gray ranges in the background are very similar as on the sculpture. I do like the black shadows - you captured those well.</td>', 'For me, the gray ranges in the background are very similar as on the sculpture. I do like the black shadows - you captured those well.', '2005-09-05 20:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676977, 226663, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very visually appealing image.  The light spot behind the woman is a bit of a distraction and seems out of context, but otherwise nice job.</td>', 'Very visually appealing image.  The light spot behind the woman is a bit of a distraction and seems out of context, but otherwise nice job.', '2005-09-05 20:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676981, 227103, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the shapes are, but I like them. For me though, the two dark gray ones detract from the high contrast and I find the metal behind these shapes distracting. I do like the composition and the white border is a nice touch.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the shapes are, but I like them. For me though, the two dark gray ones detract from the high contrast and I find the metal behind these shapes distracting. I do like the composition and the white border is a nice touch.', '2005-09-05 20:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676984, 226972, 41675, '<td valign="top">Rather than high contrast in this photo, I see many close tonal values and ranges. It''s a very nicely composed photo, but for me, not as much high contrast as other photos in this challenge.</td>', 'Rather than high contrast in this photo, I see many close tonal values and ranges. It''s a very nicely composed photo, but for me, not as much high contrast as other photos in this challenge.', '2005-09-05 20:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676985, 226000, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good contrast. One of my favorites so far. I bet this would have worked for the color portrait challenge also. :-)</td>', 'Good contrast. One of my favorites so far. I bet this would have worked for the color portrait challenge also. :-)', '2005-09-05 20:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676986, 226889, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea.  Not sure it is all it could be though.  I think a lot of detail/focus is lost (not sure if it''s due to the original or the crop) and I think maybe the upper portion of the image is a bit too washed out.  Yes, I know this is supposed to be high contrast (and it is very contrasting), but something just isn''t quite clicking for me personally.  Wish I could be more specific - maybe it''s just my taste.  Still, not a bad shot.</td>', 'Very cool idea.  Not sure it is all it could be though.  I think a lot of detail/focus is lost (not sure if it''s due to the original or the crop) and I think maybe the upper portion of the image is a bit too washed out.  Yes, I know this is supposed to be high contrast (and it is very contrasting), but something just isn''t quite clicking for me personally.  Wish I could be more specific - maybe it''s just my taste.  Still, not a bad shot.', '2005-09-05 20:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676988, 226390, 35602, '<td valign="top">The picture needs more highlights for a stronger composition.  I liked the stairs pretty well, and the person is pretty contrasty, but the wall is too flat.  Maybe a crop of the area around the person with some of the stairs in the image.</td>', 'The picture needs more highlights for a stronger composition.  I liked the stairs pretty well, and the person is pretty contrasty, but the wall is too flat.  Maybe a crop of the area around the person with some of the stairs in the image.', '2005-09-05 20:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676989, 226658, 34659, '<td valign="top">Certainly high contrast.  Very interesting angle and intriguing image.</td>', 'Certainly high contrast.  Very interesting angle and intriguing image.', '2005-09-05 20:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676991, 225969, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the photo has been overly done in a photo editing program. The overly yellow skin is a bit much for my likes, but you have created some very nice, contrasting shadows.</td>', 'For me, the photo has been overly done in a photo editing program. The overly yellow skin is a bit much for my likes, but you have created some very nice, contrasting shadows.', '2005-09-05 20:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676993, 227081, 34659, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great idea and could have been really great, but it looks like too much neat image smoothed over many of the details that would have made this image more interesting.  Not a bad shot though.</td>', 'Looks like a great idea and could have been really great, but it looks like too much neat image smoothed over many of the details that would have made this image more interesting.  Not a bad shot though.', '2005-09-05 20:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676995, 226974, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, if this photo had been cropped in tighter on either side, eliminating the large blocks of white, it would have had a greater high contrast impact.</td>', 'For me, if this photo had been cropped in tighter on either side, eliminating the large blocks of white, it would have had a greater high contrast impact.', '2005-09-05 20:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676996, 225597, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great job.  Like the perspective and composition.  Certainly satisfies high contrast too.</td>', 'Great job.  Like the perspective and composition.  Certainly satisfies high contrast too.', '2005-09-05 20:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1676999, 226674, 34659, '<td valign="top">The processing on this shot is really outstanding.  I don''t know how you got it to be soft and detailed and contrasting, but you did.  Very appealing composition and subject too.</td>', 'The processing on this shot is really outstanding.  I don''t know how you got it to be soft and detailed and contrasting, but you did.  Very appealing composition and subject too.', '2005-09-05 20:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677000, 226796, 41675, '<td valign="top">The flower really jumps out against your solid black background. Perhaps just a bit more highlights on the stem, but for me, a really good high contrast entry. Well done. :::applause:::</td>', 'The flower really jumps out against your solid black background. Perhaps just a bit more highlights on the stem, but for me, a really good high contrast entry. Well done. :::applause:::', '2005-09-05 20:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677004, 226530, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great sky and I like the almost silhouetted foreground.  Not crazy about the utility pole &amp; wires.</td>', 'Great sky and I like the almost silhouetted foreground.  Not crazy about the utility pole & wires.', '2005-09-05 20:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677005, 225940, 41675, '<td valign="top">Aside from that line in the bottom left hand corner, for me, this really works as a high contrast photo. Very well done. Kudos!</td>', 'Aside from that line in the bottom left hand corner, for me, this really works as a high contrast photo. Very well done. Kudos!', '2005-09-05 20:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677007, 225407, 35602, '<td valign="top">The image is very clear, and the boys expression is wonderful, but the image itself is very flat.  I don''t think this quite brings out the supbject of high contrast.</td>', 'The image is very clear, and the boys expression is wonderful, but the image itself is very flat.  I don''t think this quite brings out the supbject of high contrast.', '2005-09-05 20:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677009, 226180, 34659, '<td valign="top">There''s a real gothic feel to the building here, but the sky is contrastingly so flat.  Yes, I realize that it is yet one other facet of high contrast to the shot, but in this particular image, it doesn''t work well for me.  Everything about the building is great.</td>', 'There''s a real gothic feel to the building here, but the sky is contrastingly so flat.  Yes, I realize that it is yet one other facet of high contrast to the shot, but in this particular image, it doesn''t work well for me.  Everything about the building is great.', '2005-09-05 20:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677012, 226781, 41675, '<td valign="top">I might be wrong, but this little kitten looks very familar to photos of some I''ve seen in the forums. Some of the whites are a bit too much for me, but otherwise I like the contrast, especially around the eyes and on the left side of the photo.</td>', 'I might be wrong, but this little kitten looks very familar to photos of some I''ve seen in the forums. Some of the whites are a bit too much for me, but otherwise I like the contrast, especially around the eyes and on the left side of the photo.', '2005-09-05 20:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677013, 227083, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very good use of high cotrast.  Very much like a high fashion photo.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very good use of high cotrast.  Very much like a high fashion photo.  Nice job.', '2005-09-05 20:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677014, 224347, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus, lines, composition, and lighting.  Nice high contrast without going overboard and blowing both ends of the spectrum.  Classy photo.</td>', 'Beautiful focus, lines, composition, and lighting.  Nice high contrast without going overboard and blowing both ends of the spectrum.  Classy photo.', '2005-09-05 20:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677017, 225093, 41675, '<td valign="top">While there is indeed high contrast with the model''s bag and footwear, the center and left hand side of your photo seem very similar in tonal value, to me. I do like your composition however.</td>', 'While there is indeed high contrast with the model''s bag and footwear, the center and left hand side of your photo seem very similar in tonal value, to me. I do like your composition however.', '2005-09-05 20:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677020, 226107, 36981, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image!  Very film noir-ish.  It almost calls out for a hat of some sort.</td>', 'Beautiful image!  Very film noir-ish.  It almost calls out for a hat of some sort.', '2005-09-05 20:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677022, 227028, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great focus and tones.  I like the angle/perspective too.  IMHO the border detracts from the overall impression of this particular shot though.  Still, a great capture.</td>', 'Great focus and tones.  I like the angle/perspective too.  IMHO the border detracts from the overall impression of this particular shot though.  Still, a great capture.', '2005-09-05 20:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677023, 225141, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea and concept, but the eyes are a little bit too overdone in a photo editing program. I like the tight closeup and the white whiskers though. Kid of spooky in a fun way. :-)</td>', 'Very cool idea and concept, but the eyes are a little bit too overdone in a photo editing program. I like the tight closeup and the white whiskers though. Kid of spooky in a fun way. :-)', '2005-09-05 20:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677026, 226370, 34659, '<td valign="top">Okay...  So this is what my flower shot was supposed to look like!  Outstanding clarity, deep rich tones, heavy shadows, and beautiful presentation.  What else can I say?  (Wish mine was this good!)</td>', 'Okay...  So this is what my flower shot was supposed to look like!  Outstanding clarity, deep rich tones, heavy shadows, and beautiful presentation.  What else can I say?  (Wish mine was this good!)', '2005-09-05 20:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677029, 224736, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not all that technical and while there is definitely a nice high contrast area on the upper right of your photo, other parts are similar in tonal values. I think this is a beautiful and peaceful photo though.</td>', 'I''m not all that technical and while there is definitely a nice high contrast area on the upper right of your photo, other parts are similar in tonal values. I think this is a beautiful and peaceful photo though.', '2005-09-05 20:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677031, 225239, 34659, '<td valign="top">I like the idea you had here - and I''m a big supporter of thinking outside the box - but I''m not sure this works for me.  Perhaps if you changed the overall hue, because I like the crop.</td>', 'I like the idea you had here - and I''m a big supporter of thinking outside the box - but I''m not sure this works for me.  Perhaps if you changed the overall hue, because I like the crop.', '2005-09-05 20:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677033, 226943, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very visually appealing shot.  It''s interesting and intriguing, and I like the color &amp; lighting contrasts.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very visually appealing shot.  It''s interesting and intriguing, and I like the color & lighting contrasts.  Nice work.', '2005-09-05 20:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677034, 226760, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, while there is some contrast, the gray values of the model are very similar and not dramatic as compared to others in this challenge. Again for me, the white is almost overpowering, but I do like your composition.</td>', 'For me, while there is some contrast, the gray values of the model are very similar and not dramatic as compared to others in this challenge. Again for me, the white is almost overpowering, but I do like your composition.', '2005-09-05 20:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677036, 225510, 34659, '<td valign="top">All right - now this is pretty wicked!  VERY cool.  Interested to read how you accomplished this.  Personally, I think I would have preferred more darkness to the shadows, but still a very cool shot.</td>', 'All right - now this is pretty wicked!  VERY cool.  Interested to read how you accomplished this.  Personally, I think I would have preferred more darkness to the shadows, but still a very cool shot.', '2005-09-05 20:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677039, 226375, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the subject matter, but I find that one large, dark rock in the foreground distracting from the rest of the photo. Cool use of filters and special photo imaging effects though.</td>', 'I like the subject matter, but I find that one large, dark rock in the foreground distracting from the rest of the photo. Cool use of filters and special photo imaging effects though.', '2005-09-05 20:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677040, 225904, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice tree.  Someone worked hard for a few years to get it to grow together like that. I''m sorry to say this, but I think the majority of the picture is in the middle gray area and, to me, that sorta knocks it out of the top scores. 7 for the wonderful imagination.</td>', 'Nice tree.  Someone worked hard for a few years to get it to grow together like that. I''m sorry to say this, but I think the majority of the picture is in the middle gray area and, to me, that sorta knocks it out of the top scores. 7 for the wonderful imagination.', '2005-09-05 20:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677043, 226940, 43569, '<td valign="top">Just breathtaking.</td>', 'Just breathtaking.', '2005-09-05 20:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677045, 226897, 41675, '<td valign="top">An interesting composition, but for me, the tonal ranges seem similar overall except for a few high contrast points along the links.</td>', 'An interesting composition, but for me, the tonal ranges seem similar overall except for a few high contrast points along the links.', '2005-09-05 20:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677047, 225925, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but not sure it translated as well as it could have in presentation.  I don''t care for the border - it takes my eye away from the image far too much and easily.  IMHO, just because there''s a silhouette, doesn''t mean that it''s necessarily a high contrast shot either.  I think that actually this would be better contrast with more color, light, and shadows.</td>', 'Cool idea, but not sure it translated as well as it could have in presentation.  I don''t care for the border - it takes my eye away from the image far too much and easily.  IMHO, just because there''s a silhouette, doesn''t mean that it''s necessarily a high contrast shot either.  I think that actually this would be better contrast with more color, light, and shadows.', '2005-09-05 20:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677048, 225690, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow - that bright foreground jumped right out at me...and I had trouble looking at the rest of the photo, which for me is more interesting. I wonder how this would look if that area was cropped down a bit more?</td>', 'Wow - that bright foreground jumped right out at me...and I had trouble looking at the rest of the photo, which for me is more interesting. I wonder how this would look if that area was cropped down a bit more?', '2005-09-05 20:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677050, 226983, 34659, '<td valign="top">Boy, she''s packed into that outfit...  :-)  Nice contrasts and I like the pose/composition, but the lighting in the upper half and the focus in the lower half are distractions to me.</td>', 'Boy, she''s packed into that outfit...  :-)  Nice contrasts and I like the pose/composition, but the lighting in the upper half and the focus in the lower half are distractions to me.', '2005-09-05 20:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677052, 226000, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful character portrait.  Great tones, composition, and focus.   Good contrast too - nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful character portrait.  Great tones, composition, and focus.   Good contrast too - nice job.', '2005-09-05 20:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677053, 225241, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, while there is contrast the seed pods now appear almost...metallic and overly done in a photo editing program. I do like the offset composition however.</td>', 'For me, while there is contrast the seed pods now appear almost...metallic and overly done in a photo editing program. I do like the offset composition however.', '2005-09-05 20:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677054, 226782, 41675, '<td valign="top">Ha ha ha, I''d been looking at color contrast and b&amp;w contrast photos so much, I almost missed your point. Very humorous subjective take on the challenge. :-)</td>', 'Ha ha ha, I''d been looking at color contrast and b&w contrast photos so much, I almost missed your point. Very humorous subjective take on the challenge. :-)', '2005-09-05 20:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677056, 226994, 34659, '<td valign="top">Not sure I''m crazy about the composition/crop here.  The individual cells of the light and the reflections they contain are so muddled that it makes the image confusing to me visually.  Neat idea.</td>', 'Not sure I''m crazy about the composition/crop here.  The individual cells of the light and the reflections they contain are so muddled that it makes the image confusing to me visually.  Neat idea.', '2005-09-05 20:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677058, 224876, 41675, '<td valign="top">I really like the graphic image you''ve created. Simple, clean and definitely high contrast. One of my favorites of the challenge. 10!</td>', 'I really like the graphic image you''ve created. Simple, clean and definitely high contrast. One of my favorites of the challenge. 10!', '2005-09-05 20:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677059, 225127, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great tones and focus.  Love the pose.  Not crazy about the border and I think the crop is a bit tight at the top.  Still, all in all a good image though.</td>', 'Great tones and focus.  Love the pose.  Not crazy about the border and I think the crop is a bit tight at the top.  Still, all in all a good image though.', '2005-09-05 20:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677060, 226941, 34659, '<td valign="top">Certainly high contrast.  Interesting compositionally (if you like cats).  Not crazy about the border.  But overall a pretty good shot.</td>', 'Certainly high contrast.  Interesting compositionally (if you like cats).  Not crazy about the border.  But overall a pretty good shot.', '2005-09-05 20:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677065, 226819, 34659, '<td valign="top">Her hair and jacket make this shot.  Very cool composition and her expression is intriguing.  Nice job.</td>', 'Her hair and jacket make this shot.  Very cool composition and her expression is intriguing.  Nice job.', '2005-09-05 20:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677069, 225021, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love the eyes in this shot.  Certainly an evil looking pose/expression.  Not sure the tones match the feel of the image though.  Still a shot I''d be proud to have in my portfolio.</td>', 'Love the eyes in this shot.  Certainly an evil looking pose/expression.  Not sure the tones match the feel of the image though.  Still a shot I''d be proud to have in my portfolio.', '2005-09-05 20:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677072, 227019, 34659, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the tones or composition here, but it is a technically well executed shot.  You''ve got nice deep shadows and the highlights aren''t blown out.</td>', 'Not crazy about the tones or composition here, but it is a technically well executed shot.  You''ve got nice deep shadows and the highlights aren''t blown out.', '2005-09-05 20:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677074, 226014, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Not sure the crop puts this in the best possible light, but love the reflection in the eye.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Not sure the crop puts this in the best possible light, but love the reflection in the eye.', '2005-09-05 20:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677077, 226558, 34659, '<td valign="top">Holy cow!  Major WOW factor here.  Truly spectacular shot.  Kudos...  I would imagine that this is a ribbon contender.</td>', 'Holy cow!  Major WOW factor here.  Truly spectacular shot.  Kudos...  I would imagine that this is a ribbon contender.', '2005-09-05 20:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677079, 224347, 11800, '<td valign="top">perfectly executed.</td>', 'perfectly executed.', '2005-09-05 20:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677081, 226976, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is just bloody great!  Fantastic composition, contrast, focus, lighting.  Excellent entry - and an image I''d be proud to have in my Portfolio.  My favorite entry for this challenge.</td>', 'This is just bloody great!  Fantastic composition, contrast, focus, lighting.  Excellent entry - and an image I''d be proud to have in my Portfolio.  My favorite entry for this challenge.', '2005-09-05 20:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677084, 225533, 34659, '<td valign="top">Okay, on how many levels is this high contrast?!?  :-)  Wow.  Perfectly meets the challenge, is very visually appealing, and technically well executed.  Certainly a ribbon contender!</td>', 'Okay, on how many levels is this high contrast?!?  :-)  Wow.  Perfectly meets the challenge, is very visually appealing, and technically well executed.  Certainly a ribbon contender!', '2005-09-05 20:58:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1677087, 225675, 34659, '<td valign="top">Ya know - this IMHO perfectly meets the challenge, is visually quite appealing, beautifully presented in its simplicity, and I think a real ribbon contender.  Beautiful work.</td>', 'Ya know - this IMHO perfectly meets the challenge, is visually quite appealing, beautifully presented in its simplicity, and I think a real ribbon contender.  Beautiful work.', '2005-09-05 20:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677089, 226675, 34659, '<td valign="top">WHOA!  Excellent...  Can''t wait to find out where this is!</td>', 'WHOA!  Excellent...  Can''t wait to find out where this is!', '2005-09-05 20:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677094, 227000, 34659, '<td valign="top">Stunningly beautiful cityscape.  Great contrast in both color and light.  Beautiful presentation.  Nice work.</td>', 'Stunningly beautiful cityscape.  Great contrast in both color and light.  Beautiful presentation.  Nice work.', '2005-09-05 21:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677095, 226949, 34659, '<td valign="top">Now this is high contrast IMHO.  Great job.  Beautiful tones and a pleasing composition.  Nice job.</td>', 'Now this is high contrast IMHO.  Great job.  Beautiful tones and a pleasing composition.  Nice job.', '2005-09-05 21:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677097, 226214, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wow - great photo!  Perfect crop - amazing that you got so much expresion with so little of the face shown.  Very nice job.</td>', 'Wow - great photo!  Perfect crop - amazing that you got so much expresion with so little of the face shown.  Very nice job.', '2005-09-05 21:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677099, 226796, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is everything I wish my flower shot had been!  Spectacular!</td>', 'This is everything I wish my flower shot had been!  Spectacular!', '2005-09-05 21:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677103, 226656, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is SUCH a cool shot!  Perfectly meets the challenge and is so visually appealing.  Great job.</td>', 'This is SUCH a cool shot!  Perfectly meets the challenge and is so visually appealing.  Great job.', '2005-09-05 21:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677104, 225638, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...  Great contrast too.</td>', 'Beautiful...  Great contrast too.', '2005-09-05 21:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677108, 226511, 34659, '<td valign="top">This has such deep rich tones and is really a spectacular scene.  Great capture.</td>', 'This has such deep rich tones and is really a spectacular scene.  Great capture.', '2005-09-05 21:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677109, 226134, 35444, '<td valign="top">This looks like a car commercial!  I like the composition.</td>', 'This looks like a car commercial!  I like the composition.', '2005-09-05 21:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677110, 225904, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot &amp; title.  I think you might have used a little too much neat image on the leaves, but great shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Very cool shot & title.  I think you might have used a little too much neat image on the leaves, but great shot nonetheless.', '2005-09-05 21:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
