(1677278, 226478, 40685, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot...would have been rated a tad bit higher if the *overall* contrast of the shot was more intense...and not just the highlight areas on the horse. Try closing down 1-1.5 stops then fiddle with the levels a bit in PS to get a more contrastly look without having extreme amounts of highlights. The focus of the shot seems a bit blurry as well, but that may very well due to the image compression. Overall, a good shot..could be great with a bit more tweaking!</td>', 'This is a nice shot...would have been rated a tad bit higher if the *overall* contrast of the shot was more intense...and not just the highlight areas on the horse. Try closing down 1-1.5 stops then fiddle with the levels a bit in PS to get a more contrastly look without having extreme amounts of highlights. The focus of the shot seems a bit blurry as well, but that may very well due to the image compression. Overall, a good shot..could be great with a bit more tweaking!', '2005-09-05 22:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
