(1677944, 227081, 11923, '<td valign="top">Definitely a lot of contrasts to be found here, light and dark, fresh and dead, even looks as if there''s a portion with more of a focus (the dead rose) vs the softer focused live rose.  I think its an interesting study in contrasts but in general not something I would have on my walls.  I also find the dark.. area on the top of the fresh rose very distracting, looks like the coloring of one of the petals is merging with maybe the stem of the dead rose which makes it a bit more noticable than it normally would be.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Definitely a lot of contrasts to be found here, light and dark, fresh and dead, even looks as if there''s a portion with more of a focus (the dead rose) vs the softer focused live rose.  I think its an interesting study in contrasts but in general not something I would have on my walls.  I also find the dark.. area on the top of the fresh rose very distracting, looks like the coloring of one of the petals is merging with maybe the stem of the dead rose which makes it a bit more noticable than it normally would be.  I gave a 6', '2005-09-06 03:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
