(1678228, 225830, 3669, '<td valign="top">In the darkness, the photo protrays sorrow.  Composition very well done.  Looks a tad oversharpened.</td>', 'In the darkness, the photo protrays sorrow.  Composition very well done.  Looks a tad oversharpened.', '2005-09-06 04:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678229, 226504, 3669, '<td valign="top">Love the colors.  Good contrast.  Would like to see the man in better focus.</td>', 'Love the colors.  Good contrast.  Would like to see the man in better focus.', '2005-09-06 04:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678232, 227081, 3669, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo.  Very crisp and clear.  Excellent contrast.</td>', 'Lovely photo.  Very crisp and clear.  Excellent contrast.', '2005-09-06 04:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678233, 226439, 41277, '<td valign="top">Wow,,, excelent.. you really understand the high contrast issue unlike alot in this challenge.. great "catching the moment shot" 9</td>', 'Wow,,, excelent.. you really understand the high contrast issue unlike alot in this challenge.. great "catching the moment shot" 9', '2005-09-06 04:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678236, 227100, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is a well done photo.  Very meaningful.  Excellent lighting and contrast.</td>', 'This is a well done photo.  Very meaningful.  Excellent lighting and contrast.', '2005-09-06 04:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678242, 225506, 3669, '<td valign="top">I am not that crazy with the sepia tone.  A little to much yellow for my liking.  Lighting is a little too harsh on the gal''s face.  I really like the emotion shown in this photo, though and how the gal is looking into the horse''s eye.</td>', 'I am not that crazy with the sepia tone.  A little to much yellow for my liking.  Lighting is a little too harsh on the gal''s face.  I really like the emotion shown in this photo, though and how the gal is looking into the horse''s eye.', '2005-09-06 04:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678253, 226479, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  It kind of has a 3D look.  Great use of contrast.  I really like the colors.  Good job.</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  It kind of has a 3D look.  Great use of contrast.  I really like the colors.  Good job.', '2005-09-06 05:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678257, 226669, 3669, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting.  Shows excellent contrast of B&amp;W, but also textures.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting.  Shows excellent contrast of B&W, but also textures.', '2005-09-06 05:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678259, 225127, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait and color contrast.  The only thing...I don''t really like how her glasses affect her eye.</td>', 'Very nice portrait and color contrast.  The only thing...I don''t really like how her glasses affect her eye.', '2005-09-06 05:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678264, 226602, 3669, '<td valign="top">Actually, I think this could use more contrast...even if this was not a high contrast challenge.</td>', 'Actually, I think this could use more contrast...even if this was not a high contrast challenge.', '2005-09-06 05:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678283, 225962, 42714, '<td valign="top">I think the idea is good, the perspective on this is great, but it actually suffers from a lack of contrast...too much grey where they could be white.  Advanced editing was allowed, so I think you could''ve played with the results a little. :)</td>', 'I think the idea is good, the perspective on this is great, but it actually suffers from a lack of contrast...too much grey where they could be white.  Advanced editing was allowed, so I think you could''ve played with the results a little. :)', '2005-09-06 05:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678301, 226504, 29535, '<td valign="top">His arms are glowing yellow due to you upping the levels, but still a great shot.</td>', 'His arms are glowing yellow due to you upping the levels, but still a great shot.', '2005-09-06 06:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678304, 226948, 29535, '<td valign="top">Such a good photo, yet ruined by the frame.</td>', 'Such a good photo, yet ruined by the frame.', '2005-09-06 06:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678305, 226961, 29535, '<td valign="top">Finally, someone meets the challenge AND does a great shot.</td>', 'Finally, someone meets the challenge AND does a great shot.', '2005-09-06 06:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678309, 226128, 29535, '<td valign="top">Good, but whats with the circle?</td>', 'Good, but whats with the circle?', '2005-09-06 06:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678311, 226759, 29535, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the frame.  THe photograph is good but It isn''t relaly high contrast enough.</td>', 'I don''t like the frame.  THe photograph is good but It isn''t relaly high contrast enough.', '2005-09-06 06:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678327, 224736, 18738, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, a beautiful sense of calm and the river draws your eye up the picture, but I can''t stand the border(just a personal thing and it won''t affect my vote much but it really spoils the picture for me)</td>', 'Lovely colours, a beautiful sense of calm and the river draws your eye up the picture, but I can''t stand the border(just a personal thing and it won''t affect my vote much but it really spoils the picture for me)', '2005-09-06 06:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678328, 225443, 21604, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot - lovely model, nice pose and nice use of over-exposure to create the high contrast theme. 9</td>', 'Stunning shot - lovely model, nice pose and nice use of over-exposure to create the high contrast theme. 9', '2005-09-06 06:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678333, 225955, 32836, '<td valign="top">GOOOD SHOT<br/></td>', 'GOOOD SHOT', '2005-09-06 06:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678335, 225021, 32836, '<td valign="top">EXCELENT...<br/></td>', 'EXCELENT...', '2005-09-06 06:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678340, 226675, 22517, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautiful colours. IMO, the person in the picture makes it less interesting.</td>', 'Wow! Beautiful colours. IMO, the person in the picture makes it less interesting.', '2005-09-06 07:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678353, 226692, 40295, '<td valign="top">Needs to crop a bit off of the top to look better - IMHO. Get rid of the opposite shore line.</td>', 'Needs to crop a bit off of the top to look better - IMHO. Get rid of the opposite shore line.', '2005-09-06 07:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678358, 227100, 29658, '<td valign="top">I would have closed a bit more to increase the Depth-of-field. Sharper would have been GREAT!</td>', 'I would have closed a bit more to increase the Depth-of-field. Sharper would have been GREAT!', '2005-09-06 07:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678370, 227108, 32836, '<td valign="top">GOOD SHOT &amp; IDEA</td>', 'GOOD SHOT & IDEA', '2005-09-06 08:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678410, 226895, 3569, '<td valign="top">ya burned her beautiful face to much to me.</td>', 'ya burned her beautiful face to much to me.', '2005-09-06 08:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678423, 226726, 29797, '<td valign="top">An incredible capture of the Orion Nebula (I think) M42 and M43. I can''t wait to see the data on this shot! I''m amazed at the almost non-existent noise level here for what I would think would be a pretty long exposure. Damn, I need a telescope!!! I hope people here appreciate this shot, this is photography on a different level. Nice job!</td>', 'An incredible capture of the Orion Nebula (I think) M42 and M43. I can''t wait to see the data on this shot! I''m amazed at the almost non-existent noise level here for what I would think would be a pretty long exposure. Damn, I need a telescope!!! I hope people here appreciate this shot, this is photography on a different level. Nice job!', '2005-09-06 09:10:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1678440, 224608, 18738, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but that centre bead is just a little too bright.</td>', 'Beautiful, but that centre bead is just a little too bright.', '2005-09-06 09:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678451, 226982, 29797, '<td valign="top">The title is right... beautiful model, beautiful "natural" portrait. Nice soft lighting and nice composition. There is some softness to this photo that I''m sure is only due to resizing for here (I see the image size is only 30 kbytes). If using Photoshop (I think PS Elements too) resize to 640 and resharpen a bit first, then save for web for a file size just under 150KB. Other programs probably have similar features. Check out this tutuorial: //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26<br/></td>', 'The title is right... beautiful model, beautiful "natural" portrait. Nice soft lighting and nice composition. There is some softness to this photo that I''m sure is only due to resizing for here (I see the image size is only 30 kbytes). If using Photoshop (I think PS Elements too) resize to 640 and resharpen a bit first, then save for web for a file size just under 150KB. Other programs probably have similar features. Check out this tutuorial: //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26', '2005-09-06 09:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678460, 226564, 29658, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but I''d cropped it differently. Also, watch the bottom border...</td>', 'I like the concept, but I''d cropped it differently. Also, watch the bottom border...', '2005-09-06 09:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678461, 226999, 4477, '<td valign="top">I like the use of foreground.</td>', 'I like the use of foreground.', '2005-09-06 09:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678463, 227020, 4477, '<td valign="top">King of the Mountain!  LOL  I like the processing of the background alot. Nicely done!</td>', 'King of the Mountain!  LOL  I like the processing of the background alot. Nicely done!', '2005-09-06 09:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678466, 225239, 4477, '<td valign="top">Now that''s contrast!</td>', 'Now that''s contrast!', '2005-09-06 09:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678479, 225751, 4477, '<td valign="top">Very nice job!  You''ve captured alot of detail, and i really like the POV.</td>', 'Very nice job!  You''ve captured alot of detail, and i really like the POV.', '2005-09-06 09:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678481, 226915, 4477, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.</td>', 'Nice portrait.', '2005-09-06 09:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678482, 226401, 4477, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea!  Definitely out of the box!  No pun intended. ha</td>', 'Interesting idea!  Definitely out of the box!  No pun intended. ha', '2005-09-06 09:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678483, 227073, 29658, '<td valign="top">Great, but don''t like the two cropped lamps...</td>', 'Great, but don''t like the two cropped lamps...', '2005-09-06 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678489, 225904, 33736, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little more contrast (the neutral background seems to diffuse the differences on the truck a bit), but nonetheless - an exquisite image.    8  (addendum - oops, sorry - forgot I can''t vote!)</td>', 'Perhaps a little more contrast (the neutral background seems to diffuse the differences on the truck a bit), but nonetheless - an exquisite image.    8  (addendum - oops, sorry - forgot I can''t vote!)', '2005-09-06 10:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678497, 225316, 33736, '<td valign="top">(from a non-voter, sorry - but your image is worth a comment!)<br/>This is a lovely scene.  The only thing that lowers its impact is the tremendous amount of noise - particularly in the clouds.  Heavy (or any, sometimes!)  use of "Contrast" will result in noise.  If filters are permitted - you might want to try Neat Image (free download).  It has a tendency to oversoften the image, but I compensate by using Curves in my editing program one last time before final save.<br/> <br/>Even noisy, this is a stunning image.</td>', '(from a non-voter, sorry - but your image is worth a comment!)This is a lovely scene.  The only thing that lowers its impact is the tremendous amount of noise - particularly in the clouds.  Heavy (or any, sometimes!)  use of "Contrast" will result in noise.  If filters are permitted - you might want to try Neat Image (free download).  It has a tendency to oversoften the image, but I compensate by using Curves in my editing program one last time before final save. Even noisy, this is a stunning image.', '2005-09-06 10:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678506, 226134, 33736, '<td valign="top">(from a non-voter, sorry - but your image is worth a comment!)<br/> <br/>This is undoubtedly the most stunning High-Contrast Sepia image I''ve ever seen - beautiful work.   Your choice of Sepia over B/W was a wise one!</td>', '(from a non-voter, sorry - but your image is worth a comment!) This is undoubtedly the most stunning High-Contrast Sepia image I''ve ever seen - beautiful work.   Your choice of Sepia over B/W was a wise one!', '2005-09-06 10:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678507, 225426, 34192, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful.  The subtlety of light is amazing here.  you''ve achieved a great balance here, with just enough tension to make it all work.  If I had a hat, I would take it off.  10</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful.  The subtlety of light is amazing here.  you''ve achieved a great balance here, with just enough tension to make it all work.  If I had a hat, I would take it off.  10', '2005-09-06 10:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678510, 226511, 29658, '<td valign="top">Not sure I prefer it vertical, but it''s nice...</td>', 'Not sure I prefer it vertical, but it''s nice...', '2005-09-06 10:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678512, 225248, 34192, '<td valign="top">Something about this image I thoroughtly enjoy.  Might be the tones.  The symmetry and frame bother me but not to the point of distraction.  Very well taken.  Like the use of lines and curves.  Well done! 8</td>', 'Something about this image I thoroughtly enjoy.  Might be the tones.  The symmetry and frame bother me but not to the point of distraction.  Very well taken.  Like the use of lines and curves.  Well done! 8', '2005-09-06 10:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678516, 226390, 34192, '<td valign="top">Well rendered.  Good balance of light and shadow. 8</td>', 'Well rendered.  Good balance of light and shadow. 8', '2005-09-06 10:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678522, 226530, 30049, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast and in COLOR!  Way to go!  ;^)  Amazing what ordinary objects can look like when approached in a unique manner.  The same pieces (utility pole, partial tree) normally would fail to produce something exciting.  Congrats.</td>', 'Beautiful contrast and in COLOR!  Way to go!  ;^)  Amazing what ordinary objects can look like when approached in a unique manner.  The same pieces (utility pole, partial tree) normally would fail to produce something exciting.  Congrats.', '2005-09-06 10:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678524, 226478, 34192, '<td valign="top">centered composition blah blah blah.  You''ve rendered the tones well here and the stop action is perfect.  Well done! 8</td>', 'centered composition blah blah blah.  You''ve rendered the tones well here and the stop action is perfect.  Well done! 8', '2005-09-06 10:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
