(1679584, 227005, 31133, '<td valign="top">Your image has beautiful depth. I''m not sure how I feel about the shadow, though. The foreground is appealing, as is the color of the very light part of the sand. There''s a sensual feeling to the composition.</td>', 'Your image has beautiful depth. I''m not sure how I feel about the shadow, though. The foreground is appealing, as is the color of the very light part of the sand. There''s a sensual feeling to the composition.', '2005-09-06 17:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
