(1679673, 226748, 36102, '<td valign="top">Very nice brick wall, very good contrasts in the colors but the picture is a little boring.  It would have been great to see something or someone off centered against the wall.</td>', 'Very nice brick wall, very good contrasts in the colors but the picture is a little boring.  It would have been great to see something or someone off centered against the wall.', '2005-09-06 18:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
