(1680680, 227056, 14735, '<td valign="top">Where do people find these models with the great eyes. You''ve captured them well.</td>', 'Where do people find these models with the great eyes. You''ve captured them well.', '2005-09-07 00:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680684, 225008, 40355, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant, and good contrast.</td>', 'Simple, elegant, and good contrast.', '2005-09-07 00:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680697, 225426, 40355, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot!  Very Al Capon/1920s-ish.  The contrast is great, the lighting and focus too.  Only suggestion - it would have been neat to see his head, especially if it was still hidden in the shadows, with him wearing a fedora hat, so that his face was hidden, but still there.  If that makes any sense...  :)  But still, great!  9</td>', 'I really like this shot!  Very Al Capon/1920s-ish.  The contrast is great, the lighting and focus too.  Only suggestion - it would have been neat to see his head, especially if it was still hidden in the shadows, with him wearing a fedora hat, so that his face was hidden, but still there.  If that makes any sense...  :)  But still, great!  9', '2005-09-07 00:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680702, 226535, 40355, '<td valign="top">Colors look a bit strange, almost like there was some nearly-harsh post processing?  Still, I really like how vibrant and alive the scene is.  It''s very well done!  10</td>', 'Colors look a bit strange, almost like there was some nearly-harsh post processing?  Still, I really like how vibrant and alive the scene is.  It''s very well done!  10', '2005-09-07 00:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680706, 224949, 25754, '<td valign="top">I photographed at a car race for the first time yesterday so I can really appreciate the panning technique here! Excellent! A good high contrast shot as well :)</td>', 'I photographed at a car race for the first time yesterday so I can really appreciate the panning technique here! Excellent! A good high contrast shot as well :)', '2005-09-07 00:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680707, 225239, 40355, '<td valign="top">Too heavily processed, the image becomes lost in the colors.  Have a hard time even seeing the cat.</td>', 'Too heavily processed, the image becomes lost in the colors.  Have a hard time even seeing the cat.', '2005-09-07 00:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680714, 226942, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very elegant and sophisticated.  Great contrast!</td>', 'Very elegant and sophisticated.  Great contrast!', '2005-09-07 00:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680732, 226014, 40355, '<td valign="top">WOW.  Amazing eyes!  That is one intense blue!  Great shot, good contrast and focus.  The lower part is just washed-out enough, any more would be overkill.</td>', 'WOW.  Amazing eyes!  That is one intense blue!  Great shot, good contrast and focus.  The lower part is just washed-out enough, any more would be overkill.', '2005-09-07 00:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680744, 225147, 40355, '<td valign="top">For some reason, it reminds me of the movie "Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid", when they were in Bolivia.  Don''t know why, guess it''s the old-style feel and the setting.  But I like it.  8</td>', 'For some reason, it reminds me of the movie "Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid", when they were in Bolivia.  Don''t know why, guess it''s the old-style feel and the setting.  But I like it.  8', '2005-09-07 00:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680760, 225652, 40355, '<td valign="top">Neat.  Like the motion blurs.</td>', 'Neat.  Like the motion blurs.', '2005-09-07 00:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680766, 225623, 40355, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but very mysterious and creepy.  Kind of place I don''t know that I''d want to be alone at on a foggy night.  The wood in the foreground is a nice touch, it adds some great contrast.  9</td>', 'Great shot, but very mysterious and creepy.  Kind of place I don''t know that I''d want to be alone at on a foggy night.  The wood in the foreground is a nice touch, it adds some great contrast.  9', '2005-09-07 00:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680773, 226631, 40355, '<td valign="top">lol  Love the pirate flag.  Very nice shot, almost looks like real boats.  Nice, sharp contrast.</td>', 'lol  Love the pirate flag.  Very nice shot, almost looks like real boats.  Nice, sharp contrast.', '2005-09-07 00:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680778, 226885, 40355, '<td valign="top">haha  Looks like one I took the other day.  Very nice!</td>', 'haha  Looks like one I took the other day.  Very nice!', '2005-09-07 00:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680798, 224736, 40355, '<td valign="top">WOW.  Now there''s an amazing sunset!  The reflection on the water makes it even better, although the crowning point is the light on the cloud fronts.  You''re very lucky to have seen this!</td>', 'WOW.  Now there''s an amazing sunset!  The reflection on the water makes it even better, although the crowning point is the light on the cloud fronts.  You''re very lucky to have seen this!', '2005-09-07 00:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1680809, 226726, 40355, '<td valign="top">Wow...wish I could take this kind of shot.....</td>', 'Wow...wish I could take this kind of shot.....', '2005-09-07 00:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
