(1681021, 226684, 15511, '<td valign="top">The left side of the image is strong &amp; effective. In the right side, it appears you''ve lost that strength. A single color or shade on the right side could have helped.</td>', 'The left side of the image is strong & effective. In the right side, it appears you''ve lost that strength. A single color or shade on the right side could have helped.', '2005-09-07 01:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
