(1681698, 227000, 3669, '<td valign="top">Would have liiked to see the background a little darker.  Otherwise, a good picture.  The lights and color are nice.</td>', 'Would have liiked to see the background a little darker.  Otherwise, a good picture.  The lights and color are nice.', '2005-09-07 06:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1681701, 226144, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really like the pattern and color of the water.  However, the swimmer is not portrayed very flattering.</td>', 'I really like the pattern and color of the water.  However, the swimmer is not portrayed very flattering.', '2005-09-07 06:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1681702, 226889, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and shadows.  Good contrast</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and shadows.  Good contrast', '2005-09-07 06:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1681704, 226372, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid colors, however, I would have like to have seen more detail in the flowers.</td>', 'Nice vivid colors, however, I would have like to have seen more detail in the flowers.', '2005-09-07 06:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1681708, 226759, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent action shot.  Good capture of the water and mist.  Great lighting and contrast.  One thing, I think I would have liked to see the fire that they are fighting.  Kind of looks like they are sitting in the middle of the street playing with the hose.  Also, the bright yellow border is very distracting.</td>', 'Excellent action shot.  Good capture of the water and mist.  Great lighting and contrast.  One thing, I think I would have liked to see the fire that they are fighting.  Kind of looks like they are sitting in the middle of the street playing with the hose.  Also, the bright yellow border is very distracting.', '2005-09-07 06:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1681709, 226572, 3669, '<td valign="top">Too bad the dark horse couldn''t have been placed in the middle.  Good use of B&amp;W and nice contrast.</td>', 'Too bad the dark horse couldn''t have been placed in the middle.  Good use of B&W and nice contrast.', '2005-09-07 06:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1681710, 226943, 29535, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna guess at a tuning head for a bass guitar.</td>', 'I''m gonna guess at a tuning head for a bass guitar.', '2005-09-07 06:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1681716, 224631, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very meaningful.  I personally think this would have looked even better in B&amp;W and using a lighter background.  It would make the contrasting colors stand out better.  The gold background does not compliment the child''s skin tones very well (especially the red hair).  and the colors appear a little oversaturated.</td>', 'Very meaningful.  I personally think this would have looked even better in B&W and using a lighter background.  It would make the contrasting colors stand out better.  The gold background does not compliment the child''s skin tones very well (especially the red hair).  and the colors appear a little oversaturated.', '2005-09-07 07:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1681718, 224171, 3669, '<td valign="top">I actually like this photo...the colors and the abstract feel to it.  However, if I look at it too long, my eyes get buggy.</td>', 'I actually like this photo...the colors and the abstract feel to it.  However, if I look at it too long, my eyes get buggy.', '2005-09-07 07:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1681721, 226791, 3669, '<td valign="top">I''m an absolute sucker for cute puppy picture.  I love the expression on this little guy''s face.  Great use of contrasting B&amp;W.  This is a winner for me.  10</td>', 'I''m an absolute sucker for cute puppy picture.  I love the expression on this little guy''s face.  Great use of contrasting B&W.  This is a winner for me.  10', '2005-09-07 07:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1681723, 226674, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and light.  The clouds are beautiful.  The only thing...appears a little fuzzy.</td>', 'Excellent composition and light.  The clouds are beautiful.  The only thing...appears a little fuzzy.', '2005-09-07 07:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1681725, 227098, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.  The spider could be in better focus..   I''m not a big fan of spiders, howeve  I do like the colors in this photo.</td>', 'Nice DOF.  The spider could be in better focus..   I''m not a big fan of spiders, howeve  I do like the colors in this photo.', '2005-09-07 07:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
