(1683037, 226665, 18191, '<td valign="top">Back to comment. I hope that this wins as it is absolutely beautiful. Instead of raising your ego with what I liked about it (which was basically editing) the aspects of it that I feel detract are the following: 1. The halo around the man standing is distracting and is the only major flaw. 2. I think that the other piece of rock/mineral on the water to the left of the man''s reflection is not necessary and is just visually incongruent with the rest of the composition.<br/> <br/>Mind you, these are only small nitpicks that I saw to give a sort of "constructive critique". Best of luck to you --- 10.</td>', 'Back to comment. I hope that this wins as it is absolutely beautiful. Instead of raising your ego with what I liked about it (which was basically editing) the aspects of it that I feel detract are the following: 1. The halo around the man standing is distracting and is the only major flaw. 2. I think that the other piece of rock/mineral on the water to the left of the man''s reflection is not necessary and is just visually incongruent with the rest of the composition. Mind you, these are only small nitpicks that I saw to give a sort of "constructive critique". Best of luck to you --- 10.', '2005-09-07 14:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
