(1683305, 225843, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>I don''t really see too much dark in the photo for the contrast. There is a spot on the left side of the photo in the sky that I would''ve cloned out. Other than that, there is nothing that makes anything stand out and draw attention. I''m not sure what I''m supposed to really be looking at in the photo. No main subject.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 I don''t really see too much dark in the photo for the contrast. There is a spot on the left side of the photo in the sky that I would''ve cloned out. Other than that, there is nothing that makes anything stand out and draw attention. I''m not sure what I''m supposed to really be looking at in the photo. No main subject.', '2005-09-07 16:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1683310, 226351, 41554, '<td valign="top">I think the light source in the left is a bit distracting. Also, focus feels very soft, and the "high constrast" is lacking a bit.</td>', 'I think the light source in the left is a bit distracting. Also, focus feels very soft, and the "high constrast" is lacking a bit.', '2005-09-07 16:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
