(1683376, 226854, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Nice action shot. I would love to have a lens to get such a shot. There is one major distracting element in the shot. It is a large white spot ont he goalie. I''m sure it is probably supposed to be there, and not dust, but I would''ve removed it still.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Nice action shot. I would love to have a lens to get such a shot. There is one major distracting element in the shot. It is a large white spot ont he goalie. I''m sure it is probably supposed to be there, and not dust, but I would''ve removed it still.', '2005-09-07 16:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1683381, 226128, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 0/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 0/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>This is a great idea, but it lookds a little too photoshopped. The contrast is too much, and there is a lot of grain in the photo also. I would''ve also tilted the photo a little to the left, as the soldier looks like he is falling over a bit.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 0/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 0/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 This is a great idea, but it lookds a little too photoshopped. The contrast is too much, and there is a lot of grain in the photo also. I would''ve also tilted the photo a little to the left, as the soldier looks like he is falling over a bit.', '2005-09-07 16:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1683427, 226903, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria:2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>The lake is too big. Nice job on the idea. The dark rocks in foreground, lake, and then the IR trees in the background. But there is just too much lake so the background trees lose the impact they should have because they are so far off.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria:2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 The lake is too big. Nice job on the idea. The dark rocks in foreground, lake, and then the IR trees in the background. But there is just too much lake so the background trees lose the impact they should have because they are so far off.', '2005-09-07 16:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1683434, 226910, 31443, '<td valign="top">What colors! Beautiful contrast..</td>', 'What colors! Beautiful contrast..', '2005-09-07 16:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1683438, 226904, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Color/contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>My idea of high contrast would be everything up to, but not including, silhouettes. In addition to that, there is a lot of noise int he sky that I would have used neat image or some other noise removal tool to reduce, and the color transition in the sky needs some work. I assume that is due to the JPEG conversion. As for the clouds/smokestacks/smoke, great job!</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Color/contrast: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 My idea of high contrast would be everything up to, but not including, silhouettes. In addition to that, there is a lot of noise int he sky that I would have used neat image or some other noise removal tool to reduce, and the color transition in the sky needs some work. I assume that is due to the JPEG conversion. As for the clouds/smokestacks/smoke, great job!', '2005-09-07 16:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1683505, 226358, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>Great work on this photo. This is the best high contrast photo I''ve seen yet. Not quite blown out highlights, and dark shadows with some detail still. And excellent focus and composition and good use of DOF also.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 Great work on this photo. This is the best high contrast photo I''ve seen yet. Not quite blown out highlights, and dark shadows with some detail still. And excellent focus and composition and good use of DOF also.', '2005-09-07 17:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1683516, 226779, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2', '2005-09-07 17:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
