(1684270, 225638, 3554, '<td valign="top">IR?   I like it because there is a lot of different things contrasted here. Color is obvious, but also the smaller clouds in the foreground contrast with the larger clouds behind. The mountains in the foreground contrast with their cousins in the background and they have a peaceful feeling that contrasts with the turbulent sky. Nicely done.</td>', 'IR?   I like it because there is a lot of different things contrasted here. Color is obvious, but also the smaller clouds in the foreground contrast with the larger clouds behind. The mountains in the foreground contrast with their cousins in the background and they have a peaceful feeling that contrasts with the turbulent sky. Nicely done.', '2005-09-07 20:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
