(1684281, 224428, 3554, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the overexposure on the left. Also the shot is not compelling. An improvement might be to not have the black in the top right corner. But overall I just don''t see how it fits the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t care for the overexposure on the left. Also the shot is not compelling. An improvement might be to not have the black in the top right corner. But overall I just don''t see how it fits the challenge.', '2005-09-07 20:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
