(1684289, 226479, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not bad. Seems a little overprocessed (too much sharpening on the left portion of the picture) and it doesn''t scream "contrast" to me....liquid vs rock maybe? Not quite sure what you were after with this one.</td>', 'Not bad. Seems a little overprocessed (too much sharpening on the left portion of the picture) and it doesn''t scream "contrast" to me....liquid vs rock maybe? Not quite sure what you were after with this one.', '2005-09-07 20:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
