(1684310, 226669, 3554, '<td valign="top">Something about this just doesn''t grab me. I think it feels flat. If there were more depth between the plant on the right and the flower on the left I think it would help.</td>', 'Something about this just doesn''t grab me. I think it feels flat. If there were more depth between the plant on the right and the flower on the left I think it would help.', '2005-09-07 20:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684322, 225426, 3554, '<td valign="top">Me Gusta!  Only thing I can suggest is the light in the upper right is distracting.</td>', 'Me Gusta!  Only thing I can suggest is the light in the upper right is distracting.', '2005-09-07 21:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684336, 226791, 3554, '<td valign="top">The fur on the right is blown out which is unfortunate, because otherwise it''s a pretty nice shot. I might have tried to clean his eyes up a little bit more. My eye is immediately drawn to his left eye (right as we look at the shot) and I wish it wasn''t goopy in the corner.</td>', 'The fur on the right is blown out which is unfortunate, because otherwise it''s a pretty nice shot. I might have tried to clean his eyes up a little bit more. My eye is immediately drawn to his left eye (right as we look at the shot) and I wish it wasn''t goopy in the corner.', '2005-09-07 21:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684343, 225588, 3554, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge.</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge.', '2005-09-07 21:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684364, 225751, 34659, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail and composition.  Really a magnificent view.  The sky couldn''t have been more perfect either.  I''m very surprised that B/W worked so well here, but it sure did!  Nice job.</td>', 'Incredible detail and composition.  Really a magnificent view.  The sky couldn''t have been more perfect either.  I''m very surprised that B/W worked so well here, but it sure did!  Nice job.', '2005-09-07 21:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684368, 225239, 3554, '<td valign="top">If the purple were red I think you could have pulled something pretty cool off. I think the red and purple clash too much. Contrast yes, but not in a good way.</td>', 'If the purple were red I think you could have pulled something pretty cool off. I think the red and purple clash too much. Contrast yes, but not in a good way.', '2005-09-07 21:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684381, 226729, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is really inventive and original.  Great composition and color.  Lighting (which really could have been a downfall here) is also quite good.  Very nice work.</td>', 'This is really inventive and original.  Great composition and color.  Lighting (which really could have been a downfall here) is also quite good.  Very nice work.', '2005-09-07 21:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684388, 225108, 3554, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure it meets the challenge very well.</td>', 'I''m not sure it meets the challenge very well.', '2005-09-07 21:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684399, 224876, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not terribly interesting and the lighting''s pretty flat. If you could alter the lighting somewhat an maybe have the camera at a flatter angle I think it would''ve helped.</td>', 'Not terribly interesting and the lighting''s pretty flat. If you could alter the lighting somewhat an maybe have the camera at a flatter angle I think it would''ve helped.', '2005-09-07 21:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684400, 226107, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is another beautiful portrait of you!  Great shadows and lines.  Very nice detail and composition.  My only very minor critical observation is that the skin tones are mottled on my monitor.  If it weren''t for that, I''d say 10.  As is, still a very strong entry and an 8.  :-)</td>', 'This is another beautiful portrait of you!  Great shadows and lines.  Very nice detail and composition.  My only very minor critical observation is that the skin tones are mottled on my monitor.  If it weren''t for that, I''d say 10.  As is, still a very strong entry and an 8.  :-)', '2005-09-07 21:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684411, 227103, 34659, '<td valign="top">What great lines and composition!  Really beautiful job here.  My only suggestion would be to perhaps make the black border more of a dark silver to match some of the tones in the image.  Otherwise, great job!</td>', 'What great lines and composition!  Really beautiful job here.  My only suggestion would be to perhaps make the black border more of a dark silver to match some of the tones in the image.  Otherwise, great job!', '2005-09-07 21:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684413, 227072, 3554, '<td valign="top">Blues, greens, reds. Nice.  Consider a different angle on the boat maybe? I''d like to see the same shot with you lying down or kneeling and maybe more to the left or right of the boat. If you could have avoided the sign and blue/white boat in the background you''d have a stronger shot.</td>', 'Blues, greens, reds. Nice.  Consider a different angle on the boat maybe? I''d like to see the same shot with you lying down or kneeling and maybe more to the left or right of the boat. If you could have avoided the sign and blue/white boat in the background you''d have a stronger shot.', '2005-09-07 21:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684423, 226636, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped it a lot closer and lost his left arm altogether. If you do that its a strong shot.</td>', 'I think I would have cropped it a lot closer and lost his left arm altogether. If you do that its a strong shot.', '2005-09-07 21:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684431, 226935, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful composition and lighting.  There appears to be an odd shaped lighter area around some of the objects (that looks like processing remnants) that is distracting, but that''s really the only thing I can find negative about the shot.  Very nice job overall.</td>', 'Really beautiful composition and lighting.  There appears to be an odd shaped lighter area around some of the objects (that looks like processing remnants) that is distracting, but that''s really the only thing I can find negative about the shot.  Very nice job overall.', '2005-09-07 21:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684437, 225006, 3554, '<td valign="top">simple and meets challenge well. I like the layering of "contrasts" white on black on white on black. Seems a tad out of focus to me and the whites in the front of the cup and the handle seem a little over exposed. But overall a decent submission.</td>', 'simple and meets challenge well. I like the layering of "contrasts" white on black on white on black. Seems a tad out of focus to me and the whites in the front of the cup and the handle seem a little over exposed. But overall a decent submission.', '2005-09-07 21:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684441, 226478, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horse - with bizarrely fascinating eyes.  Great composition and overall feel to the shot, but the glare from the left side of the horse is a little strong IMHO.  I know it''s supposed to be high contrast, but I think it only needs to be as light as the dark areas are black.  Still overall very strong entry.</td>', 'Beautiful horse - with bizarrely fascinating eyes.  Great composition and overall feel to the shot, but the glare from the left side of the horse is a little strong IMHO.  I know it''s supposed to be high contrast, but I think it only needs to be as light as the dark areas are black.  Still overall very strong entry.', '2005-09-07 21:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684446, 224347, 3554, '<td valign="top">It''s a cool shot from a lighting perspective. I love the curves. There''s no real focal point though. I''m not sure if I should be looking at the clock or the words or the lines or....? Makes my eye jump all around.</td>', 'It''s a cool shot from a lighting perspective. I love the curves. There''s no real focal point though. I''m not sure if I should be looking at the clock or the words or the lines or....? Makes my eye jump all around.', '2005-09-07 21:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1684450, 226854, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is really a great shot!  Fantastic stop action with vivid contrasts and tones.  Exceptional clarity and lighting too (in what I''m sure was less than ideal conditions).  Very good work.</td>', 'This is really a great shot!  Fantastic stop action with vivid contrasts and tones.  Exceptional clarity and lighting too (in what I''m sure was less than ideal conditions).  Very good work.', '2005-09-07 21:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
