(1685416, 227030, 12750, '<td valign="top">Not too shabby, unfortunately the rock in direct front is not very interesting to look at so close and so much of, but I like the rest of the rock following around.  Either way the water stands out with a good reflection.</td>', 'Not too shabby, unfortunately the rock in direct front is not very interesting to look at so close and so much of, but I like the rest of the rock following around.  Either way the water stands out with a good reflection.', '2005-09-08 00:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685421, 225415, 12750, '<td valign="top">If only you could get rid of the very faint line to the left of her.  It pulls my view directly to it against that white background even more than she does.  Good silhouette!</td>', 'If only you could get rid of the very faint line to the left of her.  It pulls my view directly to it against that white background even more than she does.  Good silhouette!', '2005-09-08 00:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685427, 226599, 12750, '<td valign="top">Ahh, neat idea. I am a selective desaturation fan so I like the idea!  Things I would change: The face on the right seems very slightly higher at the eyebrow, but then again the eye itself seems even, I know can''t really fix =/  Also the left eye seems to have more focus/detail than the right.  Could this be from the color? I wouldn''t believe so.  Good shot.  Good luck against the de-saturation bashers!</td>', 'Ahh, neat idea. I am a selective desaturation fan so I like the idea!  Things I would change: The face on the right seems very slightly higher at the eyebrow, but then again the eye itself seems even, I know can''t really fix =/  Also the left eye seems to have more focus/detail than the right.  Could this be from the color? I wouldn''t believe so.  Good shot.  Good luck against the de-saturation bashers!', '2005-09-08 00:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1685428, 227017, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>Nice work on this. Not only a good capture of some bright contrast on the child''s face, but also the child''s personality. The DOF is also really good to keep all attention on the girl. Excellent photo.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 Nice work on this. Not only a good capture of some bright contrast on the child''s face, but also the child''s personality. The DOF is also really good to keep all attention on the girl. Excellent photo.', '2005-09-08 00:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
