(1685452, 226982, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>The only high contrast I see is a blown out forehead which is probably from an on-camera flash. Move the flash off-camera, work on the overall exposure, and use a controlled background, maybe solid white with this shot, and it might''ve worked better.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 The only high contrast I see is a blown out forehead which is probably from an on-camera flash. Move the flash off-camera, work on the overall exposure, and use a controlled background, maybe solid white with this shot, and it might''ve worked better.', '2005-09-08 00:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
