(1686150, 224736, 38925, '<td valign="top">one of the best, really nice shot</td>', 'one of the best, really nice shot', '2005-09-08 09:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686152, 225948, 38925, '<td valign="top">amazing one, i really like it</td>', 'amazing one, i really like it', '2005-09-08 09:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686154, 225147, 38925, '<td valign="top">i like it, really nice one</td>', 'i like it, really nice one', '2005-09-08 09:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686156, 226390, 38925, '<td valign="top">amazing shot, i really like it</td>', 'amazing shot, i really like it', '2005-09-08 09:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686162, 226665, 22517, '<td valign="top">I like the person in the picture, but am also wondering how it would look without... overaal, great colours and contrast. Only thing bugging me is the sky: it looks manipulated and doesn''t match the reflection in the water. Composition is great.</td>', 'I like the person in the picture, but am also wondering how it would look without... overaal, great colours and contrast. Only thing bugging me is the sky: it looks manipulated and doesn''t match the reflection in the water. Composition is great.', '2005-09-08 09:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686190, 226904, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is very vivid and the contrast is there. With it being mostly clouds and not the expected color, it almost seems surreal to me.  There is a slight sense of out of focus, but that''s probably because of the cloudy subject matter.</td>', 'This is very vivid and the contrast is there. With it being mostly clouds and not the expected color, it almost seems surreal to me.  There is a slight sense of out of focus, but that''s probably because of the cloudy subject matter.', '2005-09-08 09:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686193, 226180, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  Turquoise is an interesting take on the castle but with the black detailing and the white sky, I definitely think the contrast works.  The angle of the shot is interesting from the ground up.  I like the angular geometry of the architecture.</td>', 'I like this alot.  Turquoise is an interesting take on the castle but with the black detailing and the white sky, I definitely think the contrast works.  The angle of the shot is interesting from the ground up.  I like the angular geometry of the architecture.', '2005-09-08 09:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686199, 226504, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the graphic urban sensibility of this shot. The movement of the guy walking down the street is caught mid stride. Definitely high contrast.</td>', 'I like the graphic urban sensibility of this shot. The movement of the guy walking down the street is caught mid stride. Definitely high contrast.', '2005-09-08 09:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686201, 227030, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the point of view of your shot and for me, there is a good use of high contrast - especailly on the left half of your photo. Well done.</td>', 'I like the point of view of your shot and for me, there is a good use of high contrast - especailly on the left half of your photo. Well done.', '2005-09-08 09:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686204, 226652, 15711, '<td valign="top">Architectural shots are always appealing to me.  I like the contrast of the brick with the wood and the coloration as well. The varying shapes of the windows and doors make for an interesting image. I like the reflection in the upper window too.  The fact that it''s not quite level with the bottom adds to its appeal.</td>', 'Architectural shots are always appealing to me.  I like the contrast of the brick with the wood and the coloration as well. The varying shapes of the windows and doors make for an interesting image. I like the reflection in the upper window too.  The fact that it''s not quite level with the bottom adds to its appeal.', '2005-09-08 09:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686205, 226657, 41675, '<td valign="top">You have some good, strong contrast in the middle of your photo, but for me I wonder if this would have a greater impact if the wall on the right side was cropped out completely? Nice photo.</td>', 'You have some good, strong contrast in the middle of your photo, but for me I wonder if this would have a greater impact if the wall on the right side was cropped out completely? Nice photo.', '2005-09-08 09:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686207, 227030, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line here. The contrast is there not only in light and dark tones but the contrast between the rocky edge and the smooth water.</td>', 'Nice leading line here. The contrast is there not only in light and dark tones but the contrast between the rocky edge and the smooth water.', '2005-09-08 09:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686209, 226390, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the leading line of this.  The graininess of it is interesting and the human element amidst the architectural is always appealing to me.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the leading line of this.  The graininess of it is interesting and the human element amidst the architectural is always appealing to me.  Nicely done.', '2005-09-08 09:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686211, 226914, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the border is just a bit too wide - maybe a hairline border would be less distracting. Good contrast in the bottom half of the photo. Crisp and clean.</td>', 'For me, the border is just a bit too wide - maybe a hairline border would be less distracting. Good contrast in the bottom half of the photo. Crisp and clean.', '2005-09-08 09:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686213, 227085, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the angular sense of this.  Nice contrast between the scuplture white and the blue sky. Also the golden tone of the building below adds to the opposing colors. The pink of the shirt adds a nice pop of color and helps ground the shot.</td>', 'I like the angular sense of this.  Nice contrast between the scuplture white and the blue sky. Also the golden tone of the building below adds to the opposing colors. The pink of the shirt adds a nice pop of color and helps ground the shot.', '2005-09-08 09:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686216, 226942, 41675, '<td valign="top">If there was a bit less "dust" on the table it would have an even greater impact. Nice composition and idea.</td>', 'If there was a bit less "dust" on the table it would have an even greater impact. Nice composition and idea.', '2005-09-08 09:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686219, 225981, 41675, '<td valign="top">It took my eyes a second to find the flowers as they blend in with the building itself and are lost. For me, this lacks the "wow" factor of other entries, but I like the angle you chose. Good effort.</td>', 'It took my eyes a second to find the flowers as they blend in with the building itself and are lost. For me, this lacks the "wow" factor of other entries, but I like the angle you chose. Good effort.', '2005-09-08 09:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686223, 226759, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the candid sense of this.  The "do not cross" tape makes your eye go from side to side and ties in with the yellow of their hats.  The contrast of the water against the dark background works as well.  Looks like something you''d see in Life magazine.</td>', 'I like the candid sense of this.  The "do not cross" tape makes your eye go from side to side and ties in with the yellow of their hats.  The contrast of the water against the dark background works as well.  Looks like something you''d see in Life magazine.', '2005-09-08 09:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686224, 225529, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good contrasting colors. I like the item on the left, but the one on the right is slightly overpowering, for me - like it''s trying to..."push" the other object out of the photo. (Sorry, not all that great at the techincal critiques).</td>', 'Good contrasting colors. I like the item on the left, but the one on the right is slightly overpowering, for me - like it''s trying to..."push" the other object out of the photo. (Sorry, not all that great at the techincal critiques).', '2005-09-08 09:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686230, 225702, 41675, '<td valign="top">Had the whites been brighter, I would have scored this higher. For me, the tones are more...subdued than high contrast. Cool angle though. :)</td>', 'Had the whites been brighter, I would have scored this higher. For me, the tones are more...subdued than high contrast. Cool angle though. :)', '2005-09-08 09:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686240, 226979, 41675, '<td valign="top">A good balance of contrast. My eyes kind of stop at the tree in the middle, but not bad.</td>', 'A good balance of contrast. My eyes kind of stop at the tree in the middle, but not bad.', '2005-09-08 09:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686244, 225164, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like it. Good contrast, and the hat keeps the photo from being...boring. Hope you score well with this one.</td>', 'I like it. Good contrast, and the hat keeps the photo from being...boring. Hope you score well with this one.', '2005-09-08 09:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686245, 225940, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is definitely high contrast but the angle is a bit awkward to me.  I''d like to see a full profile or a straight on shot.  Horses have such interesting anatomy - I''d like to see more of it in this imaget. The shadowing under his chin is good and the light from one side is helping to create the contrast you are looking for, but it falls a tad short for me since he''s "slimmed down" by the angle of the shot. 7</td>', 'This is definitely high contrast but the angle is a bit awkward to me.  I''d like to see a full profile or a straight on shot.  Horses have such interesting anatomy - I''d like to see more of it in this imaget. The shadowing under his chin is good and the light from one side is helping to create the contrast you are looking for, but it falls a tad short for me since he''s "slimmed down" by the angle of the shot. 7', '2005-09-08 09:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686247, 226557, 15711, '<td valign="top">From a glance, I thought it was Fidel Castro on the keyboard!!  Nice angle to the shot. The contrast is definitely there. I like the movement of his fingers and the appearance that he''s singing. The lighting is well done too.</td>', 'From a glance, I thought it was Fidel Castro on the keyboard!!  Nice angle to the shot. The contrast is definitely there. I like the movement of his fingers and the appearance that he''s singing. The lighting is well done too.', '2005-09-08 09:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1686253, 226692, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a great image. Makes me think of my Dad. I hope this does well for you 9!</td>', 'Wow! What a great image. Makes me think of my Dad. I hope this does well for you 9!', '2005-09-08 09:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
