(1688524, 226763, 34659, '<td valign="top">Ya know, this is fantastic of the butterfly and it''s great contrasts.  I personally am not crazy about the crop though.  I think it would be much more impactful if you moved him toward one corner.  Just my 2 cents - beautiful shot.</td>', 'Ya know, this is fantastic of the butterfly and it''s great contrasts.  I personally am not crazy about the crop though.  I think it would be much more impactful if you moved him toward one corner.  Just my 2 cents - beautiful shot.', '2005-09-08 21:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688540, 225711, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job.  Simple, clean, perfectly meets the challenge, and is pleasing visually.  My only suggestion would be to deepen the tones of the yellow and blue - they are a little lighter than I think is necessary (and I realize that you''ve got light &amp; shadow contrasts going on here too).  Great work.</td>', 'Beautiful job.  Simple, clean, perfectly meets the challenge, and is pleasing visually.  My only suggestion would be to deepen the tones of the yellow and blue - they are a little lighter than I think is necessary (and I realize that you''ve got light & shadow contrasts going on here too).  Great work.', '2005-09-08 21:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688549, 225108, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very visually pleasing composition.  I do wonder what the **** it is though.  ;-)  That aside, you''ve got nice tones and good light/shadow.  I wouldn''t mind seeing the "space" at the top in a deeper color, but this is a good solid entry.</td>', 'Very visually pleasing composition.  I do wonder what the **** it is though.  ;-)  That aside, you''ve got nice tones and good light/shadow.  I wouldn''t mind seeing the "space" at the top in a deeper color, but this is a good solid entry.', '2005-09-08 22:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
