(1688666, 225861, 34659, '<td valign="top">Have never been to Australia, but want to get there one day.  This shot is absolutely beautiful.  Great tones in the sky and nice silhouettes in the foreground.  Good focus and composition too.  Can''t believe all the detail you got in the sky.  Nice job.</td>', 'Have never been to Australia, but want to get there one day.  This shot is absolutely beautiful.  Great tones in the sky and nice silhouettes in the foreground.  Good focus and composition too.  Can''t believe all the detail you got in the sky.  Nice job.', '2005-09-08 22:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
