(1688680, 226358, 34659, '<td valign="top">I''ll be the first to admit that I''m usually not crazy about cat shots, but this image has some solid merit to it.  Great composition and crop to really emphasize the eyes.  Good focus too.  I do think that the highlights are a bit blown in spots and could manage to be just as "high contrast" against the black shadows without being blown.  Other than that - really nice job.</td>', 'I''ll be the first to admit that I''m usually not crazy about cat shots, but this image has some solid merit to it.  Great composition and crop to really emphasize the eyes.  Good focus too.  I do think that the highlights are a bit blown in spots and could manage to be just as "high contrast" against the black shadows without being blown.  Other than that - really nice job.', '2005-09-08 22:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688683, 227094, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  I like the playful angle (almost fisheye appearance) of the shot and the crop.  Good focus and nice tones.</td>', 'Cute shot.  I like the playful angle (almost fisheye appearance) of the shot and the crop.  Good focus and nice tones.', '2005-09-08 22:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688685, 227083, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great high key feel to a very visually appealing shot.  Love the crop and the dark eye.  Nice job.</td>', 'Great high key feel to a very visually appealing shot.  Love the crop and the dark eye.  Nice job.', '2005-09-08 22:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688686, 226758, 32285, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  9</td>', 'Great shot!  9', '2005-09-08 22:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688696, 225945, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really incredible clarity for a night shot this far away.  Love the color tones and focus.  The angle seems a bit off to me though - not far enough off horizontal to be artistic and not close enough to horizontal to be straight.  Know what I mean?  Anyway, I still like the image and think it''s a strong entry.</td>', 'Really incredible clarity for a night shot this far away.  Love the color tones and focus.  The angle seems a bit off to me though - not far enough off horizontal to be artistic and not close enough to horizontal to be straight.  Know what I mean?  Anyway, I still like the image and think it''s a strong entry.', '2005-09-08 22:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688704, 226521, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve seen this landscape before (but I don''t recall off-hand who shot it).  Anyway, it''s still beautiful.  I think you got some great tonal ranges here, but the sky is a distraction.  I actually think the image would be stronger with a tighter crop on the top - eliminating the buildings, sky, forest, etc.  Still, this is a very strong entry and a shot that I think is beautiful.</td>', 'I think I''ve seen this landscape before (but I don''t recall off-hand who shot it).  Anyway, it''s still beautiful.  I think you got some great tonal ranges here, but the sky is a distraction.  I actually think the image would be stronger with a tighter crop on the top - eliminating the buildings, sky, forest, etc.  Still, this is a very strong entry and a shot that I think is beautiful.', '2005-09-08 22:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688709, 225955, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is really cool.  Love the vivid color tones.  My only minor criticism is that it''s off horizontally (just a bit, but still noticeable).  Otherwise, great entry.</td>', 'This is really cool.  Love the vivid color tones.  My only minor criticism is that it''s off horizontally (just a bit, but still noticeable).  Otherwise, great entry.', '2005-09-08 22:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
