(1688731, 224971, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think I recognize this model...  ;-)  Great pose and contrasting tones here.  Ya know, the highlights are right on the edge of being blown, but because the blacks are so dark they actually work.  Really nice crop - and I love her lips!  Very strong entry.</td>', 'I think I recognize this model...  ;-)  Great pose and contrasting tones here.  Ya know, the highlights are right on the edge of being blown, but because the blacks are so dark they actually work.  Really nice crop - and I love her lips!  Very strong entry.', '2005-09-08 22:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
