(1688738, 225680, 34659, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and I think the border works, but the horizon seems tilted to me.  The lean of the buildings is distracting.  I think the highlights are also a little strong, but you''ve got good focus &amp; DOF.</td>', 'Interesting composition and I think the border works, but the horizon seems tilted to me.  The lean of the buildings is distracting.  I think the highlights are also a little strong, but you''ve got good focus & DOF.', '2005-09-08 22:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688749, 227049, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is simply outstanding.  The more I examine it, the more I appreciate all that apparently went into it.  Great choice of placement of the darker chaffs and placing the lightest in the center balances it nicely.  The little details here really make this image spectacular.  The fact that the wheat is in front of the border line (which also works surprisingly well - perfect color choice), the tack sharp focus, the leading lines...  What else can I say.  Fantastic work.  IMHO one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'This is simply outstanding.  The more I examine it, the more I appreciate all that apparently went into it.  Great choice of placement of the darker chaffs and placing the lightest in the center balances it nicely.  The little details here really make this image spectacular.  The fact that the wheat is in front of the border line (which also works surprisingly well - perfect color choice), the tack sharp focus, the leading lines...  What else can I say.  Fantastic work.  IMHO one of the best in the challenge.', '2005-09-08 22:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688753, 226082, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great composition here.  The viewer can instantly ascertain that there was an argument or some other contact/conflict here resulting in someone leaving.  Surprisingly emotive shot.  Love the shadows and somewhat muted color tones.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Great composition here.  The viewer can instantly ascertain that there was an argument or some other contact/conflict here resulting in someone leaving.  Surprisingly emotive shot.  Love the shadows and somewhat muted color tones.  Very nice work.', '2005-09-08 22:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688758, 227061, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool capture!  Tack sharp focus with good DOF too.  My only suggestion would be that the color tones could be bumped up a hair.  The composition is outstanding.  Great job.</td>', 'This is such a cool capture!  Tack sharp focus with good DOF too.  My only suggestion would be that the color tones could be bumped up a hair.  The composition is outstanding.  Great job.', '2005-09-08 22:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
