(1688977, 226014, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  --- 7 --</td>', 'Great shot.  --- 7 --', '2005-09-09 00:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688984, 225148, 40977, '<td valign="top">Third stop and I have gone back and forth on how to rate this shot.  It is one of those love it or leave it shots IMO....I personally love it.  Great Job. 9</td>', 'Third stop and I have gone back and forth on how to rate this shot.  It is one of those love it or leave it shots IMO....I personally love it.  Great Job. 9', '2005-09-09 00:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688986, 226823, 40977, '<td valign="top">What a great job -- 9 --</td>', 'What a great job -- 9 --', '2005-09-09 00:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688987, 226734, 40977, '<td valign="top">Love the shot.  I cannot decide for myself it a tighter crop would have looked better. The still water does add to the shot.  Great Job!!!!  bumping to a 9!!!</td>', 'Love the shot.  I cannot decide for myself it a tighter crop would have looked better. The still water does add to the shot.  Great Job!!!!  bumping to a 9!!!', '2005-09-09 00:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688988, 224736, 40977, '<td valign="top">Wow....This is an amazing shot.  Really wonderful. The placid water with the reflection and the greenery....Just Lovely  --- 9</td>', 'Wow....This is an amazing shot.  Really wonderful. The placid water with the reflection and the greenery....Just Lovely  --- 9', '2005-09-09 00:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688989, 227084, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great Shot and the colors are amazing.  Should do very well.</td>', 'Great Shot and the colors are amazing.  Should do very well.', '2005-09-09 00:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688991, 226862, 40977, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors....wish the closer swans reflection was in the shot, but it is an incredible capture regardless.  Great Job!!!</td>', 'Amazing colors....wish the closer swans reflection was in the shot, but it is an incredible capture regardless.  Great Job!!!', '2005-09-09 00:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688993, 226078, 40977, '<td valign="top">Wow....Amazing shot.</td>', 'Wow....Amazing shot.', '2005-09-09 00:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688996, 227096, 40977, '<td valign="top">Lovely Shot....Great Job.</td>', 'Lovely Shot....Great Job.', '2005-09-09 00:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1688998, 227051, 40977, '<td valign="top">Love the colros, not sure if the hot spots on the hibiscus are from the level adjustments, but is a bit distracting.  Still a wonderful shot  EDIT--  Bumped to a 7</td>', 'Love the colros, not sure if the hot spots on the hibiscus are from the level adjustments, but is a bit distracting.  Still a wonderful shot  EDIT--  Bumped to a 7', '2005-09-09 00:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689000, 225861, 40977, '<td valign="top">Really a wonderfull shot.  Could have been doubled entered in both HC and Branches....Gr8 job.</td>', 'Really a wonderfull shot.  Could have been doubled entered in both HC and Branches....Gr8 job.', '2005-09-09 00:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689001, 225690, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great Job!!  This shot deserves to do well.  Good Luck</td>', 'Great Job!!  This shot deserves to do well.  Good Luck', '2005-09-09 00:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689010, 226558, 25921, '<td valign="top">Beautifully backlit image.  I would clone out the little green flare spot below the sun.  Still great shot.  8</td>', 'Beautifully backlit image.  I would clone out the little green flare spot below the sun.  Still great shot.  8', '2005-09-09 00:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689017, 227061, 25921, '<td valign="top">Cute picture but I don''t think it works to well for the challenge.</td>', 'Cute picture but I don''t think it works to well for the challenge.', '2005-09-09 00:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689021, 226402, 25921, '<td valign="top">Good job filling the frame.   Lots of  visual interest and fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Good job filling the frame.   Lots of  visual interest and fits the challenge well.', '2005-09-09 00:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689037, 226641, 25921, '<td valign="top">The white subject does not fill nearly enough of the frame.  Its dead center which typically makes for a boring compostion.  It would help to move it to one of the thirds.   The background is also extremely cluttered making it very hard for your eyes to find a place to rest.</td>', 'The white subject does not fill nearly enough of the frame.  Its dead center which typically makes for a boring compostion.  It would help to move it to one of the thirds.   The background is also extremely cluttered making it very hard for your eyes to find a place to rest.', '2005-09-09 00:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689044, 225807, 25921, '<td valign="top">While this is a nice image, it isn''t that contrasty.  I don''t see any true white and very little true black.   Also I would drop the parantheses all together.</td>', 'While this is a nice image, it isn''t that contrasty.  I don''t see any true white and very little true black.   Also I would drop the parantheses all together.', '2005-09-09 00:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689075, 226098, 25921, '<td valign="top">Seems a little grainy</td>', 'Seems a little grainy', '2005-09-09 00:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689081, 226823, 25921, '<td valign="top">I love the artistic feel to this.</td>', 'I love the artistic feel to this.', '2005-09-09 00:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689091, 226603, 40584, '<td valign="top">very nice!  almost too oversharpened, but just almost.  looks like 3-D!!</td>', 'very nice!  almost too oversharpened, but just almost.  looks like 3-D!!', '2005-09-09 00:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689099, 226916, 40584, '<td valign="top">this caught my eye right away!  beautiful shot.  really nice details in the wood grains</td>', 'this caught my eye right away!  beautiful shot.  really nice details in the wood grains', '2005-09-09 00:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689105, 226537, 40584, '<td valign="top">shot seems a bit out of focus.  I think sharpening would help with all the intricate details of the specimen</td>', 'shot seems a bit out of focus.  I think sharpening would help with all the intricate details of the specimen', '2005-09-09 00:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689108, 226684, 40584, '<td valign="top">great character shot!  not sure how it fits theme, though</td>', 'great character shot!  not sure how it fits theme, though', '2005-09-09 00:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689113, 225683, 40584, '<td valign="top">fuzzy and overprocessed.</td>', 'fuzzy and overprocessed.', '2005-09-09 00:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689115, 225978, 40584, '<td valign="top">when it comes to shaving, I''ll stick to a razor, thank you!  Really ''hot'' shot!  wonder how you did it!</td>', 'when it comes to shaving, I''ll stick to a razor, thank you!  Really ''hot'' shot!  wonder how you did it!', '2005-09-09 00:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689120, 226084, 42005, '<td valign="top">I have waded through over 300 photos and this one takes my eye. IT is precise and clean and oh so Patriotic.</td>', 'I have waded through over 300 photos and this one takes my eye. IT is precise and clean and oh so Patriotic.', '2005-09-09 00:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689121, 226796, 40584, '<td valign="top">very nice! love the detail and the intricate shadows on the petals</td>', 'very nice! love the detail and the intricate shadows on the petals', '2005-09-09 00:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689133, 227073, 42005, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to hear the music that probably is playing with the wather accompanying. I enjoy this photo!</td>', 'Makes me want to hear the music that probably is playing with the wather accompanying. I enjoy this photo!', '2005-09-09 00:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689137, 226000, 40584, '<td valign="top">A superb character shot!  This would make a terrific portrait.  You''ve really captured his personality.  Not sure how it works with the theme, but love the shot!</td>', 'A superb character shot!  This would make a terrific portrait.  You''ve really captured his personality.  Not sure how it works with the theme, but love the shot!', '2005-09-09 00:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689140, 225811, 40584, '<td valign="top">so far this is the best flower subject I''ve seen!  Not oversharpened; pleasing to the eye.<br/>2nd run through:  If I could vote, I''d score this a 9.0!  One of the top three flower shots.</td>', 'so far this is the best flower subject I''ve seen!  Not oversharpened; pleasing to the eye.2nd run through:  If I could vote, I''d score this a 9.0!  One of the top three flower shots.', '2005-09-09 00:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689141, 224743, 29904, '<td valign="top">This is a nice treatment of an ordinary scene.  It is a bit busy tho, I would have cropped out the ''stuff'' on the right but not the edge of the desk.</td>', 'This is a nice treatment of an ordinary scene.  It is a bit busy tho, I would have cropped out the ''stuff'' on the right but not the edge of the desk.', '2005-09-09 00:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689147, 225426, 42005, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2005-09-09 00:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689148, 226097, 39483, '<td valign="top">What an amazing photo. I love the gradual misty feel to it... and the contrast is indeed really high contrast! <br/>I do wonder though if a tighter crop might have made it even better, at least IMHO. It seems that there is a lot of sky AND a lot of grassy foreground... maybe choosing one or the other? But in any case, well done! a 10</td>', 'What an amazing photo. I love the gradual misty feel to it... and the contrast is indeed really high contrast! I do wonder though if a tighter crop might have made it even better, at least IMHO. It seems that there is a lot of sky AND a lot of grassy foreground... maybe choosing one or the other? But in any case, well done! a 10', '2005-09-09 00:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689152, 226734, 39483, '<td valign="top">WOW! what a picture. The composition is perfect with room for the ducks to swim and the high contrast is great! I love how the water blends together into nothingness and pure white! And you can still see the wake of the ducks! I hope you score high! <br/> <br/>Edit: after finishing voting on all the other entries, yours is a favorite! a perfect 10</td>', 'WOW! what a picture. The composition is perfect with room for the ducks to swim and the high contrast is great! I love how the water blends together into nothingness and pure white! And you can still see the wake of the ducks! I hope you score high!  Edit: after finishing voting on all the other entries, yours is a favorite! a perfect 10', '2005-09-09 00:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689158, 226904, 39483, '<td valign="top">I really like the color and the puff of cloud that competes with the towers.  Great editing and composition. I might have been tempted to crop out just a bit more of the sky on top IMHO...but in any case, well done!</td>', 'I really like the color and the puff of cloud that competes with the towers.  Great editing and composition. I might have been tempted to crop out just a bit more of the sky on top IMHO...but in any case, well done!', '2005-09-09 01:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689167, 227096, 39483, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I love the glassy feel of the water and the silhouettes with their refections! <br/>that lonely bird on the right does make it even better as it hints of a story for our minds to create... very well done and high contrast as well! good luck</td>', 'Nice capture. I love the glassy feel of the water and the silhouettes with their refections! that lonely bird on the right does make it even better as it hints of a story for our minds to create... very well done and high contrast as well! good luck', '2005-09-09 01:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689189, 225298, 29904, '<td valign="top">not high contrast enough IMO - too much gray not enough black.</td>', 'not high contrast enough IMO - too much gray not enough black.', '2005-09-09 01:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689217, 226669, 10848, '<td valign="top">I really like this, I am sure some will say that it is too bright taking away all detail, but I like the dark contrast of the daisy and the catepillar, nice shot! 9</td>', 'I really like this, I am sure some will say that it is too bright taking away all detail, but I like the dark contrast of the daisy and the catepillar, nice shot! 9', '2005-09-09 01:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689221, 225223, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wow wonderful colors and very rustic feel, wonderful composition, the  angle of the shot really enhances this image. 9</td>', 'Wow wonderful colors and very rustic feel, wonderful composition, the  angle of the shot really enhances this image. 9', '2005-09-09 01:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689227, 224248, 10848, '<td valign="top">Ewww, very interesting. Great idea, nothing more mystical than the eye of a cat.</td>', 'Ewww, very interesting. Great idea, nothing more mystical than the eye of a cat.', '2005-09-09 01:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689234, 225248, 10848, '<td valign="top">Now this is great, looks like the cover of a CD. The higher contrast on this shot really accentuates the effect.9</td>', 'Now this is great, looks like the cover of a CD. The higher contrast on this shot really accentuates the effect.9', '2005-09-09 01:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689236, 226940, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, the b&amp;w and the higher contrast makes this shot even more effective. 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot, the b&w and the higher contrast makes this shot even more effective. 10', '2005-09-09 01:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689237, 227032, 33672, '<td valign="top">It may quell the artistic spirit but identifiable subjects seem to score better here.</td>', 'It may quell the artistic spirit but identifiable subjects seem to score better here.', '2005-09-09 01:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689238, 225407, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice, heartwarming portrait.  I do not see a whole lot of contrast however, perhaps your contrast focus was between the boy and his shadow?  I can''t really tell.  That said, your model has a wonderful expression, the lighting looks pretty good, the focus looks a bit soft, but I''m not sure if that''s intentional or not.  Either way I don''t think it takes away from the image.  I''m not sure whether black &amp; white was the best tone for this picture - perhaps a choice brought on by the challenge? Black &amp; white does seem to be the option of choice when going for a high contrast.  All in all I gave it a 5.</td>', 'Nice, heartwarming portrait.  I do not see a whole lot of contrast however, perhaps your contrast focus was between the boy and his shadow?  I can''t really tell.  That said, your model has a wonderful expression, the lighting looks pretty good, the focus looks a bit soft, but I''m not sure if that''s intentional or not.  Either way I don''t think it takes away from the image.  I''m not sure whether black & white was the best tone for this picture - perhaps a choice brought on by the challenge? Black & white does seem to be the option of choice when going for a high contrast.  All in all I gave it a 5.', '2005-09-09 01:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689239, 225316, 29904, '<td valign="top">Cool but a bit grainy.  Nice infrared.  Nice perspective.</td>', 'Cool but a bit grainy.  Nice infrared.  Nice perspective.', '2005-09-09 01:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689243, 225738, 33672, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t do much for me,,, sorry. There really isn''t high contrast and the light is a bit harsh.</td>', 'Doesn''t do much for me,,, sorry. There really isn''t high contrast and the light is a bit harsh.', '2005-09-09 01:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689245, 225443, 10848, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot, the higher contrast really accentuates her eyes. 10</td>', 'Outstanding shot, the higher contrast really accentuates her eyes. 10', '2005-09-09 01:42:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1689247, 225533, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution. One of my favorites of the theme,</td>', 'Great idea and execution. One of my favorites of the theme,', '2005-09-09 01:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689248, 226823, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wow this is nice, looks like a Norman Rockwell painting. 9</td>', 'Wow this is nice, looks like a Norman Rockwell painting. 9', '2005-09-09 01:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689249, 226192, 11923, '<td valign="top">Definitely a nice black-white tonal range, though the blown out white is a tad distracting.  The subject has some good lines which help add interest and it seems to meet the challenge to me.  I''m not entirely inspired by the subject matter, and I would personally prefer a wider focal range.  That said I think its a good example of high contrast.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'Definitely a nice black-white tonal range, though the blown out white is a tad distracting.  The subject has some good lines which help add interest and it seems to meet the challenge to me.  I''m not entirely inspired by the subject matter, and I would personally prefer a wider focal range.  That said I think its a good example of high contrast.  I gave a 6.', '2005-09-09 01:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689250, 224855, 10848, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like it. 9</td>', 'Very nice, I like it. 9', '2005-09-09 01:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689252, 225248, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp,  Interesting photo.Maybe a tighter crop.</td>', 'Nice comp,  Interesting photo.Maybe a tighter crop.', '2005-09-09 01:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689253, 226674, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  There is a nice crispness to much of the photograph and the black &amp; white does give it instant contrast to some extent.  I find the subject matter to be of great interest as for some reason - possibly your post processing? - it looks almost as if the silos were placed in the picture, as if they don''t belong there, even though its clear they do.  Strange but interesting.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'Very nice image.  There is a nice crispness to much of the photograph and the black & white does give it instant contrast to some extent.  I find the subject matter to be of great interest as for some reason - possibly your post processing? - it looks almost as if the silos were placed in the picture, as if they don''t belong there, even though its clear they do.  Strange but interesting.  I gave a 6.', '2005-09-09 01:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689254, 226999, 10848, '<td valign="top">Outstanding vivid colors.</td>', 'Outstanding vivid colors.', '2005-09-09 01:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689255, 224855, 29904, '<td valign="top">;)  !</td>', ';)  !', '2005-09-09 01:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689257, 226694, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Very dramatic, yet simple, I like it. 8</td>', 'Wonderful image. Very dramatic, yet simple, I like it. 8', '2005-09-09 01:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689260, 227094, 10848, '<td valign="top">Precious! Love that smile! 10</td>', 'Precious! Love that smile! 10', '2005-09-09 01:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689261, 224484, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great colors and obvious contrasts among them.  Subject is interesting in its brilliance of color though the bugs themselves aren''t that keen to me.  I''m not sure what it is about the image though that is slightly offputting.  It feels.. dull.. even though the colors clearly stand out.  Almost flat I guess, I''m not sure what lighting you used but it seems to lack a luminosity that I''m expecting I guess.  I also wish there was just a bit crisper focus.  Still it is a solid image, I gave a 5.</td>', 'Great colors and obvious contrasts among them.  Subject is interesting in its brilliance of color though the bugs themselves aren''t that keen to me.  I''m not sure what it is about the image though that is slightly offputting.  It feels.. dull.. even though the colors clearly stand out.  Almost flat I guess, I''m not sure what lighting you used but it seems to lack a luminosity that I''m expecting I guess.  I also wish there was just a bit crisper focus.  Still it is a solid image, I gave a 5.', '2005-09-09 01:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689262, 226478, 10848, '<td valign="top">WOW, my favorite so far! Outstanding detail. 10</td>', 'WOW, my favorite so far! Outstanding detail. 10', '2005-09-09 01:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689265, 225533, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wild! Kinda spooky too, wonderful detail and just the right amount of contrast to make it more effective. 9</td>', 'Wild! Kinda spooky too, wonderful detail and just the right amount of contrast to make it more effective. 9', '2005-09-09 01:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689266, 227110, 11923, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the challenge in my mind, and the way the flowers pop out from the darker background adds interest.  I also like the fact that you didn''t go for a flat, pitch black background.  The shadows of the leaves/stems give some nice texture and pattern which boosts the interest factor.  If I were to change some things I''d rather there was a little more luminocity to the white petals, its almost there but in my mind if the.. ''glowed'' just a bit more then I think the "wow" would be a bit bigger.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'Certainly meets the challenge in my mind, and the way the flowers pop out from the darker background adds interest.  I also like the fact that you didn''t go for a flat, pitch black background.  The shadows of the leaves/stems give some nice texture and pattern which boosts the interest factor.  If I were to change some things I''d rather there was a little more luminocity to the white petals, its almost there but in my mind if the.. ''glowed'' just a bit more then I think the "wow" would be a bit bigger.  I gave a 6.', '2005-09-09 01:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689268, 226959, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is amazing, the way you managed to capture the moon in between the branches is very effective, top ten IMHO. 10</td>', 'This is amazing, the way you managed to capture the moon in between the branches is very effective, top ten IMHO. 10', '2005-09-09 01:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689272, 226370, 10848, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous! 9</td>', 'Simply gorgeous! 9', '2005-09-09 01:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689274, 226824, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture.  Can''t really go wrong with a praying mantis in general.  I''m not seeing a whole lot of high contrast however and I think the subject, knowing that it is usually a gorgeous vivid green, is not being displayed to its best advantage in a black/white tone.  The lighting is good, fairly even for the most part, composition works to show off the body very well.  The focus is a bit sketchy, I wish the whole insect was in sharp focus instead of the middle part of its body.  I definitely think the high contrast is missing here though as the whole image seems to be a wash of grey for the most part.  I gave a 5.</td>', 'Very cool picture.  Can''t really go wrong with a praying mantis in general.  I''m not seeing a whole lot of high contrast however and I think the subject, knowing that it is usually a gorgeous vivid green, is not being displayed to its best advantage in a black/white tone.  The lighting is good, fairly even for the most part, composition works to show off the body very well.  The focus is a bit sketchy, I wish the whole insect was in sharp focus instead of the middle part of its body.  I definitely think the high contrast is missing here though as the whole image seems to be a wash of grey for the most part.  I gave a 5.', '2005-09-09 01:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689279, 226209, 10848, '<td valign="top">Amazing image, I love the lighting, the shadows and light. 9</td>', 'Amazing image, I love the lighting, the shadows and light. 9', '2005-09-09 01:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689284, 226656, 11923, '<td valign="top">Goodness, well there''s quite the contrast here all over the place.  The faceless figure is a bit disconcerting but nonetheless I think the focus is good, nice use of lights and the two clear yet seperate interest points is a nice change.  I think my only gripe is that I can''t, for the life of me, figure out what is on the desk next to that main mannequin.   It seems very busy and I think a lot of detail about it has been lost, which if the details of it aren''t important then the item itself probably isn''t important and thus is just clutter.  Other than that I like the composition and the use of black &amp; white - which seems to be many people''s idea of instant high contrast - actually works here.  Nicely done.  I gave a 7.</td>', 'Goodness, well there''s quite the contrast here all over the place.  The faceless figure is a bit disconcerting but nonetheless I think the focus is good, nice use of lights and the two clear yet seperate interest points is a nice change.  I think my only gripe is that I can''t, for the life of me, figure out what is on the desk next to that main mannequin.   It seems very busy and I think a lot of detail about it has been lost, which if the details of it aren''t important then the item itself probably isn''t important and thus is just clutter.  Other than that I like the composition and the use of black & white - which seems to be many people''s idea of instant high contrast - actually works here.  Nicely done.  I gave a 7.', '2005-09-09 01:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689288, 226503, 11923, '<td valign="top">Whew, talk about a busy photo.  I can, of course, see contrast all over, but I''m not sure it does the image good to have so many focal points.  Obviously you can''t do a whole lot about the flowerbeds and trees but I think focusing on one aspect of high contrast, either the white against the brilliant color of nature or the white vs the deep blue windows would''ve made this image stronger.  As it is now I keep bouncing my eyes all over the place looking for somewhere to rest them and get drawn in.  As a personal preference, if you could''ve isolated the white vs the blue, I think the contrasts would''ve been much more pleasing and more interesting.  I gave a 5.</td>', 'Whew, talk about a busy photo.  I can, of course, see contrast all over, but I''m not sure it does the image good to have so many focal points.  Obviously you can''t do a whole lot about the flowerbeds and trees but I think focusing on one aspect of high contrast, either the white against the brilliant color of nature or the white vs the deep blue windows would''ve made this image stronger.  As it is now I keep bouncing my eyes all over the place looking for somewhere to rest them and get drawn in.  As a personal preference, if you could''ve isolated the white vs the blue, I think the contrasts would''ve been much more pleasing and more interesting.  I gave a 5.', '2005-09-09 02:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689295, 226782, 11923, '<td valign="top">Hehe.  Nice contrast.  I like the direction you took, going for a historical contrast rather than a visual one (e.g. black &amp; white, etc).  I think the portrait is good, lighting is decent and the armor certainly adds quite a bit of interest.  Focus looks pretty good too.  I do have three areas I''d change.  First I would''ve gone for a neutral background - probably black to emphasize the shine of the armor and get the distracting wood panels in the background out.  Second, the title references the cellphone and thus the high contrast - however looking at the picture it is tucked away in the hand too much and isn''t quite obvious enough, perhaps a turn of the hand so more of the cell phone was visible might bring it to the attention more.   Lastly, the crop of the image makes it feel very cramped, like too much has been squashed in, with a flat one color background, a wider frame might been easier to have because you wouldn''t have to worry about cropping out distracting elements and this would give the photo more room too breath and relax just a bit.  Very nice idea, interesting subject, I gave a 6.</td>', 'Hehe.  Nice contrast.  I like the direction you took, going for a historical contrast rather than a visual one (e.g. black & white, etc).  I think the portrait is good, lighting is decent and the armor certainly adds quite a bit of interest.  Focus looks pretty good too.  I do have three areas I''d change.  First I would''ve gone for a neutral background - probably black to emphasize the shine of the armor and get the distracting wood panels in the background out.  Second, the title references the cellphone and thus the high contrast - however looking at the picture it is tucked away in the hand too much and isn''t quite obvious enough, perhaps a turn of the hand so more of the cell phone was visible might bring it to the attention more.   Lastly, the crop of the image makes it feel very cramped, like too much has been squashed in, with a flat one color background, a wider frame might been easier to have because you wouldn''t have to worry about cropping out distracting elements and this would give the photo more room too breath and relax just a bit.  Very nice idea, interesting subject, I gave a 6.', '2005-09-09 02:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689297, 225164, 10848, '<td valign="top">I like this, the hat really adds the charm in this shot. 9</td>', 'I like this, the hat really adds the charm in this shot. 9', '2005-09-09 02:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689303, 226903, 11923, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image, the color contrasts are indeed what make this photograph so "wow" inducing.  I do wish however that we were so far away from those contrasts.  It is a lovely image in its own right but I think having those white (infra-red?) trees more in the foreground so the contrast was more in your face, it would make the image stronger.  As it is, it seems very distant and almost as if its being cut off by the top border.  Still is wonderful to look at and nicely done with the light usage and focus.  I gave a 7.</td>', 'Gorgeous image, the color contrasts are indeed what make this photograph so "wow" inducing.  I do wish however that we were so far away from those contrasts.  It is a lovely image in its own right but I think having those white (infra-red?) trees more in the foreground so the contrast was more in your face, it would make the image stronger.  As it is, it seems very distant and almost as if its being cut off by the top border.  Still is wonderful to look at and nicely done with the light usage and focus.  I gave a 7.', '2005-09-09 02:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689384, 226955, 31443, '<td valign="top">Yes, the odd one out, nice contrast, wonder if other people understand that..</td>', 'Yes, the odd one out, nice contrast, wonder if other people understand that..', '2005-09-09 03:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689398, 226658, 19831, '<td valign="top">So often I see a photo where people have wildly tilted the camera just for the sake of trying to be artsy, or something. In this case, it looks like this angle was well thought out and works well to present the image. It is composed nicely and has good leading lines.</td>', 'So often I see a photo where people have wildly tilted the camera just for the sake of trying to be artsy, or something. In this case, it looks like this angle was well thought out and works well to present the image. It is composed nicely and has good leading lines.', '2005-09-09 03:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
