(1689526, 225127, 19831, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh, this is just a totally outstanding photo to me! The model is awesome. I love her expression and pose. And brilliance using the contrast of the red hair against the green dress. Awesome lighting, great detail. This is just really doing it for me. Super, duper job. thank-you</td>', 'Oh my gosh, this is just a totally outstanding photo to me! The model is awesome. I love her expression and pose. And brilliance using the contrast of the red hair against the green dress. Awesome lighting, great detail. This is just really doing it for me. Super, duper job. thank-you', '2005-09-09 06:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689532, 226760, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a cool composition. Good take on a classic. Seems like focus could be a little bit sharper, the eye just doesn''t seem to really ''cut'' through. For high contrast, I am thinking maybe a slight boost to your darks, by maybe a levels or curves adj. , could strengthen the presentation some.</td>', 'This is a cool composition. Good take on a classic. Seems like focus could be a little bit sharper, the eye just doesn''t seem to really ''cut'' through. For high contrast, I am thinking maybe a slight boost to your darks, by maybe a levels or curves adj. , could strengthen the presentation some.', '2005-09-09 06:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1689535, 225660, 27137, '<td valign="top">I think you used a tele lens for this one, as you might know it is alwats best to pump the lest with a +2 exposure compensation as teles usually ends up loosing light (brightness) which i think it what your image is lacking <br/>Alsternativeli use the Curves in PS to pump the contrast <br/></td>', 'I think you used a tele lens for this one, as you might know it is alwats best to pump the lest with a +2 exposure compensation as teles usually ends up loosing light (brightness) which i think it what your image is lacking Alsternativeli use the Curves in PS to pump the contrast ', '2005-09-09 06:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
