(1690258, 225147, 22781, '<td valign="top">Interesting.<br/>Very interesting. The composition, the light the postprocessing.<br/>Very different and interesting. I like it very much, but I think it isn''t doing very well knowing DPC a bit.<br/>No worries, you got me convinced, there will be others too that will se the quality of this shot I hope.<br/>And hey, who knows, DPC is a strange place, maybe this will win the blue. I would be glad to have something different on the frontpage for a change.</td>', 'Interesting.Very interesting. The composition, the light the postprocessing.Very different and interesting. I like it very much, but I think it isn''t doing very well knowing DPC a bit.No worries, you got me convinced, there will be others too that will se the quality of this shot I hope.And hey, who knows, DPC is a strange place, maybe this will win the blue. I would be glad to have something different on the frontpage for a change.', '2005-09-09 12:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
