(1690269, 225443, 22781, '<td valign="top">Don''t get mad at me.<br/>My forst reaction (1/2 second) was Too mutch.... To mutch PP to soft.<br/>Then again, after looking at it 1/2 second longer it started to grow on me.<br/>And now after looking at it allready for 2 seconds I like it ;)<br/>Ok Ok that about the seconds isn''t true, but in general....<br/>I only wish the hairs would be sharp. <br/>But I realy like the overall image, the look and the model.</td>', 'Don''t get mad at me.My forst reaction (1/2 second) was Too mutch.... To mutch PP to soft.Then again, after looking at it 1/2 second longer it started to grow on me.And now after looking at it allready for 2 seconds I like it ;)Ok Ok that about the seconds isn''t true, but in general....I only wish the hairs would be sharp. But I realy like the overall image, the look and the model.', '2005-09-09 12:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
