(1690513, 226916, 17507, '<td valign="top">great angle, and very effective use of negative space. the oranges and reds are lovely. I wish the glare from the light weren''t visible. A polarizer might have helped cut down on the reflections from the room</td>', 'great angle, and very effective use of negative space. the oranges and reds are lovely. I wish the glare from the light weren''t visible. A polarizer might have helped cut down on the reflections from the room', '2005-09-09 14:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
