(1691008, 226982, 3032, '<td valign="top">It is a bit soft, but the impact of<br/>- background vs subject<br/>- colors<br/>- model placement<br/>- that smile, oh that smaile<br/>- the scarf<br/> <br/>is so good. <br/> <br/>8</td>', 'It is a bit soft, but the impact of- background vs subject- colors- model placement- that smile, oh that smaile- the scarf is so good.  8', '2005-09-09 18:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691043, 225751, 3032, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail, interesting wide perspective, red filtered B&amp;W?<br/>It is pleasant that there aren''t many modern objects in the frame, only that high building to the right. The light on the tower is very good. The photo lacks a bit of emotion but pretty darn good nonetheless. 8</td>', 'Amazing detail, interesting wide perspective, red filtered B&W?It is pleasant that there aren''t many modern objects in the frame, only that high building to the right. The light on the tower is very good. The photo lacks a bit of emotion but pretty darn good nonetheless. 8', '2005-09-09 19:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691048, 226676, 3032, '<td valign="top">The blowout of whites on the flowers (and the balance on the face)  is a bit distracting, but all other aspects of the photograph are good. Good mood, nice tone, good model placement with good expression and nice undistracting background. It is just the balance of the light that might be improved. 8</td>', 'The blowout of whites on the flowers (and the balance on the face)  is a bit distracting, but all other aspects of the photograph are good. Good mood, nice tone, good model placement with good expression and nice undistracting background. It is just the balance of the light that might be improved. 8', '2005-09-09 19:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691052, 227049, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice &amp; clean, good how the background is white but not the purest hurting the eyes white. Nice color, exposurem subject placement etc. I also like it how the border works, especially in the lower right corner. The photograph is technically very good, just lacks a bit of emotion for me. 8</td>', 'Nice & clean, good how the background is white but not the purest hurting the eyes white. Nice color, exposurem subject placement etc. I also like it how the border works, especially in the lower right corner. The photograph is technically very good, just lacks a bit of emotion for me. 8', '2005-09-09 19:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691053, 226504, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the graffiti contrasts with the yellow and how that is repeated with the real person. 8</td>', 'Interesting how the graffiti contrasts with the yellow and how that is repeated with the real person. 8', '2005-09-09 19:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691055, 227052, 3032, '<td valign="top">The Ents have come!<br/> <br/>Great how the tree tries to cling on to the world, it might be dead, it might be alive I don''t care. It is just great how a living thing flows into something we consider dead. Great B&amp;W. The lens flare? The photo would be better without it. 8</td>', 'The Ents have come! Great how the tree tries to cling on to the world, it might be dead, it might be alive I don''t care. It is just great how a living thing flows into something we consider dead. Great B&W. The lens flare? The photo would be better without it. 8', '2005-09-09 19:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
