(1691060, 224855, 3032, '<td valign="top">On one hand I like the interaction between the person and the viewer. On the other hand I wonder; Shouldn''t he look his ''friend'' in the eyes if it is such a close friend.<br/>I''m having a hard time trying to decide what works better for me.<br/> <br/>I like the B&amp;W and use of negative space. Good mood. 8</td>', 'On one hand I like the interaction between the person and the viewer. On the other hand I wonder; Shouldn''t he look his ''friend'' in the eyes if it is such a close friend.I''m having a hard time trying to decide what works better for me. I like the B&W and use of negative space. Good mood. 8', '2005-09-09 19:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691061, 225147, 3032, '<td valign="top">Looks so India.<br/>For me the the balance between the black right and bright left is too extreme. There is to little inbetween to clearly define the person in the middle.<br/>I like the subject choice, the composition, the tone and the soft old look.<br/>8</td>', 'Looks so India.For me the the balance between the black right and bright left is too extreme. There is to little inbetween to clearly define the person in the middle.I like the subject choice, the composition, the tone and the soft old look.8', '2005-09-09 19:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691062, 226656, 15711, '<td valign="top">After reviewing the photos again, I am upping my score on this. It is most certainly high contrast and the graphic sense of it is great.  It has a geometric edge to it which I find very suitable to the black and white.</td>', 'After reviewing the photos again, I am upping my score on this. It is most certainly high contrast and the graphic sense of it is great.  It has a geometric edge to it which I find very suitable to the black and white.', '2005-09-09 19:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691064, 225969, 3032, '<td valign="top">Classic portrait, would have gotten a 10 in the next challenge. :)<br/> <br/>For this challenge, well, I don''t know. I like it, but some of the brights are to bright and the color lacks a bit of depth. 8</td>', 'Classic portrait, would have gotten a 10 in the next challenge. :) For this challenge, well, I don''t know. I like it, but some of the brights are to bright and the color lacks a bit of depth. 8', '2005-09-09 19:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691067, 225903, 3032, '<td valign="top">The saturated colors create a great mood. The placement of the colors reminds me of the reversed ethiopian flag, very important to rastafariah. Nice relaxed mood. 8</td>', 'The saturated colors create a great mood. The placement of the colors reminds me of the reversed ethiopian flag, very important to rastafariah. Nice relaxed mood. 8', '2005-09-09 19:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691068, 226949, 3032, '<td valign="top">Amazing impact from the darkness. Good work. 8</td>', 'Amazing impact from the darkness. Good work. 8', '2005-09-09 19:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691069, 225273, 3032, '<td valign="top">Dark vs light balances out almost great here. Just a tad too much bright on the body. Composition is awesome. Feels like a JJBeguin. 8</td>', 'Dark vs light balances out almost great here. Just a tad too much bright on the body. Composition is awesome. Feels like a JJBeguin. 8', '2005-09-09 19:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691073, 224855, 31230, '<td valign="top">Wow his eyes and the bunnies cute too.</td>', 'Wow his eyes and the bunnies cute too.', '2005-09-09 19:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691078, 227052, 41794, '<td valign="top">Love this picture. The light coming through on the right is a little distracting to me (IMHO) but does not detract from the overall appeal of the shot.</td>', 'Love this picture. The light coming through on the right is a little distracting to me (IMHO) but does not detract from the overall appeal of the shot.', '2005-09-09 19:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691079, 226000, 3032, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. Great composition, not only is the face in a good part of the frame but the background tells something about the person and the brooms act like a leading line. The expression is the one of someone who has had a hard but honest live. Love the tone. I don''t know why I had this at 8, bumpin up to 10.</td>', 'Excellent portrait. Great composition, not only is the face in a good part of the frame but the background tells something about the person and the brooms act like a leading line. The expression is the one of someone who has had a hard but honest live. Love the tone. I don''t know why I had this at 8, bumpin up to 10.', '2005-09-09 19:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691085, 226823, 3032, '<td valign="top">It is nice how all the lines lead to the centre. This way the centered composition doesn''t suffer so much from being centered. The balance between the dark forest on the right and the fields at the left and in the centre is interesting but also to extreme, because of the blown out highlights. Therefore I think it might have worked better if you had cropped of a part of the left, precisely there where the bushes take over the fence. You''d loose the annoying bright spot at the left.<br/>Wonderful tone and mood. 8</td>', 'It is nice how all the lines lead to the centre. This way the centered composition doesn''t suffer so much from being centered. The balance between the dark forest on the right and the fields at the left and in the centre is interesting but also to extreme, because of the blown out highlights. Therefore I think it might have worked better if you had cropped of a part of the left, precisely there where the bushes take over the fence. You''d loose the annoying bright spot at the left.Wonderful tone and mood. 8', '2005-09-09 19:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691088, 225623, 3032, '<td valign="top">To nowhere, that''s right. Very good, excellent contrast, good B&amp;W! 8</td>', 'To nowhere, that''s right. Very good, excellent contrast, good B&W! 8', '2005-09-09 19:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691094, 225127, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting color contrast. There are some blowouts on the face and the right breast and I''d crop off the fingers in the lower right. The green vs red works well and her expression is interesting. 7</td>', 'Interesting color contrast. There are some blowouts on the face and the right breast and I''d crop off the fingers in the lower right. The green vs red works well and her expression is interesting. 7', '2005-09-09 19:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691095, 226930, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice mood here. 7</td>', 'Nice mood here. 7', '2005-09-09 19:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691096, 226976, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good balance between light and dark. It is a bit small and it lacks a bit of emotion for me. 7</td>', 'Good balance between light and dark. It is a bit small and it lacks a bit of emotion for me. 7', '2005-09-09 19:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691102, 226665, 3032, '<td valign="top">The gradation in the sky on top suffers a bit from 8-bit jpeg but all other aspects (especially the composition) of the photograph are pretty good. The colors don''t have such a strong impact on me, they are a bit blah. The person has a oversharpening halo. 7</td>', 'The gradation in the sky on top suffers a bit from 8-bit jpeg but all other aspects (especially the composition) of the photograph are pretty good. The colors don''t have such a strong impact on me, they are a bit blah. The person has a oversharpening halo. 7', '2005-09-09 19:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691105, 226910, 3032, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors in the background but the foreground is so cool... 7</td>', 'Amazing colors in the background but the foreground is so cool... 7', '2005-09-09 19:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691108, 224347, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W with and interesting subject. Good composition and good balance between dark vs bright.</td>', 'Nice B&W with and interesting subject. Good composition and good balance between dark vs bright.', '2005-09-09 19:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691111, 226968, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the grain works with this photo, love the toning, light and composition. Don''t have a strong feeling about the expression.</td>', 'Interesting how the grain works with this photo, love the toning, light and composition. Don''t have a strong feeling about the expression.', '2005-09-09 19:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691112, 225948, 3032, '<td valign="top">The persons look like puppets with their thin arms and heads. Interesting composition, colors and light. Nice mood. 7</td>', 'The persons look like puppets with their thin arms and heads. Interesting composition, colors and light. Nice mood. 7', '2005-09-09 19:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691115, 226959, 41794, '<td valign="top">Love how the light fits right between the branches!</td>', 'Love how the light fits right between the branches!', '2005-09-09 19:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691120, 226854, 3032, '<td valign="top">Croatia vs Sweden? (I knew about the Croatia shirt, had to look up Sweden)<br/>Nice action shot, a decisive moment. Colors are a bit over the top perhaps, the yellows saturated so much that there is a slight yellow blowout. Nevertheless, nice shot.  7</td>', 'Croatia vs Sweden? (I knew about the Croatia shirt, had to look up Sweden)Nice action shot, a decisive moment. Colors are a bit over the top perhaps, the yellows saturated so much that there is a slight yellow blowout. Nevertheless, nice shot.  7', '2005-09-09 19:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691128, 225248, 3032, '<td valign="top">A great B&amp;W with interesting subjects and background. The overal feeling is that is a bit too posed for the mood the boys are trying to express. Subject placement  works well for an album cover. Enough room for titles and stuff like that. 7</td>', 'A great B&W with interesting subjects and background. The overal feeling is that is a bit too posed for the mood the boys are trying to express. Subject placement  works well for an album cover. Enough room for titles and stuff like that. 7', '2005-09-09 19:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691134, 226895, 3032, '<td valign="top">When she would have looked straight into the camera it might have been an 8 or 9. Now she''s looking away and it makes it feel a bit unpersonal. 7</td>', 'When she would have looked straight into the camera it might have been an 8 or 9. Now she''s looking away and it makes it feel a bit unpersonal. 7', '2005-09-09 20:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
