(1691174, 227111, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>There is a lot of distracting elements in the background that I would prefer be gone. I think the placement of the flower in the frame was good, but the other elements are just too distracting.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 There is a lot of distracting elements in the background that I would prefer be gone. I think the placement of the flower in the frame was good, but the other elements are just too distracting.', '2005-09-09 20:13:22.000000', NULL, 1);
