(1691353, 224223, 22046, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, the idea and the title. Way cool!</td>', 'Love the composition, the idea and the title. Way cool!', '2005-09-09 20:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691356, 226779, 22046, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower portrait.</td>', 'Beautiful flower portrait.', '2005-09-09 20:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691360, 226936, 22046, '<td valign="top">He''s a handsome boy and his open expression is very attractive.</td>', 'He''s a handsome boy and his open expression is very attractive.', '2005-09-09 20:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691363, 226735, 22046, '<td valign="top">Nice atmospheric image.</td>', 'Nice atmospheric image.', '2005-09-09 20:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691364, 226930, 22046, '<td valign="top">This looks like a painting and is truly lovely.</td>', 'This looks like a painting and is truly lovely.', '2005-09-09 21:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691367, 226673, 22046, '<td valign="top">Nifty abstract!</td>', 'Nifty abstract!', '2005-09-09 21:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691371, 225839, 24642, '<td valign="top">Running over the same old ground. <br/>What have you found?</td>', 'Running over the same old ground. What have you found?', '2005-09-09 21:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691374, 225940, 22046, '<td valign="top">Almost black and white except for his eye... Like the half and half composition and the lighting.</td>', 'Almost black and white except for his eye... Like the half and half composition and the lighting.', '2005-09-09 21:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691377, 226000, 22046, '<td valign="top">Excelent portrait.</td>', 'Excelent portrait.', '2005-09-09 21:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691491, 225674, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great high key feel and amazing focus on the eyelashes.  I like the selective color too.  The only thing I think I might change would be the crop.  Because it seems to be so centered, it lacks the interest I think it could generate by an offset composition.  Other than that - great job!  Bumping up.</td>', 'Great high key feel and amazing focus on the eyelashes.  I like the selective color too.  The only thing I think I might change would be the crop.  Because it seems to be so centered, it lacks the interest I think it could generate by an offset composition.  Other than that - great job!  Bumping up.', '2005-09-09 22:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691493, 226999, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great color contrast shot.  Love the deep, rich tones and although the composition is busy, it seems to work.  The crop may be a bit tight on the top, but otherwise, very strong entry.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Great color contrast shot.  Love the deep, rich tones and although the composition is busy, it seems to work.  The crop may be a bit tight on the top, but otherwise, very strong entry.  Bumping up.', '2005-09-09 22:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691494, 227057, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great crisp shot with terrific contrast.  The only thing I would change is the centered placement of the "anchor".  Otherwise, very strong entry.</td>', 'Great crisp shot with terrific contrast.  The only thing I would change is the centered placement of the "anchor".  Otherwise, very strong entry.', '2005-09-09 22:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691497, 226399, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wow...  The deepness and richness of the tones in this image are incredible.  The focus seems tack sharp too.  It may be a tad on the dark side, but absolutely beautiful composition.  Bumping way up.</td>', 'Wow...  The deepness and richness of the tones in this image are incredible.  The focus seems tack sharp too.  It may be a tad on the dark side, but absolutely beautiful composition.  Bumping way up.', '2005-09-09 22:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691502, 226503, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines and colors in this shot and the focus is very good.  My only criticism of the shot is personal interest in the subject matter.  Yes, it''s pretty and has nice lines, but it doesn''t really grab me.  Don''t get me wrong, I think it is visually quite pleasing and technically it''s a great shot.  7</td>', 'Beautiful lines and colors in this shot and the focus is very good.  My only criticism of the shot is personal interest in the subject matter.  Yes, it''s pretty and has nice lines, but it doesn''t really grab me.  Don''t get me wrong, I think it is visually quite pleasing and technically it''s a great shot.  7', '2005-09-09 22:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691511, 226694, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great composition - I love the minimalist feel.  I also really like the contrast, but think that the light is actually a tad too bright.  The focus is good, but not quite tack sharp and I see strange spots around parts of the flower and stem that look like processing remnants from something.  I also think the flower looks a bit wilted (which could have been on purpose).  I know it sounds like I had lots of negative things to say, but honestly it''s a very good idea and a really good shot.</td>', 'Great composition - I love the minimalist feel.  I also really like the contrast, but think that the light is actually a tad too bright.  The focus is good, but not quite tack sharp and I see strange spots around parts of the flower and stem that look like processing remnants from something.  I also think the flower looks a bit wilted (which could have been on purpose).  I know it sounds like I had lots of negative things to say, but honestly it''s a very good idea and a really good shot.', '2005-09-09 22:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691514, 225316, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  My biggest issue with it though is the graininess of the sky.  Actually it seems to get grainier the further back you go.  Otherwise, the contrasts are great and the composition is awesome.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  My biggest issue with it though is the graininess of the sky.  Actually it seems to get grainier the further back you go.  Otherwise, the contrasts are great and the composition is awesome.', '2005-09-09 22:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691524, 224223, 34659, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea and very well executed.  Perfectly meets the challenge.  My only issue with the image is the texture of the masks.  It may sound odd, but the fact that they are fuzzy (in texture, not focus) doesn''t seem to match the feel/mood of the shot.  I envision something hard and smooth.  Still, very strong entry.</td>', 'Fantastic idea and very well executed.  Perfectly meets the challenge.  My only issue with the image is the texture of the masks.  It may sound odd, but the fact that they are fuzzy (in texture, not focus) doesn''t seem to match the feel/mood of the shot.  I envision something hard and smooth.  Still, very strong entry.', '2005-09-09 22:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691530, 226652, 34659, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, but that''s okay.  I like the tones of the shot and the composition/crop.  The focus is a hair off IMHO (not that every shot has to be tack sharp), but a solid entry.  (pun intended!)  ;-)</td>', 'I don''t get the title, but that''s okay.  I like the tones of the shot and the composition/crop.  The focus is a hair off IMHO (not that every shot has to be tack sharp), but a solid entry.  (pun intended!)  ;-)', '2005-09-09 22:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691535, 226846, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love the tones - they are great - and really like the long exposure.  I''m not crazy about the border though and the horizon seems off to me (and not in the artistic way).  Great composition otherwise and certainly meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Love the tones - they are great - and really like the long exposure.  I''m not crazy about the border though and the horizon seems off to me (and not in the artistic way).  Great composition otherwise and certainly meets the challenge well.', '2005-09-09 22:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691538, 225385, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great dark tones in the water, but the surf is a bit blown out.  It almost works, but is just a hair too much IMHO.  Great action shot, though the crop may be a bit tight at the top.  Still a strong entry.</td>', 'Great dark tones in the water, but the surf is a bit blown out.  It almost works, but is just a hair too much IMHO.  Great action shot, though the crop may be a bit tight at the top.  Still a strong entry.', '2005-09-09 22:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691541, 226990, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great composition and pose.  Certainly meets the challenge, but I think the highlights are a tad blown out - even for high contrast.  Also, not crazy about the background - doesn''t seem to match the overall mood you''re trying to establish IMHO.  Still a strong entry.</td>', 'Great composition and pose.  Certainly meets the challenge, but I think the highlights are a tad blown out - even for high contrast.  Also, not crazy about the background - doesn''t seem to match the overall mood you''re trying to establish IMHO.  Still a strong entry.', '2005-09-09 22:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691543, 226898, 34659, '<td valign="top">Amazing color and nice crisp focus.  I''m really surprised you were able to get the brightness you got without blowing the highlights - nice job.  Good, solid entry.</td>', 'Amazing color and nice crisp focus.  I''m really surprised you were able to get the brightness you got without blowing the highlights - nice job.  Good, solid entry.', '2005-09-09 22:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691545, 225588, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great long exposure shot, and it meets the challenge well.  Love the color tones and composition.  Good entry.</td>', 'Great long exposure shot, and it meets the challenge well.  Love the color tones and composition.  Good entry.', '2005-09-09 22:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691547, 226689, 34659, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning clarity and natural colors.  Truly a magnificent shot.  Good DOF and I like the offset composition horizontaly, but think it could be offset a bit vertically as well.  Strong entry.</td>', 'Simply stunning clarity and natural colors.  Truly a magnificent shot.  Good DOF and I like the offset composition horizontaly, but think it could be offset a bit vertically as well.  Strong entry.', '2005-09-09 22:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691550, 226518, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great long exposure shot.  Really nice clarity and color tones too.</td>', 'Great long exposure shot.  Really nice clarity and color tones too.', '2005-09-09 22:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691552, 224855, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great composition and contrast.  Love the crop.  His eyes literally stare right through you...  Excellent shot.</td>', 'Great composition and contrast.  Love the crop.  His eyes literally stare right through you...  Excellent shot.', '2005-09-09 22:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691553, 226084, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Good focus, contrast, and I think the centered composition works well.  My only suggestion would be to include the actual top of the spire - I think the crop is too tight on the top - otherwise, great shot.</td>', 'Great capture.  Good focus, contrast, and I think the centered composition works well.  My only suggestion would be to include the actual top of the spire - I think the crop is too tight on the top - otherwise, great shot.', '2005-09-09 22:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691568, 227058, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the urban quality of this.  I don''t think the "natural" contrast could have been any better and you created more by making it black and white.</td>', 'I love the urban quality of this.  I don''t think the "natural" contrast could have been any better and you created more by making it black and white.', '2005-09-09 22:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691570, 226134, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great perspective on the shot. Nice filter - is this duotone?  I like the bronzey metallic sense of it.</td>', 'Great perspective on the shot. Nice filter - is this duotone?  I like the bronzey metallic sense of it.', '2005-09-09 22:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691573, 225638, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky and clouds for sure. I think I''d bring up the bright a bit more to really give those glorious clouds more punch.  Good luck!!</td>', 'Lovely sky and clouds for sure. I think I''d bring up the bright a bit more to really give those glorious clouds more punch.  Good luck!!', '2005-09-09 22:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691574, 225981, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I would like to somehow see the flowers brought out a little more.</td>', 'Nice idea, I would like to somehow see the flowers brought out a little more.', '2005-09-09 22:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691577, 226826, 15711, '<td valign="top">Fun colors of the popcicles.  I think this would have the impact you were looking for if the focus were ultra sharp. I like her hair hanging over her cheek, and her natural pose.  The lighting is good as well.</td>', 'Fun colors of the popcicles.  I think this would have the impact you were looking for if the focus were ultra sharp. I like her hair hanging over her cheek, and her natural pose.  The lighting is good as well.', '2005-09-09 22:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691579, 226684, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like her serious repose. The lighting is a tad harsh but I still like it.  I might play with the contrast a little and see if you could get more detailing on her face.  Adjusting curves would help in this endeavor as well. You have the makings of a great shot with a little tweaking. ;~P</td>', 'I like her serious repose. The lighting is a tad harsh but I still like it.  I might play with the contrast a little and see if you could get more detailing on her face.  Adjusting curves would help in this endeavor as well. You have the makings of a great shot with a little tweaking. ;~P', '2005-09-09 22:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691581, 227052, 18349, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been a Dylan fan at all, but I won''t hold that against you.  This is one of my three favorite images in the challenge.  Well done.  :)</td>', 'I''ve never been a Dylan fan at all, but I won''t hold that against you.  This is one of my three favorite images in the challenge.  Well done.  :)', '2005-09-09 22:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691583, 225799, 18349, '<td valign="top">Oustanding...I adore this image.  Beautiful treatment.  :)</td>', 'Oustanding...I adore this image.  Beautiful treatment.  :)', '2005-09-09 22:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691584, 225093, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very cool toning and composition.  :)</td>', 'Very cool toning and composition.  :)', '2005-09-09 22:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691586, 227019, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the linear architecture of this shot.  The lighting is nice.  The green is a good  contrast to the red brick but maybe not high contrast. Good luck!! 7</td>', 'I like the linear architecture of this shot.  The lighting is nice.  The green is a good  contrast to the red brick but maybe not high contrast. Good luck!! 7', '2005-09-09 22:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691587, 226823, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow, is this a great photograph! Would have been perfect for Perspective as well, but it''s great in the Contrast challenge too. Very nicely done!</td>', 'Wow, is this a great photograph! Would have been perfect for Perspective as well, but it''s great in the Contrast challenge too. Very nicely done!', '2005-09-09 22:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691588, 225323, 18349, '<td valign="top">Another one of my nines.  Excellent image and contrast.  I hope you consider making this available as a print.  Good stuff.  :)</td>', 'Another one of my nines.  Excellent image and contrast.  I hope you consider making this available as a print.  Good stuff.  :)', '2005-09-09 22:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691589, 226760, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the eye and the tendril coming over her nose. I think you could make this have more pizazz by playing with curves and working with the contrast.</td>', 'Love the eye and the tendril coming over her nose. I think you could make this have more pizazz by playing with curves and working with the contrast.', '2005-09-09 22:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691591, 225674, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the heavy eyelashes and the high pass of it. It''d be great if the iris were really sharply focused as well as the area directly above it. Good effort. 7</td>', 'I like the heavy eyelashes and the high pass of it. It''d be great if the iris were really sharply focused as well as the area directly above it. Good effort. 7', '2005-09-09 22:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691592, 226998, 19952, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this photo except for the bit of a halo around the tomato and parts of the fork. Other than that minor point, this is a really nice image that works great for this challenge.</td>', 'I love everything about this photo except for the bit of a halo around the tomato and parts of the fork. Other than that minor point, this is a really nice image that works great for this challenge.', '2005-09-09 22:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691593, 226631, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the triplicity of it.  Nice reflection as well.  I think it could use a large spance of negative space (water)  to one side of the boats but maybe that wasn''t a part of the setting at the time.</td>', 'I like the triplicity of it.  Nice reflection as well.  I think it could use a large spance of negative space (water)  to one side of the boats but maybe that wasn''t a part of the setting at the time.', '2005-09-09 22:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691595, 226669, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice close up. I like the curved stem of the leaf. I''d up the contrast even more for a total POW effect! Nicely focused and filtered. 7</td>', 'Nice close up. I like the curved stem of the leaf. I''d up the contrast even more for a total POW effect! Nicely focused and filtered. 7', '2005-09-09 22:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691597, 226895, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the glam sense this has. The use of sepia was a smart move. Nice use of contrast for sure.</td>', 'I like the glam sense this has. The use of sepia was a smart move. Nice use of contrast for sure.', '2005-09-09 22:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691602, 225093, 15711, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this I had to really study it to figure out what I was seeing.  I like that quality of the photo. It makes me delve in a bit deeper. I think the bronzey tones of the legs and arms detract from the high contrast of the shoes and what she''s carrying in her arms. I do like the composition and idea though. 7</td>', 'When I first saw this I had to really study it to figure out what I was seeing.  I like that quality of the photo. It makes me delve in a bit deeper. I think the bronzey tones of the legs and arms detract from the high contrast of the shoes and what she''s carrying in her arms. I do like the composition and idea though. 7', '2005-09-09 22:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691605, 225405, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love old buildings.  I think I''d like this a bit more if shot from an unusual angle, although this does showcase the doors and windows of the back and the lighting helps with the contrast.</td>', 'I love old buildings.  I think I''d like this a bit more if shot from an unusual angle, although this does showcase the doors and windows of the back and the lighting helps with the contrast.', '2005-09-09 22:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691606, 226854, 19952, '<td valign="top">One of the best sports photos I''ve ever seen. Very nicely done.</td>', 'One of the best sports photos I''ve ever seen. Very nicely done.', '2005-09-09 22:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691608, 224347, 41802, '<td valign="top">Good shot, nice chrome.</td>', 'Good shot, nice chrome.', '2005-09-09 22:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691611, 225423, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I like the pink in the sunset.</td>', 'Nice image, I like the pink in the sunset.', '2005-09-09 23:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691612, 227028, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Being a jazz lover, it drew my eye immediately.  This has alot of mid tones which really aren''t considered "high contrast" but the focus and the composition is well done.</td>', 'I really like this shot. Being a jazz lover, it drew my eye immediately.  This has alot of mid tones which really aren''t considered "high contrast" but the focus and the composition is well done.', '2005-09-09 23:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691614, 225955, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. It''s simple and graphic and certainly has high contrast. I wish the 5 were as sharp as the word station.</td>', 'I like this very much. It''s simple and graphic and certainly has high contrast. I wish the 5 were as sharp as the word station.', '2005-09-09 23:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691618, 225296, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like that the lavender and green are opposites on the color wheel, but I think to truly give this the high impact of contrast that is called for here would be to really up the purple to a more intense hue. I do like the composition and the DOF very much. 7</td>', 'I like that the lavender and green are opposites on the color wheel, but I think to truly give this the high impact of contrast that is called for here would be to really up the purple to a more intense hue. I do like the composition and the DOF very much. 7', '2005-09-09 23:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691623, 225517, 34659, '<td valign="top">I''m really glad I came back to this shot.  I love the tones and solitary feel to this image.  Great composition and terrific contrast.  My only slight criticism is that the highlights appear to be a tad blown out in spots.  Very strong entry.  Bumping up.</td>', 'I''m really glad I came back to this shot.  I love the tones and solitary feel to this image.  Great composition and terrific contrast.  My only slight criticism is that the highlights appear to be a tad blown out in spots.  Very strong entry.  Bumping up.', '2005-09-09 23:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691626, 226758, 13688, '<td valign="top">the lead up to the train...the track, puddles and headlights are facinating</td>', 'the lead up to the train...the track, puddles and headlights are facinating', '2005-09-09 23:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691631, 226564, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful.  I love the movement of the water and the tones of the image.  Her pose and expression meld so well with the swirling water.  Great job.</td>', 'This is really beautiful.  I love the movement of the water and the tones of the image.  Her pose and expression meld so well with the swirling water.  Great job.', '2005-09-09 23:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691632, 226128, 13688, '<td valign="top">unique border.  i like how it draws you in.  whites and blacks have lost too much detail</td>', 'unique border.  i like how it draws you in.  whites and blacks have lost too much detail', '2005-09-09 23:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691635, 227087, 41802, '<td valign="top">I like idea and colors</td>', 'I like idea and colors', '2005-09-09 23:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691636, 226808, 34659, '<td valign="top">Unique choice of tones for this challenge.  I think it certainly meets the high contrast requirements, but it really stands out not only for its creativity, but also for the warmth of the color tones.  Good opacity in the glasses/reflection and great composition too.  Nice work.</td>', 'Unique choice of tones for this challenge.  I think it certainly meets the high contrast requirements, but it really stands out not only for its creativity, but also for the warmth of the color tones.  Good opacity in the glasses/reflection and great composition too.  Nice work.', '2005-09-09 23:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691640, 226107, 30791, '<td valign="top">looks like mandy turner<br/>8</td>', 'looks like mandy turner8', '2005-09-09 23:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691641, 227073, 34659, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a photo shoot where all the cast have been choreographed.  the silhouettes are great and the tones of the water are spectacular, but what I think really makes the image is the person leaning against the lamppost with his arm rested on his leg.  Great capture.</td>', 'This almost looks like a photo shoot where all the cast have been choreographed.  the silhouettes are great and the tones of the water are spectacular, but what I think really makes the image is the person leaning against the lamppost with his arm rested on his leg.  Great capture.', '2005-09-09 23:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691645, 227110, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wow - amazing focus &amp; DOF.  Great bokeh too.  My only (very slight) criticism would be that although the bouquet (not bokeh - ;-)) is slightly offset, I think it could be moved more out of the center.  This is a very strong entry.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Wow - amazing focus & DOF.  Great bokeh too.  My only (very slight) criticism would be that although the bouquet (not bokeh - ;-)) is slightly offset, I think it could be moved more out of the center.  This is a very strong entry.  Bumping up.', '2005-09-09 23:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691647, 224949, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great shot - the more I look at it, the more I''m impressed.  Great stop action and the use of B/W works surprisingly well.  It has a high key feel and yet has amazing depth.  Excellent shot - bumping up.</td>', 'Great shot - the more I look at it, the more I''m impressed.  Great stop action and the use of B/W works surprisingly well.  It has a high key feel and yet has amazing depth.  Excellent shot - bumping up.', '2005-09-09 23:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691649, 227018, 41802, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower, I think I would have voted higher with a little more contrast in the photo.</td>', 'Pretty flower, I think I would have voted higher with a little more contrast in the photo.', '2005-09-09 23:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691650, 226959, 34659, '<td valign="top">This has all the makings for a really great shot, but the processing is a distraction for me.  There are remnants visible on the edges of many objects and the sky (while unique and pretty cool) has a very odd shape to the darkness that is obviously intentional, but I''m not convinced works entirely.  I really like the focus and overall composition though, and it''s very high contrast.</td>', 'This has all the makings for a really great shot, but the processing is a distraction for me.  There are remnants visible on the edges of many objects and the sky (while unique and pretty cool) has a very odd shape to the darkness that is obviously intentional, but I''m not convinced works entirely.  I really like the focus and overall composition though, and it''s very high contrast.', '2005-09-09 23:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691653, 224720, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the t-shirt is a great contrast to the dark background.</td>', 'Nice shot, the t-shirt is a great contrast to the dark background.', '2005-09-09 23:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691656, 227052, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is such a spectacular setting...  I wish the shot was consistently in better focus and that the sunspots weren''t visible.  This tree is amazing though and set against the rocks makes for high contrast on a number of levels.  Good job.</td>', 'This is such a spectacular setting...  I wish the shot was consistently in better focus and that the sunspots weren''t visible.  This tree is amazing though and set against the rocks makes for high contrast on a number of levels.  Good job.', '2005-09-09 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691658, 226998, 34659, '<td valign="top">I really like the minimalist feel this shot has going for it, and the focus and color tones are terrific.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'I really like the minimalist feel this shot has going for it, and the focus and color tones are terrific.  Very nice shot.', '2005-09-09 23:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691659, 224971, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Very interesting model, good contrasting with the shadows.</td>', 'Nice photo. Very interesting model, good contrasting with the shadows.', '2005-09-09 23:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691661, 226663, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the comp here and that my eyes are drawn to different things in the content.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like the comp here and that my eyes are drawn to different things in the content.  Nice job.', '2005-09-09 23:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691662, 226991, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great use of contrast to make the image pop.</td>', 'Great use of contrast to make the image pop.', '2005-09-09 23:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691663, 226478, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice and subtle.  Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Nice and subtle.  Beautiful shot.', '2005-09-09 23:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691664, 224516, 34659, '<td valign="top">This image really takes some study to fully appreciate.  The lighting is perfect and the focus is great, but it''s the composition that makes this remarkable IMHO.  The title helps too.  The more closely I examine it, the more I like it.  Really great job.  Bumping way up.</td>', 'This image really takes some study to fully appreciate.  The lighting is perfect and the focus is great, but it''s the composition that makes this remarkable IMHO.  The title helps too.  The more closely I examine it, the more I like it.  Really great job.  Bumping way up.', '2005-09-09 23:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691665, 227084, 41802, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting, it is amazing how magical this photo looks.</td>', 'I love the lighting, it is amazing how magical this photo looks.', '2005-09-09 23:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691666, 225751, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice phot with great lighting.</td>', 'Nice phot with great lighting.', '2005-09-09 23:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
