(1691668, 225529, 41802, '<td valign="top">Intersting subject.  I like the 2 color contrast.</td>', 'Intersting subject.  I like the 2 color contrast.', '2005-09-09 23:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691672, 226209, 34659, '<td valign="top">This shot has beautiful tones and I really like the composition &amp; reflection.  Great lighting too.  The background has me a bit befuddled (is it a nautilus shell or a cave or what?) and the streaks on the reflective surface to the right of the shell are a little distracting, but overall I think this meets the challenge well and is very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'This shot has beautiful tones and I really like the composition & reflection.  Great lighting too.  The background has me a bit befuddled (is it a nautilus shell or a cave or what?) and the streaks on the reflective surface to the right of the shell are a little distracting, but overall I think this meets the challenge well and is very pleasing to the eye.', '2005-09-09 23:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691673, 226084, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I like that you included part of the tower that was not colored.</td>', 'Nice image, I like that you included part of the tower that was not colored.', '2005-09-09 23:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691675, 227022, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice captur. A bit over exposed however.</td>', 'Nice captur. A bit over exposed however.', '2005-09-09 23:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691677, 226897, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition - I like the lines.  Good contrast, but I think the prevalence of midrange tones cause it to lose some contrast.  I''d be curious to see what it looked like in color.  Don''t get me wrong, there''s plenty of good contrast here too, it''s just that I think it might have even more in dark, rich, deep color tones.  Still, solid entry.</td>', 'Really nice composition - I like the lines.  Good contrast, but I think the prevalence of midrange tones cause it to lose some contrast.  I''d be curious to see what it looked like in color.  Don''t get me wrong, there''s plenty of good contrast here too, it''s just that I think it might have even more in dark, rich, deep color tones.  Still, solid entry.', '2005-09-09 23:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691679, 225947, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great shadows in this photo. I don''t know if I see "high" but there''s definitely contrast.</td>', 'Great shadows in this photo. I don''t know if I see "high" but there''s definitely contrast.', '2005-09-09 23:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691680, 225223, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, the yellow are bright making the photo seem warmer.</td>', 'Nice contrast, the yellow are bright making the photo seem warmer.', '2005-09-09 23:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691681, 226083, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  I love all the sun rays and the intense contrast in tones.  Looks like the focus is very good and I really like the elongated composition.  Very strong entry.  Bumping up.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  I love all the sun rays and the intense contrast in tones.  Looks like the focus is very good and I really like the elongated composition.  Very strong entry.  Bumping up.', '2005-09-09 23:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691682, 226816, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice shot the purple really grabs attention.  I think the contrast is most appearnt on the hat, which is cool.</td>', 'Nice shot the purple really grabs attention.  I think the contrast is most appearnt on the hat, which is cool.', '2005-09-09 23:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691684, 225323, 34659, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition - it''s very appealing visually.  I do think that the highlights are a tad blown in spots, but you''ve got good contrast.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Terrific composition - it''s very appealing visually.  I do think that the highlights are a tad blown in spots, but you''ve got good contrast.  Nice shot.', '2005-09-09 23:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691687, 226401, 13688, '<td valign="top">classic...right down to the border.  the dark fingers seem to disrupt the balance, though not sure what you could have done.   the overall concept is genius.</td>', 'classic...right down to the border.  the dark fingers seem to disrupt the balance, though not sure what you could have done.   the overall concept is genius.', '2005-09-09 23:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691688, 225903, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great color contrast and I like the composition.  I''m not crazy about the processing though.  IMHO, it looks a little messy - somewhere between painted and overly soft focus, but not really either - almost like it''d been run through Neat Image repeatedly.  That point aside (which I think is probably just a personal preference anyway - I''m sure that it''s a very pleasing effect to some), I still think it''s a strong entry.</td>', 'Great color contrast and I like the composition.  I''m not crazy about the processing though.  IMHO, it looks a little messy - somewhere between painted and overly soft focus, but not really either - almost like it''d been run through Neat Image repeatedly.  That point aside (which I think is probably just a personal preference anyway - I''m sure that it''s a very pleasing effect to some), I still think it''s a strong entry.', '2005-09-09 23:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691691, 225426, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great focus &amp; DOF.  Perfect composition and lighting too.  I''m glad I came back to this shot, because upon closer inspection it really is impressive.  My only minor criticism is the obvious lines of processing in the dark areas around the figure (especially the hands and arms).  Still a very strong entry.</td>', 'Great focus & DOF.  Perfect composition and lighting too.  I''m glad I came back to this shot, because upon closer inspection it really is impressive.  My only minor criticism is the obvious lines of processing in the dark areas around the figure (especially the hands and arms).  Still a very strong entry.', '2005-09-09 23:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691692, 226940, 34659, '<td valign="top">What spectacular scenery!  Great focus and contrasts.  The clouds are so interesting too - great capture!  Bumping up.</td>', 'What spectacular scenery!  Great focus and contrasts.  The clouds are so interesting too - great capture!  Bumping up.', '2005-09-09 23:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
