(1691887, 225146, 41802, '<td valign="top">Contrast between the man and nature good idea, if that is what was ment.</td>', 'Contrast between the man and nature good idea, if that is what was ment.', '2005-09-10 01:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691892, 226915, 24073, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look angry, more like he is taking a big poop!  Well, not to mislead though because I still like the photo, it was taken very well.</td>', 'Doesn''t look angry, more like he is taking a big poop!  Well, not to mislead though because I still like the photo, it was taken very well.', '2005-09-10 01:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691899, 225426, 13688, '<td valign="top">great composition.  i would have upped the contrast...especially for this challenge, as the image just has an overall greyish feel to it.  looks like you did some post processing to darken the background, that could have gotten closer to the subject.  i would have done an overall level adjustment , then either masked out the subject or used the doge tool to bring him back in.  anyway, nice lines and lighting.</td>', 'great composition.  i would have upped the contrast...especially for this challenge, as the image just has an overall greyish feel to it.  looks like you did some post processing to darken the background, that could have gotten closer to the subject.  i would have done an overall level adjustment , then either masked out the subject or used the doge tool to bring him back in.  anyway, nice lines and lighting.', '2005-09-10 01:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691914, 225533, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I think the background could either be lighter or darker for more effect.</td>', 'Nice idea, I think the background could either be lighter or darker for more effect.', '2005-09-10 01:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691918, 225241, 41802, '<td valign="top">Good contrast and interesting subject.</td>', 'Good contrast and interesting subject.', '2005-09-10 01:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691924, 226968, 13688, '<td valign="top">i wish i understood your intent.  your use of noise in this case makes the image very uncomfortable for me.  her hand feels awkward as it is.  nice contrast though.  there''s a marking to the right of her ear that drew my attention, because it looks smudged funny.  i''m very interested to find out the details of this shot.</td>', 'i wish i understood your intent.  your use of noise in this case makes the image very uncomfortable for me.  her hand feels awkward as it is.  nice contrast though.  there''s a marking to the right of her ear that drew my attention, because it looks smudged funny.  i''m very interested to find out the details of this shot.', '2005-09-10 01:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691925, 226957, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice white contrast with the flowers.</td>', 'Nice white contrast with the flowers.', '2005-09-10 01:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691927, 227100, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow a little creepy but good contrast.</td>', 'Wow a little creepy but good contrast.', '2005-09-10 01:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691928, 226972, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the water reflection is cool. The lighting in the clouds is centered very well.</td>', 'Nice shot, the water reflection is cool. The lighting in the clouds is centered very well.', '2005-09-10 01:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691936, 224631, 24073, '<td valign="top">Ok listen, I am almost perfectly sure you did not intend this, but this seems very vulger, and racist.  Now seriously, I know you didn''t intend it that way, but you have a baby girl (white), holding a black baby (doll), which leaves the doll in subjection, and unless we all live under a rock we seen the News, and it was prodominantly blacks that got the stranded.<br/>  So here in the photo you have a white girl holding in subjection a black baby, that in circumstance appears deceased.  You have to be very careful in relating photos to something that carries such deep wounds.  It may very well be interpreted unconsiously, or subliminally, and you have to consider that in such a deep circumstance.  I am  very sorry for having to bring that up, but i hope it helps.  And I in noway think you intended it that way.</td>', 'Ok listen, I am almost perfectly sure you did not intend this, but this seems very vulger, and racist.  Now seriously, I know you didn''t intend it that way, but you have a baby girl (white), holding a black baby (doll), which leaves the doll in subjection, and unless we all live under a rock we seen the News, and it was prodominantly blacks that got the stranded.  So here in the photo you have a white girl holding in subjection a black baby, that in circumstance appears deceased.  You have to be very careful in relating photos to something that carries such deep wounds.  It may very well be interpreted unconsiously, or subliminally, and you have to consider that in such a deep circumstance.  I am  very sorry for having to bring that up, but i hope it helps.  And I in noway think you intended it that way.', '2005-09-10 01:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1691944, 226786, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow that is contrast. Was there a cloud to cause the green in the grass, it is interesting how that spot appeared.</td>', 'Wow that is contrast. Was there a cloud to cause the green in the grass, it is interesting how that spot appeared.', '2005-09-10 01:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
