(1692269, 224736, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, amazing color and contrast. Wonderful job.</td>', 'Beautiful, amazing color and contrast. Wonderful job.', '2005-09-10 03:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692270, 225385, 39349, '<td valign="top">One of my favs of this challenge. Wonderful capture gave it my highest 10!</td>', 'One of my favs of this challenge. Wonderful capture gave it my highest 10!', '2005-09-10 03:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692272, 225905, 39349, '<td valign="top">Nice job Joey, wonderful as always. I see you got your shoes off the beach!</td>', 'Nice job Joey, wonderful as always. I see you got your shoes off the beach!', '2005-09-10 03:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692273, 226895, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast,  I love the natural feeling in this shot, great job! 10</td>', 'Beautiful contrast,  I love the natural feeling in this shot, great job! 10', '2005-09-10 03:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692276, 227056, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot in so many ways, contrast, model, setting etc. etc.. Models eyes draw you into this shot, natural feeling and lighting make it one of my top picks for this challenge. Very well done, 10!</td>', 'Beautiful shot in so many ways, contrast, model, setting etc. etc.. Models eyes draw you into this shot, natural feeling and lighting make it one of my top picks for this challenge. Very well done, 10!', '2005-09-10 03:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692277, 224347, 39349, '<td valign="top">Another one of my favs from this challenge, clean, beautiful contrast. Well done!</td>', 'Another one of my favs from this challenge, clean, beautiful contrast. Well done!', '2005-09-10 03:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692279, 226676, 39349, '<td valign="top">I have to say my first impression of this shot was jaw dropping, not kidding. I love this shot, you''ve nailed this challenge and then some! Congrats to you and your model for creating such a beautiful image. I love the selective de-stat. and sepia tones. Model''s pose is very natural, and the choice in delicate apparel and flowers are a wonderful contrast to the rough  textures / paint behind her. I could go on and on but I''ll just say, 10, 10, 10!</td>', 'I have to say my first impression of this shot was jaw dropping, not kidding. I love this shot, you''ve nailed this challenge and then some! Congrats to you and your model for creating such a beautiful image. I love the selective de-stat. and sepia tones. Model''s pose is very natural, and the choice in delicate apparel and flowers are a wonderful contrast to the rough  textures / paint behind her. I could go on and on but I''ll just say, 10, 10, 10!', '2005-09-10 03:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692280, 226014, 39349, '<td valign="top">Really wonderful detail in the iris. Great contrast!</td>', 'Really wonderful detail in the iris. Great contrast!', '2005-09-10 03:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692285, 226107, 39349, '<td valign="top">Mandy, yet again another beautiful capture of yourself! Your eyes are amazing and I love the 40-50''s film noir feeling you''ve captured in this shot. You work really stands out (IMHO) and is refreshing to view. Great job 10!</td>', 'Mandy, yet again another beautiful capture of yourself! Your eyes are amazing and I love the 40-50''s film noir feeling you''ve captured in this shot. You work really stands out (IMHO) and is refreshing to view. Great job 10!', '2005-09-10 03:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692286, 225969, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast, model and setup. Good job!</td>', 'Beautiful contrast, model and setup. Good job!', '2005-09-10 03:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692288, 225323, 39349, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a dark Georgia O''Keeffe. Wonderful job!</td>', 'Reminds me of a dark Georgia O''Keeffe. Wonderful job!', '2005-09-10 03:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692290, 224971, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast shot. Love how the model''s clothing blends into the background! Outstanding job! 10!</td>', 'Beautiful contrast shot. Love how the model''s clothing blends into the background! Outstanding job! 10!', '2005-09-10 03:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692291, 226825, 39349, '<td valign="top">Contrast explodes off my screen with this shot! Great job!</td>', 'Contrast explodes off my screen with this shot! Great job!', '2005-09-10 03:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692293, 226998, 39349, '<td valign="top">Amazing technically perfect shot here! There is not a single doubt about the high contrast of this shot! I love how you''ve done this without the use of post processing; at least it doesn''t appear to use any major pp! 10!!!</td>', 'Amazing technically perfect shot here! There is not a single doubt about the high contrast of this shot! I love how you''ve done this without the use of post processing; at least it doesn''t appear to use any major pp! 10!!!', '2005-09-10 03:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692294, 225533, 39349, '<td valign="top">Amazing to say the least, wonderful contrast shot!</td>', 'Amazing to say the least, wonderful contrast shot!', '2005-09-10 03:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692295, 226000, 39349, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot! Great detail and contrast, this should be one of the top in this challenge.</td>', 'Amazing shot! Great detail and contrast, this should be one of the top in this challenge.', '2005-09-10 03:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692313, 224736, 30791, '<td valign="top">nice picture robert<br/>this will eb your highest raited photograph yet i bet<br/>10!<br/>good luck</td>', 'nice picture robertthis will eb your highest raited photograph yet i bet10!good luck', '2005-09-10 03:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692314, 226558, 30791, '<td valign="top">sweetness<br/>10</td>', 'sweetness10', '2005-09-10 03:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692316, 225952, 15922, '<td valign="top">Nice shot although I feel the contrast of light and dark on the spider itself is a bit too much - makes the outline harder to make out.</td>', 'Nice shot although I feel the contrast of light and dark on the spider itself is a bit too much - makes the outline harder to make out.', '2005-09-10 03:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692320, 226932, 15922, '<td valign="top">It looks a bit out of focus to me... unless it is motion blur??? I like your use of lighting, but I think you could have cropped out more on either the left or right of the image. E.g. crop close in on the right of the train, so the front of the train occupies the centre of the shot. (I''m no expert though!)</td>', 'It looks a bit out of focus to me... unless it is motion blur??? I like your use of lighting, but I think you could have cropped out more on either the left or right of the image. E.g. crop close in on the right of the train, so the front of the train occupies the centre of the shot. (I''m no expert though!)', '2005-09-10 03:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692321, 226652, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. It has nice interest and appeal. I like the tone you''ve used, I think it suits the image well. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice composition. It has nice interest and appeal. I like the tone you''ve used, I think it suits the image well. Good job.', '2005-09-10 03:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692325, 225223, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition. Excellant use of leading lines and vanishing point. Great depth in the image. I find myself really drawn into the image. I feel like I am there and running down the tracks. Nice job.</td>', 'Very strong composition. Excellant use of leading lines and vanishing point. Great depth in the image. I find myself really drawn into the image. I feel like I am there and running down the tracks. Nice job.', '2005-09-10 04:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692326, 226439, 15922, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, but the graininess and pale colours let this image down in my opinion. Looks like it was a sunny day, but I guess their faces being in shadow made it darker. Still... it makes the observer stand out more and gives higher contrast which is good!</td>', 'I love the composition, but the graininess and pale colours let this image down in my opinion. Looks like it was a sunny day, but I guess their faces being in shadow made it darker. Still... it makes the observer stand out more and gives higher contrast which is good!', '2005-09-10 04:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692329, 227072, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good clarity in this image. Composed nicely, although it does seem just on the verge of being ''busy'', but not greatly so.</td>', 'Good clarity in this image. Composed nicely, although it does seem just on the verge of being ''busy'', but not greatly so.', '2005-09-10 04:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692331, 227084, 15922, '<td valign="top">I''d love to know how you made the back+foreground look so ''dreamy'' and yet kept the man very much in focus. Was that done in post processing? It really makes him stand out. Not so keen on the water droplets though.    6</td>', 'I''d love to know how you made the back+foreground look so ''dreamy'' and yet kept the man very much in focus. Was that done in post processing? It really makes him stand out. Not so keen on the water droplets though.    6', '2005-09-10 04:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692333, 225323, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool image. I really like your treatment. This also might work well in a centered composition.</td>', 'Cool image. I really like your treatment. This also might work well in a centered composition.', '2005-09-10 04:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692335, 225146, 15922, '<td valign="top">A very ''busy'' image... I''m not sure what you want me to look at. Nothing jumps out at me and says "look at the contrast here!"</td>', 'A very ''busy'' image... I''m not sure what you want me to look at. Nothing jumps out at me and says "look at the contrast here!"', '2005-09-10 04:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692341, 225925, 15922, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - I like  the way you''ve got the white background area to surround him, but the blurry edge to the squirrel is a shame.</td>', 'Nice composition - I like  the way you''ve got the white background area to surround him, but the blurry edge to the squirrel is a shame.', '2005-09-10 04:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692343, 224248, 15922, '<td valign="top">Wow - great work. I trust no animals were injured in the capture of this shot!!   :-)<br/>Love to know how you got the iris to be so in focus without bolting your camera to it''s head!  7</td>', 'Wow - great work. I trust no animals were injured in the capture of this shot!!   :-)Love to know how you got the iris to be so in focus without bolting your camera to it''s head!  7', '2005-09-10 04:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692347, 225962, 15922, '<td valign="top">Damn. Why didn''t I think of doing something like this??? So simple but perfect for this challenge. Come to think of it, perfect for the Perspective challenge too!<br/>Good work: 8</td>', 'Damn. Why didn''t I think of doing something like this??? So simple but perfect for this challenge. Come to think of it, perfect for the Perspective challenge too!Good work: 8', '2005-09-10 04:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692349, 225021, 15922, '<td valign="top">If you''d been asian and covered most of your face with a scarf you would have won the challenge!!!! Joking aside, that''s a great shot and a good expression on your face. 7</td>', 'If you''d been asian and covered most of your face with a scarf you would have won the challenge!!!! Joking aside, that''s a great shot and a good expression on your face. 7', '2005-09-10 04:18:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1692354, 226979, 15922, '<td valign="top">Spring Colours? Am I missing something here? Your photo has contrast, but I''m not sure what you want me to look at. Also, it needs rotating slightly to the left.</td>', 'Spring Colours? Am I missing something here? Your photo has contrast, but I''m not sure what you want me to look at. Also, it needs rotating slightly to the left.', '2005-09-10 04:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692355, 226098, 15922, '<td valign="top">I like the title and concept, but it''s a shame his top is grainy.</td>', 'I like the title and concept, but it''s a shame his top is grainy.', '2005-09-10 04:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692442, 225405, 14671, '<td valign="top">The angle of the horizon is crooked.  Perhaps a 1- 2 degree rotation CCW could have helped this.  Good luck in this challenge. &lt;7&gt;  Would have been 8 or 9 if it were straightened.</td>', 'The angle of the horizon is crooked.  Perhaps a 1- 2 degree rotation CCW could have helped this.  Good luck in this challenge. <7>  Would have been 8 or 9 if it were straightened.', '2005-09-10 07:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692446, 226676, 39221, '<td valign="top">i wonder who took this! :-P great photo zzzzzzzz :-) 9</td>', 'i wonder who took this! :-P great photo zzzzzzzz :-) 9', '2005-09-10 07:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692471, 225962, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice lines in the composition, strong subject. I particularly like the detail in the ebony keys. Would like to see a little more highlight. 10.</td>', 'Nice lines in the composition, strong subject. I particularly like the detail in the ebony keys. Would like to see a little more highlight. 10.', '2005-09-10 08:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692479, 226885, 41918, '<td valign="top">Think I recognise this skyline! Nice compsition, possibly a little noisy, and I would prefer to see a smoother sea by using a smaller aperture. It would also reduce the flare from the sun and could deepen the colours a little. Nice! 10.</td>', 'Think I recognise this skyline! Nice compsition, possibly a little noisy, and I would prefer to see a smoother sea by using a smaller aperture. It would also reduce the flare from the sun and could deepen the colours a little. Nice! 10.', '2005-09-10 08:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692481, 225683, 41918, '<td valign="top">Was this a studio shot? Compositionally very strong, with the cat looking out of the frame. I really like the catchlight! 10.</td>', 'Was this a studio shot? Compositionally very strong, with the cat looking out of the frame. I really like the catchlight! 10.', '2005-09-10 08:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692483, 226734, 41918, '<td valign="top">Cracking shot! I would like to see more low left, but I like the composition in general. Good tonal range. 10.</td>', 'Cracking shot! I would like to see more low left, but I like the composition in general. Good tonal range. 10.', '2005-09-10 08:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692485, 225674, 41918, '<td valign="top">Strong use of selective desat. Like the detail showing the hair on the low part of the eyebrow. Would prefer to see some more shadow, and the focus on the eye instead. 10.</td>', 'Strong use of selective desat. Like the detail showing the hair on the low part of the eyebrow. Would prefer to see some more shadow, and the focus on the eye instead. 10.', '2005-09-10 08:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692489, 226358, 41918, '<td valign="top">All together now, ''Aaah!''<br/>Cracking shot. Like the composition, the focus, and the tonal range. Lovely detail in the eyes.<br/>How could you refuse a face like that? 10.</td>', 'All together now, ''Aaah!''Cracking shot. Like the composition, the focus, and the tonal range. Lovely detail in the eyes.How could you refuse a face like that? 10.', '2005-09-10 08:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692490, 226796, 41918, '<td valign="top">Good tonal range. Where was this shot? Could be my monitor, but the focus seems a little off in the centre. Superb! 10.</td>', 'Good tonal range. Where was this shot? Could be my monitor, but the focus seems a little off in the centre. Superb! 10.', '2005-09-10 08:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692491, 226781, 41918, '<td valign="top">What a cute kitten.<br/>Compositionally very strong, and good tonally. Might be my monitor, but the focus seems weak in the eyes. 9.</td>', 'What a cute kitten.Compositionally very strong, and good tonally. Might be my monitor, but the focus seems weak in the eyes. 9.', '2005-09-10 08:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692492, 226910, 41918, '<td valign="top">Hmmm  The buildings are familiar but not the skyline.... Where is it?<br/> <br/>Good Luck!</td>', 'Hmmm  The buildings are familiar but not the skyline.... Where is it? Good Luck!', '2005-09-10 08:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692493, 225861, 41918, '<td valign="top">This to me has ''judgement day'' written all over it. There is a really dark looming feel tothe cloud cover, particularly picked out in that colour. The exposure seems spot on too. Superb! 9.</td>', 'This to me has ''judgement day'' written all over it. There is a really dark looming feel tothe cloud cover, particularly picked out in that colour. The exposure seems spot on too. Superb! 9.', '2005-09-10 08:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692495, 226990, 41918, '<td valign="top">Wow! Made me shiver! Really like the texture of the cloak. Background up left is a little distracting. 10.</td>', 'Wow! Made me shiver! Really like the texture of the cloak. Background up left is a little distracting. 10.', '2005-09-10 08:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692496, 226904, 41554, '<td valign="top">Amazing.</td>', 'Amazing.', '2005-09-10 09:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692498, 226861, 41918, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast tonally for my liking. I would also like to see further down the pillar. The focus seems a lilttle off too.<br/>Not sure how to improve it (I wasn''t there) but the composition isn''t right. Your eye just wanders around the (fairly) empty sky. There appears too be some interest lower down, and whilst the off centre composition is a good attempt, i think it might work if the pillars led your eye up to the sculpture. 3.</td>', 'Not enough contrast tonally for my liking. I would also like to see further down the pillar. The focus seems a lilttle off too.Not sure how to improve it (I wasn''t there) but the composition isn''t right. Your eye just wanders around the (fairly) empty sky. There appears too be some interest lower down, and whilst the off centre composition is a good attempt, i think it might work if the pillars led your eye up to the sculpture. 3.', '2005-09-10 09:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692499, 225660, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice snapshot, and good location. Read up about the rule of thirds. A longer exposure may have worked here too. Not enough shadow for my liking. 3.</td>', 'Nice snapshot, and good location. Read up about the rule of thirds. A longer exposure may have worked here too. Not enough shadow for my liking. 3.', '2005-09-10 09:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692509, 226823, 19035, '<td valign="top">This is amazing in all aspects.</td>', 'This is amazing in all aspects.', '2005-09-10 09:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692510, 226915, 19035, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Such impact and emotion, fantastic lighting and you fit the theme head on</td>', 'WOW!  Such impact and emotion, fantastic lighting and you fit the theme head on', '2005-09-10 09:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692530, 225506, 43565, '<td valign="top">My first thought was there is not much contrast, but then I thought maybe you meant size instead of color.  I just don''t like the lighting on the girl''s face.</td>', 'My first thought was there is not much contrast, but then I thought maybe you meant size instead of color.  I just don''t like the lighting on the girl''s face.', '2005-09-10 09:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692534, 226372, 43565, '<td valign="top">Not enough focus and detail.</td>', 'Not enough focus and detail.', '2005-09-10 09:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692537, 226828, 43565, '<td valign="top">This might have worked better against another color background.</td>', 'This might have worked better against another color background.', '2005-09-10 09:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692540, 225385, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better without the surfer.  The water provides enough drama.</td>', 'I would have liked this better without the surfer.  The water provides enough drama.', '2005-09-10 09:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692542, 227028, 41918, '<td valign="top">Lovely moody shot - would look good on a postcard! The ''vintage feel doesn''t quite work for me - spoilt by the modern neckstrap, watch and glasses - otherwise, great shot. Would lilke to see a little more highlight at the bottom of the picture. 9.</td>', 'Lovely moody shot - would look good on a postcard! The ''vintage feel doesn''t quite work for me - spoilt by the modern neckstrap, watch and glasses - otherwise, great shot. Would lilke to see a little more highlight at the bottom of the picture. 9.', '2005-09-10 09:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692544, 226192, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the lines, and the tonal range. I would prefer to see the focus slightly further from the lens. 9.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the lines, and the tonal range. I would prefer to see the focus slightly further from the lens. 9.', '2005-09-10 09:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692549, 227057, 41918, '<td valign="top">Compositionally quite strong. I like the title, and in particular, I like the sunrays. Would prefer to see more space between the ''anchor'' and the skyline. 9.</td>', 'Compositionally quite strong. I like the title, and in particular, I like the sunrays. Would prefer to see more space between the ''anchor'' and the skyline. 9.', '2005-09-10 09:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692552, 226949, 41918, '<td valign="top">Compositionally quite strong and good use of differential focus. Seems a little noisy, although it could be my monitor. 9.</td>', 'Compositionally quite strong and good use of differential focus. Seems a little noisy, although it could be my monitor. 9.', '2005-09-10 09:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692553, 226214, 41918, '<td valign="top">Striking composition and use of selective desat. Focus seems a little off - would prefer it in the eye. Could be my monitor. 9.</td>', 'Striking composition and use of selective desat. Focus seems a little off - would prefer it in the eye. Could be my monitor. 9.', '2005-09-10 09:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692555, 227108, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice ''texture'' macro. Would prefer the focus crisper in the near-field. Tonally not too interesting, but intriguing all the same. A hairbrush, right? 9.</td>', 'Nice ''texture'' macro. Would prefer the focus crisper in the near-field. Tonally not too interesting, but intriguing all the same. A hairbrush, right? 9.', '2005-09-10 09:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692559, 226375, 41918, '<td valign="top">Good tonal range, and nice reflection. Would prefer to see the horizon either higher or lower, and more off centre dip in the peaks. Would also like to see the foreground in focus. 9.</td>', 'Good tonal range, and nice reflection. Would prefer to see the horizon either higher or lower, and more off centre dip in the peaks. Would also like to see the foreground in focus. 9.', '2005-09-10 09:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692560, 226760, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Focus is a little off - although it could be my monitor. Like the high key effect. Maybe a little more shadow on the far side of the face? 9.</td>', 'Nice shot. Focus is a little off - although it could be my monitor. Like the high key effect. Maybe a little more shadow on the far side of the face? 9.', '2005-09-10 09:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692561, 226941, 41918, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t wanna meet him in a dark alley!<br/>Seriously, nice composition and focus. Good tonal range. 9.</td>', 'Wouldn''t wanna meet him in a dark alley!Seriously, nice composition and focus. Good tonal range. 9.', '2005-09-10 09:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692562, 227074, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice postcard shot. Would prefer to see the ground completely black, or show more of the reflection low right. Nice composition. 9.</td>', 'Nice postcard shot. Would prefer to see the ground completely black, or show more of the reflection low right. Nice composition. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692563, 226791, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice arty shot. Would prefer more shadow, and i''m not too keen on the faded edges. Personal preference though. 9.</td>', 'Nice arty shot. Would prefer more shadow, and i''m not too keen on the faded edges. Personal preference though. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692566, 225751, 41918, '<td valign="top">Lovely - almost looks like a pen drawing or a print! You seem slightly off centre, and I find that distracting. Is the horizon level? 9.</td>', 'Lovely - almost looks like a pen drawing or a print! You seem slightly off centre, and I find that distracting. Is the horizon level? 9.', '2005-09-10 10:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692568, 226216, 41918, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, and lovely textures. Good use of focus. 9.</td>', 'Interesting angle, and lovely textures. Good use of focus. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692570, 225415, 41918, '<td valign="top">I like the high key effect, but not the colour in her fingers, or the flare on her lower back. The pose feels awkward to me too. Nice. 9.</td>', 'I like the high key effect, but not the colour in her fingers, or the flare on her lower back. The pose feels awkward to me too. Nice. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692572, 226694, 41918, '<td valign="top">What an odd title! I like the compostion, and the range of tones. Would prefer slightly deeper depth of field. 9.</td>', 'What an odd title! I like the compostion, and the range of tones. Would prefer slightly deeper depth of field. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692574, 227096, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice postcard shot, although a little overprocessed. Seems almost like a watercolour, and bhat nugs me a little. Good tonal range and focus though. 9.</td>', 'Nice postcard shot, although a little overprocessed. Seems almost like a watercolour, and bhat nugs me a little. Good tonal range and focus though. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692575, 225323, 41918, '<td valign="top">Crikey! Striking composition, and nice range of tones. 9.</td>', 'Crikey! Striking composition, and nice range of tones. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692577, 226564, 41918, '<td valign="top">Good tonal range. Compostion feels a little awkward. 9.</td>', 'Good tonal range. Compostion feels a little awkward. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692579, 226676, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice moody shot, but I don''t llke the selective colour in the flowers. Great tones! 9.</td>', 'Nice moody shot, but I don''t llke the selective colour in the flowers. Great tones! 9.', '2005-09-10 10:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692609, 225751, 11897, '<td valign="top">My top pic, 10<br/>Beautifully taken, love the choice of b/w.<br/>Don''t know if it is my eyes but the only flaw I see is a slight tilt in the horizon to the right.<br/>Great shot, good luck.</td>', 'My top pic, 10Beautifully taken, love the choice of b/w.Don''t know if it is my eyes but the only flaw I see is a slight tilt in the horizon to the right.Great shot, good luck.', '2005-09-10 10:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692610, 225248, 11897, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture, good luck 9</td>', 'Wonderful picture, good luck 9', '2005-09-10 10:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692625, 227016, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and interesting subject. 9.</td>', 'Nice composition and interesting subject. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692626, 226935, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest and say that I don''t understand the title really, not sure what elements you are refering to unless its natural vs man-made.  So I''ll skip that.  I like the simplicity of the image, the lighting is nice.  I''m not too crazy about the all black background since it seems to create areas that details are lost.   Also I''m not sure about the focus either - it seems a bit soft on the fruits and since that''s where some very rich color is coming from, as a viewer I''d like them to be a bit sharper.  That said, if a soft focus was intentional for those parts, then I''d prefer more light available to bring out the full roundness of the fruits as a counterbalance to that lack of focus.   I think the composition is good, the reflection of the orange in the bottom of the one glass is a tad distracting, but there''s not much you could do about that really.  I gave a 5.</td>', 'I''ll be honest and say that I don''t understand the title really, not sure what elements you are refering to unless its natural vs man-made.  So I''ll skip that.  I like the simplicity of the image, the lighting is nice.  I''m not too crazy about the all black background since it seems to create areas that details are lost.   Also I''m not sure about the focus either - it seems a bit soft on the fruits and since that''s where some very rich color is coming from, as a viewer I''d like them to be a bit sharper.  That said, if a soft focus was intentional for those parts, then I''d prefer more light available to bring out the full roundness of the fruits as a counterbalance to that lack of focus.   I think the composition is good, the reflection of the orange in the bottom of the one glass is a tad distracting, but there''s not much you could do about that really.  I gave a 5.', '2005-09-10 10:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692629, 227049, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice high key effect, but not enough shadow for my liking. I''m also not too sure about the border. Nice. 9.</td>', 'Nice high key effect, but not enough shadow for my liking. I''m also not too sure about the border. Nice. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692630, 225426, 41918, '<td valign="top">Very striking. I would like to see a little more highlight. 9.</td>', 'Very striking. I would like to see a little more highlight. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692632, 226665, 41918, '<td valign="top">Strong composition and interesting colours. 9.</td>', 'Strong composition and interesting colours. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692633, 226778, 41918, '<td valign="top">Lovely fun shot. Good range of tones. 9.</td>', 'Lovely fun shot. Good range of tones. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692634, 224949, 41918, '<td valign="top">Good focus. I would prefer to see more space in front of the car. 9.</td>', 'Good focus. I would prefer to see more space in front of the car. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692635, 227022, 11923, '<td valign="top">While I definitely see high contrast here, I''m not sure it does the image any good, as it seems to be boosted by post processing methods (I realize this is an assumption).  I think the subject is good, the boy''s facial expression adds drama to the photograph and the composition is very nice with him in the right foreground.  There is an odd sheen to his skin that makes the image look just a little bit faded and plastic, and I wish the focus was a tad sharper around his face.  I gave a 5.</td>', 'While I definitely see high contrast here, I''m not sure it does the image any good, as it seems to be boosted by post processing methods (I realize this is an assumption).  I think the subject is good, the boy''s facial expression adds drama to the photograph and the composition is very nice with him in the right foreground.  There is an odd sheen to his skin that makes the image look just a little bit faded and plastic, and I wish the focus was a tad sharper around his face.  I gave a 5.', '2005-09-10 10:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692636, 226744, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and strong colours. Like the off centre composition. 9.</td>', 'Nice detail and strong colours. Like the off centre composition. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692638, 225623, 41918, '<td valign="top">Strong shot. The focus seems a little off on the boards, but it could be my monitor. Excellent tonal range. 9.</td>', 'Strong shot. The focus seems a little off on the boards, but it could be my monitor. Excellent tonal range. 9.', '2005-09-10 10:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692639, 226370, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fabulous color, very very nice focus.  The composition seems a bit lacking with the flower nearly smack dab in the middle of the image, I have no suggestions on how to give it a bit more drama though.  I think this is the kind of image that would be improved by having a simple but strong black border.  It would give it a finished look in my opinion.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Fabulous color, very very nice focus.  The composition seems a bit lacking with the flower nearly smack dab in the middle of the image, I have no suggestions on how to give it a bit more drama though.  I think this is the kind of image that would be improved by having a simple but strong black border.  It would give it a finished look in my opinion.  I gave a 5', '2005-09-10 10:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692640, 226998, 41918, '<td valign="top">Good use of colour and shape. There is a glow around the tomato - was this intentional? 8.</td>', 'Good use of colour and shape. There is a glow around the tomato - was this intentional? 8.', '2005-09-10 10:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692641, 225239, 41918, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really work for me. It has interesting shapes and colours and it is recognisable. It also has an angry feel to it, but it seems too overprocessed to me. 7.</td>', 'This doesn''t really work for me. It has interesting shapes and colours and it is recognisable. It also has an angry feel to it, but it seems too overprocessed to me. 7.', '2005-09-10 10:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692642, 225638, 41918, '<td valign="top">Good tonal range, but i would like the horizon higher. 8.</td>', 'Good tonal range, but i would like the horizon higher. 8.', '2005-09-10 10:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692644, 226763, 41918, '<td valign="top">Well done for actually getting the butterfly in focus and with wings spread. I don''t like the central composition. Would this be too busy in colour? 8.</td>', 'Well done for actually getting the butterfly in focus and with wings spread. I don''t like the central composition. Would this be too busy in colour? 8.', '2005-09-10 10:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692646, 227106, 41918, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose and good range of tones. The focus is also good. 8.</td>', 'Interesting pose and good range of tones. The focus is also good. 8.', '2005-09-10 10:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692647, 227085, 41918, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Feels a little too ''snapshot'' to me. 6.</td>', 'Interesting subject. Feels a little too ''snapshot'' to me. 6.', '2005-09-10 10:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692648, 226641, 11923, '<td valign="top">The contrast is there.  The use of light is good.  The focus looks to be okay.  I''m not at all able to get interested in the subject however.  I think the gnarled background is too dark and its busy-ness takes away from the image.  With the busy nature of the background that then makes me think there''s too much of it showing, maybe a more judicious crop could help filter out some of that background and keep the focus on the white flower/weed.  The whiteness of the flower absolutely grabs my attention, don''t get me wrong, but then I find my eyes wandering to try and discern what all those balls off dried up things are on the background stems/leaves as there isn''t much for me to be drawn into once the flower has my attention.  I gave a 4.</td>', 'The contrast is there.  The use of light is good.  The focus looks to be okay.  I''m not at all able to get interested in the subject however.  I think the gnarled background is too dark and its busy-ness takes away from the image.  With the busy nature of the background that then makes me think there''s too much of it showing, maybe a more judicious crop could help filter out some of that background and keep the focus on the white flower/weed.  The whiteness of the flower absolutely grabs my attention, don''t get me wrong, but then I find my eyes wandering to try and discern what all those balls off dried up things are on the background stems/leaves as there isn''t much for me to be drawn into once the flower has my attention.  I gave a 4.', '2005-09-10 10:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692654, 225533, 18349, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to look at this one.  I really like the tonal range you''ve captured.  Nice textures as well.  Too bad I''m not teaching theatre arts anymore, this would definitely be a print I''d hang in my classroom.   Nice!  :)</td>', 'I keep coming back to look at this one.  I really like the tonal range you''ve captured.  Nice textures as well.  Too bad I''m not teaching theatre arts anymore, this would definitely be a print I''d hang in my classroom.   Nice!  :)', '2005-09-10 10:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692655, 226497, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautifully crisp, the birds feathered details really come out in this image.  I definitely see the contrast with the use of the black and white tones, however I''m not sure this choice necessarily is to the benefit of the image.  The bird certainly pops out due to the appropriate focus technique.. but the lack of color on it really still makes it blend just a bit too much into the background and gives it a stony appearance - no life or movement.  I have no idea if this would work in color either, as it could just blend into the background that way too.  Still I think the details on the bird are magnificent and the use of available light is excellent.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Beautifully crisp, the birds feathered details really come out in this image.  I definitely see the contrast with the use of the black and white tones, however I''m not sure this choice necessarily is to the benefit of the image.  The bird certainly pops out due to the appropriate focus technique.. but the lack of color on it really still makes it blend just a bit too much into the background and gives it a stony appearance - no life or movement.  I have no idea if this would work in color either, as it could just blend into the background that way too.  Still I think the details on the bird are magnificent and the use of available light is excellent.  I gave a 6', '2005-09-10 10:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692660, 226898, 41918, '<td valign="top">Good colours and focus. Not sure about the crop. 8.</td>', 'Good colours and focus. Not sure about the crop. 8.', '2005-09-10 10:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692662, 226939, 11923, '<td valign="top">Love the intensity of color and it certainly is a high contrast.  All the angles and lines are interesting and  the birds give a nice added touch.  That said, I still find the image itself just a bit boring.  Its hard to explain, especially with the in your face brightness of the colors and complexity of line movement.  I''m wondering if the impact in an aesthetic way would be higher if you''d chosen black and white instead.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Love the intensity of color and it certainly is a high contrast.  All the angles and lines are interesting and  the birds give a nice added touch.  That said, I still find the image itself just a bit boring.  Its hard to explain, especially with the in your face brightness of the colors and complexity of line movement.  I''m wondering if the impact in an aesthetic way would be higher if you''d chosen black and white instead.  I gave a 5', '2005-09-10 10:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692663, 226915, 41918, '<td valign="top">I really applaud the tonal range you have achieved with this, and it''s exposed perfectly. My personal opinion would be either much less or more DoF - keep the ear in focus or have just the eyes and mouth in focus.<br/>Lovely shot!</td>', 'I really applaud the tonal range you have achieved with this, and it''s exposed perfectly. My personal opinion would be either much less or more DoF - keep the ear in focus or have just the eyes and mouth in focus.Lovely shot!', '2005-09-10 10:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692665, 226903, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. The water is a little empty. Maybe alower position with more foreground? 8.</td>', 'Nice colours. The water is a little empty. Maybe alower position with more foreground? 8.', '2005-09-10 10:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692667, 226932, 11923, '<td valign="top">Hm.. well the red against the black does give quite a bit of contrast, colorwise.  I like the idea behind the image - the lighting use is very nice and helps tell the photo''s story.  The focus appears just a little bit soft in areas that I think would be better to have crisp focus.  Anywhere that the train is bathed in the strongest of lights should have sharp focus in my opinion.  Also, the image seems a bit washed out.  The red is vivid, but there is a flatness to the color and entire photo that I''m unable to determine a cause for, so I have no suggestions on how to change it.  I think the composition is good and I really like the idea you were going for.  I gave a 5.</td>', 'Hm.. well the red against the black does give quite a bit of contrast, colorwise.  I like the idea behind the image - the lighting use is very nice and helps tell the photo''s story.  The focus appears just a little bit soft in areas that I think would be better to have crisp focus.  Anywhere that the train is bathed in the strongest of lights should have sharp focus in my opinion.  Also, the image seems a bit washed out.  The red is vivid, but there is a flatness to the color and entire photo that I''m unable to determine a cause for, so I have no suggestions on how to change it.  I think the composition is good and I really like the idea you were going for.  I gave a 5.', '2005-09-10 10:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1692675, 225081, 11923, '<td valign="top">Definite contrast.  I like the composition in the respects of how the image is laid out.  I''m not too keen on the lighting, the glare on the vases is too stark for me - though I suppose it does match the high grain of the image.  That said I''m not enthralled with the use of grain in this case either - I''m not against grain in general, it just doesn''t seem to serve a purpose in this image.  I cannot see what vision you are trying to bring across with its use so it seems out of place in my mind.  What I do enjoy is that swathe of light/reflection? across the bottom of both vases below the annoying bar of light.  The swathe on the vase closes looks almost like a dancer leaping into the air, I think that abstract flowing look adds a nice interest touch.  I gave a 5.</td>', 'Definite contrast.  I like the composition in the respects of how the image is laid out.  I''m not too keen on the lighting, the glare on the vases is too stark for me - though I suppose it does match the high grain of the image.  That said I''m not enthralled with the use of grain in this case either - I''m not against grain in general, it just doesn''t seem to serve a purpose in this image.  I cannot see what vision you are trying to bring across with its use so it seems out of place in my mind.  What I do enjoy is that swathe of light/reflection? across the bottom of both vases below the annoying bar of light.  The swathe on the vase closes looks almost like a dancer leaping into the air, I think that abstract flowing look adds a nice interest touch.  I gave a 5.', '2005-09-10 11:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
