(1693883, 227002, 24065, '<td valign="top">I like your idea for the challenge and the textures.  I believe cropping more off the top would make for a stronger composition.  And the flower definitely should have been sharper.  If at all possible try to reshoot this.  I think you''ve got a potentially great image here.</td>', 'I like your idea for the challenge and the textures.  I believe cropping more off the top would make for a stronger composition.  And the flower definitely should have been sharper.  If at all possible try to reshoot this.  I think you''ve got a potentially great image here.', '2005-09-10 23:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1693886, 226759, 16046, '<td valign="top">Awesome, what an image, right out of newsweek!</td>', 'Awesome, what an image, right out of newsweek!', '2005-09-10 23:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1693892, 226853, 24065, '<td valign="top">I like your idea for the challenge.  The pose portrays a lot of feeling.  I like the lighting on his face, but fear hers is a little blown-out.  That may have been your intent. I don''t mind that on high contrast photos, but I think it''s the inconsistency between his skin and hers that is distracting to me.   The only other suggestion I offer is to sharpen it a little. Best of luck! :)</td>', 'I like your idea for the challenge.  The pose portrays a lot of feeling.  I like the lighting on his face, but fear hers is a little blown-out.  That may have been your intent. I don''t mind that on high contrast photos, but I think it''s the inconsistency between his skin and hers that is distracting to me.   The only other suggestion I offer is to sharpen it a little. Best of luck! :)', '2005-09-10 23:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1693894, 227016, 24613, '<td valign="top">Gutsy shot!  Hope you didn''t get stung.  Really nice work here! 9</td>', 'Gutsy shot!  Hope you didn''t get stung.  Really nice work here! 9', '2005-09-10 23:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
