(1694259, 226819, 41675, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple, good contrasting photo.</td>', 'Clean, simple, good contrasting photo.', '2005-09-11 01:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694260, 224631, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the little girl and her dollie, but for me, the background being so similar in color to the her hair, it tones down the overall contrast. Very sweet photo - one to be cherished.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the little girl and her dollie, but for me, the background being so similar in color to the her hair, it tones down the overall contrast. Very sweet photo - one to be cherished.', '2005-09-11 01:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694263, 226814, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I find this a soft, pleasing photo.</td>', 'For me, I find this a soft, pleasing photo.', '2005-09-11 01:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694267, 226816, 41675, '<td valign="top">While there is a bit of contrast, overall the photo doesn''t have that "high" contrast as compared to others in the challenge, and to me it appears slightly out of focus.</td>', 'While there is a bit of contrast, overall the photo doesn''t have that "high" contrast as compared to others in the challenge, and to me it appears slightly out of focus.', '2005-09-11 01:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694268, 226807, 42005, '<td valign="top">Exceptional emotion, movement, texture.</td>', 'Exceptional emotion, movement, texture.', '2005-09-11 01:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694269, 225296, 41675, '<td valign="top">Bumping up a point after second look :-)</td>', 'Bumping up a point after second look :-)', '2005-09-11 01:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694271, 227081, 41675, '<td valign="top">A soft, subjective contrast (guessing) from being fully in bloom - to death. bumping up after a second look. I like the black and white treatment as well.</td>', 'A soft, subjective contrast (guessing) from being fully in bloom - to death. bumping up after a second look. I like the black and white treatment as well.', '2005-09-11 01:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694272, 227023, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the right half of your photo, but I find the left half lacking.</td>', 'I like the right half of your photo, but I find the left half lacking.', '2005-09-11 02:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694278, 226521, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very cool high contrast on the waterfall and lower 2/3rds of your photo. The top third, unfortunately seems very close in tonal value. Pretty shot, though.</td>', 'Very cool high contrast on the waterfall and lower 2/3rds of your photo. The top third, unfortunately seems very close in tonal value. Pretty shot, though.', '2005-09-11 02:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694283, 226982, 41675, '<td valign="top">There is some contrast between the model''s face and what she is wearing, but for me, the muted background lessens the overall "high contrast" concept. Had this been in the color portrait challenge, I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'There is some contrast between the model''s face and what she is wearing, but for me, the muted background lessens the overall "high contrast" concept. Had this been in the color portrait challenge, I would have scored it higher.', '2005-09-11 02:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694284, 225248, 41675, '<td valign="top">Decent contrast, but for me, the large black border is a bit too much. Looks like it would work well for a CD cover.</td>', 'Decent contrast, but for me, the large black border is a bit too much. Looks like it would work well for a CD cover.', '2005-09-11 02:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694286, 225817, 41675, '<td valign="top">Aside from the one normal eye and one black eye (guessing that was your intention for the high contrast?) this lacks the "wow" factor of other entries I''ve seen in the challenge.</td>', 'Aside from the one normal eye and one black eye (guessing that was your intention for the high contrast?) this lacks the "wow" factor of other entries I''ve seen in the challenge.', '2005-09-11 02:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694289, 226955, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not... baaaaaddd (sorry, couldn''t resist) :)</td>', 'Not... baaaaaddd (sorry, couldn''t resist) :)', '2005-09-11 02:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694290, 227113, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, while there is some contrast, the majority of your photo seems very similar in tonal values in quality.</td>', 'For me, while there is some contrast, the majority of your photo seems very similar in tonal values in quality.', '2005-09-11 02:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694292, 226625, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not bad. I wonder if this would have greater impact if the main focus wasn''t almost dead centered?</td>', 'Not bad. I wonder if this would have greater impact if the main focus wasn''t almost dead centered?', '2005-09-11 02:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694294, 225423, 41675, '<td valign="top">Bumping up after second look, but find the centered bush a bit distracting.</td>', 'Bumping up after second look, but find the centered bush a bit distracting.', '2005-09-11 02:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694297, 226824, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this photo is very, very similar in grayscale values, but nice macro shot.</td>', 'For me, this photo is very, very similar in grayscale values, but nice macro shot.', '2005-09-11 02:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694300, 224428, 41675, '<td valign="top">While there is contrast, the subject matter lacks the "wow" factor I''ve seen in other entries from this challenge.</td>', 'While there is contrast, the subject matter lacks the "wow" factor I''ve seen in other entries from this challenge.', '2005-09-11 02:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694304, 226889, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the majority of your photo (grasses) are close in tonal value to the long casted shadow and only the top portion of the photo contains "high contrast."</td>', 'For me, the majority of your photo (grasses) are close in tonal value to the long casted shadow and only the top portion of the photo contains "high contrast."', '2005-09-11 02:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694306, 225952, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the soft background detracts from the overall "high contrast." Interesting markings on the spider though.</td>', 'For me, the soft background detracts from the overall "high contrast." Interesting markings on the spider though.', '2005-09-11 02:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694309, 227109, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and composition, but for me, the brown bowls, tan board and blue background "tone down" the contrast of the black and white items.</td>', 'I like the concept and composition, but for me, the brown bowls, tan board and blue background "tone down" the contrast of the black and white items.', '2005-09-11 02:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694314, 226009, 41675, '<td valign="top">Decent contrast, but the subject matter is....so-so</td>', 'Decent contrast, but the subject matter is....so-so', '2005-09-11 02:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694317, 226903, 41675, '<td valign="top">I would love to be sitting there right now.</td>', 'I would love to be sitting there right now.', '2005-09-11 02:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694319, 226807, 41675, '<td valign="top">To me, there are many similar tonal ranges and the markings on the background wall look like vines coming out of his head.</td>', 'To me, there are many similar tonal ranges and the markings on the background wall look like vines coming out of his head.', '2005-09-11 02:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694321, 225757, 41675, '<td valign="top">Something about the magenta/purplish color on the outside and red on the inside I can''t explain. Seems somewhat faked...for lack of a better term.</td>', 'Something about the magenta/purplish color on the outside and red on the inside I can''t explain. Seems somewhat faked...for lack of a better term.', '2005-09-11 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694322, 226641, 41675, '<td valign="top">The flower does have contrast, but think about keeping your subject off center to add interest. Centered objects prevent the eye from looking at the overall photo.</td>', 'The flower does have contrast, but think about keeping your subject off center to add interest. Centered objects prevent the eye from looking at the overall photo.', '2005-09-11 02:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694324, 227106, 41675, '<td valign="top">Some contrst, but for me, it seems overly done in a photo-editing program. Cute doggie though. :-)</td>', 'Some contrst, but for me, it seems overly done in a photo-editing program. Cute doggie though. :-)', '2005-09-11 02:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694327, 227040, 41675, '<td valign="top">Some contrast. Lacks the "wow" of other entries in the challenge. maybe think about cropping it so the main focus isn''t dead center in the photo.</td>', 'Some contrast. Lacks the "wow" of other entries in the challenge. maybe think about cropping it so the main focus isn''t dead center in the photo.', '2005-09-11 02:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694332, 226537, 41675, '<td valign="top">Although I like the contrast, the photo itself seems out of focus to my eyes.</td>', 'Although I like the contrast, the photo itself seems out of focus to my eyes.', '2005-09-11 02:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694334, 226916, 41675, '<td valign="top">Decent contrast, but my eyes keep reverting to that one overwhelming highlight in the middle.</td>', 'Decent contrast, but my eyes keep reverting to that one overwhelming highlight in the middle.', '2005-09-11 02:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694336, 226941, 41675, '<td valign="top">Those eyes REALLY pop out at the viewer.</td>', 'Those eyes REALLY pop out at the viewer.', '2005-09-11 02:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694338, 226781, 27164, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the large, distracting reflecion in the eyes, but other than that nice shot.</td>', 'I don''t like the large, distracting reflecion in the eyes, but other than that nice shot.', '2005-09-11 02:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694341, 225316, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, while there is contrast, it''s too grainy and not as crisp and clean as other entries in the challenge...then again, I prefer crisp images.</td>', 'For me, while there is contrast, it''s too grainy and not as crisp and clean as other entries in the challenge...then again, I prefer crisp images.', '2005-09-11 02:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694343, 225858, 41675, '<td valign="top">Some decent contrast points, but the inner brown bricks detract for me.</td>', 'Some decent contrast points, but the inner brown bricks detract for me.', '2005-09-11 02:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694344, 225298, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the grayscale overall is very similar with the trees and grass and water by the edge.</td>', 'For me, the grayscale overall is very similar with the trees and grass and water by the edge.', '2005-09-11 02:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694345, 225751, 27164, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful photograph!  The building contrasts wonderfully with the rest of the scene.  This is one of my top picks of the challenge, and one of my few 10''s.  Congrats!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful photograph!  The building contrasts wonderfully with the rest of the scene.  This is one of my top picks of the challenge, and one of my few 10''s.  Congrats!', '2005-09-11 02:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694346, 226370, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not bad, decent contrast and pleasing subject matter. Bumping up after second look. :-)</td>', 'Not bad, decent contrast and pleasing subject matter. Bumping up after second look. :-)', '2005-09-11 02:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694347, 227103, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Not enough M''s but plenty of contrast.  7</td>', 'Nice.  Not enough M''s but plenty of contrast.  7', '2005-09-11 02:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694349, 225583, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but for me lacks that "wow" impact of other entries in this challenge.</td>', 'Not bad, but for me lacks that "wow" impact of other entries in this challenge.', '2005-09-11 02:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694351, 226673, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, decent contrast. Had the glove itself been cleaner, giving it more contrast, I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'Nice composition, decent contrast. Had the glove itself been cleaner, giving it more contrast, I would have scored it higher.', '2005-09-11 02:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694353, 225925, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice squirrel silhouette.</td>', 'Nice squirrel silhouette.', '2005-09-11 02:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694354, 225969, 27164, '<td valign="top">A little bit too contrasty for my taste, but a good photo nonetheless.</td>', 'A little bit too contrasty for my taste, but a good photo nonetheless.', '2005-09-11 02:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694356, 226546, 27164, '<td valign="top">I really like this, good composition.</td>', 'I really like this, good composition.', '2005-09-11 02:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694357, 227107, 41675, '<td valign="top">I see the good contrasst between sky and building, but the building itself lacks contrast as does the foreground which for me, detracts from the overall contrast of your photo.</td>', 'I see the good contrasst between sky and building, but the building itself lacks contrast as does the foreground which for me, detracts from the overall contrast of your photo.', '2005-09-11 02:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694361, 227062, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not bad. The dark "petals" on the left bother me a bit, but I like the simplicity and composition.</td>', 'Not bad. The dark "petals" on the left bother me a bit, but I like the simplicity and composition.', '2005-09-11 02:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694363, 226763, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, your photo would have greater impact if you cropped out more of the mid-range gray background.</td>', 'For me, your photo would have greater impact if you cropped out more of the mid-range gray background.', '2005-09-11 02:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694366, 226689, 41675, '<td valign="top">Decent contrast, but I wonder if the photo was cropped closer if there would be an even greater impact?</td>', 'Decent contrast, but I wonder if the photo was cropped closer if there would be an even greater impact?', '2005-09-11 02:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694368, 226128, 27164, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing, I''d be interested in learning how you did it.  Good photo too.</td>', 'Interesting framing, I''d be interested in learning how you did it.  Good photo too.', '2005-09-11 02:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694369, 226926, 41675, '<td valign="top">I understand your high contrast entry. Old to modern music...but I find that black object in the upper left distracting.</td>', 'I understand your high contrast entry. Old to modern music...but I find that black object in the upper left distracting.', '2005-09-11 02:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694370, 226935, 41675, '<td valign="top">If there was a bit more lighting or...highlights I would have scored this higher. nice composition, but the shadows are a bit too overpowering for me.</td>', 'If there was a bit more lighting or...highlights I would have scored this higher. nice composition, but the shadows are a bit too overpowering for me.', '2005-09-11 02:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694371, 225296, 27164, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is a perfect example of high contrast, and the photo is just stunning!  Great use of bokeh, I love it!  One of my top picks for the challenge -- 9</td>', 'Wow!  This is a perfect example of high contrast, and the photo is just stunning!  Great use of bokeh, I love it!  One of my top picks for the challenge -- 9', '2005-09-11 02:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694373, 226402, 27164, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color, lines, and repitition.  A very visually pleasing photo.  My only gripe is the harshe lighting at the top and right of the photo, but other than that a great photo.</td>', 'Nice use of color, lines, and repitition.  A very visually pleasing photo.  My only gripe is the harshe lighting at the top and right of the photo, but other than that a great photo.', '2005-09-11 02:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694375, 226760, 27164, '<td valign="top">The contrast in this shot is actually quite low.  It''s mostly a mid-tone gray excluding the background.</td>', 'The contrast in this shot is actually quite low.  It''s mostly a mid-tone gray excluding the background.', '2005-09-11 02:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694376, 226559, 30364, '<td valign="top">She''s a great model (your sister, I think?) ... I like every image she''s in.  You''ve included several interesting &amp; effective contrasts here (colours, textures, ages, even the composition itself), by thinking outside the square.  Well done.  8</td>', 'She''s a great model (your sister, I think?) ... I like every image she''s in.  You''ve included several interesting & effective contrasts here (colours, textures, ages, even the composition itself), by thinking outside the square.  Well done.  8', '2005-09-11 02:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694379, 226599, 27164, '<td valign="top">Very good use of selective desaturation.  I really like this because it''s not only a contrasty photo, it has a contrast of subjects as well.  I really like what you''ve done here, a 9 from me.</td>', 'Very good use of selective desaturation.  I really like this because it''s not only a contrasty photo, it has a contrast of subjects as well.  I really like what you''ve done here, a 9 from me.', '2005-09-11 02:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694384, 226134, 27164, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and a wonderful use of sepia toning.  I really like the lighting on this one as well, and also the perspective.</td>', 'Great contrast and a wonderful use of sepia toning.  I really like the lighting on this one as well, and also the perspective.', '2005-09-11 02:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694386, 226961, 27164, '<td valign="top">Pretty decent landscape photo, but the tilted horizon is distracting and I would like to see deeper DOF (so the foreground would be in focus).</td>', 'Pretty decent landscape photo, but the tilted horizon is distracting and I would like to see deeper DOF (so the foreground would be in focus).', '2005-09-11 02:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694389, 226791, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of a beautiful dog.</td>', 'Nice photo of a beautiful dog.', '2005-09-11 02:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694390, 225947, 27164, '<td valign="top">Great use of stop-motion, I like all the particles of water.  I also really like the deep black sky and compostion--an 8 from me.</td>', 'Great use of stop-motion, I like all the particles of water.  I also really like the deep black sky and compostion--an 8 from me.', '2005-09-11 02:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694391, 224949, 27164, '<td valign="top">Great use of panning.  I woud like to see a bit cropped off the bottom, however--7</td>', 'Great use of panning.  I woud like to see a bit cropped off the bottom, however--7', '2005-09-11 02:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694396, 227030, 27164, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape!  I love the deep DOF, contrasty black/white tones, and the overall depth and feel of the image.  This is by far my favorite of the challenge--10 from me, and it''s going in my favorites.  Congrats.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape!  I love the deep DOF, contrasty black/white tones, and the overall depth and feel of the image.  This is by far my favorite of the challenge--10 from me, and it''s going in my favorites.  Congrats.', '2005-09-11 02:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694398, 227028, 27164, '<td valign="top">Perfect example of both high contrast and a great photo that has real impact--9.</td>', 'Perfect example of both high contrast and a great photo that has real impact--9.', '2005-09-11 02:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694401, 225298, 27164, '<td valign="top">Actually this photo is quite low in contrast, and it''s severely oversharpened.  I really like the subject matter though--5</td>', 'Actually this photo is quite low in contrast, and it''s severely oversharpened.  I really like the subject matter though--5', '2005-09-11 02:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694404, 226000, 25397, '<td valign="top">you gunna win les!</td>', 'you gunna win les!', '2005-09-11 02:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694405, 226479, 27164, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape scene, excellent composition, and good contrast - a great example of high contrast in color...8</td>', 'Beautiful landscape scene, excellent composition, and good contrast - a great example of high contrast in color...8', '2005-09-11 02:57:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1694409, 226895, 25397, '<td valign="top">pretty damn good, I recognize this chick. ;-)<br/>11</td>', 'pretty damn good, I recognize this chick. ;-)11', '2005-09-11 02:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694412, 226851, 27164, '<td valign="top">Good composition and sense of scale.  Also a great use of DOF to make sure everything from foreground to background was sharp...9</td>', 'Good composition and sense of scale.  Also a great use of DOF to make sure everything from foreground to background was sharp...9', '2005-09-11 03:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694415, 226916, 27164, '<td valign="top">A good idea and perspective, but I think the lighting could have been a LOT better.  A nice try though.</td>', 'A good idea and perspective, but I think the lighting could have been a LOT better.  A nice try though.', '2005-09-11 03:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694417, 226586, 27164, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a deeper, richer blue in the background, and maybe even a few clouds in the sky, but overall a nice photo nonetheless.  Good job...7</td>', 'I would like to see a deeper, richer blue in the background, and maybe even a few clouds in the sky, but overall a nice photo nonetheless.  Good job...7', '2005-09-11 03:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694419, 227096, 27164, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a bit cropped off the bottom, but other than that good photo...7</td>', 'I would like to see a bit cropped off the bottom, but other than that good photo...7', '2005-09-11 03:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694429, 226948, 27164, '<td valign="top">Really cool effect, I''m interested in how you achieved that sort of distortion.</td>', 'Really cool effect, I''m interested in how you achieved that sort of distortion.', '2005-09-11 03:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694431, 227112, 27164, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...not quite my definition of high contrast.  It seems to me to be lacking a true black, it seems to have only a dark gray.  Good photo though...6</td>', 'Hmmm...not quite my definition of high contrast.  It seems to me to be lacking a true black, it seems to have only a dark gray.  Good photo though...6', '2005-09-11 03:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694433, 226107, 27164, '<td valign="top">Very emotional, powerful shot; excellent lighting, and a beautiful model.  I really like this one...9.</td>', 'Very emotional, powerful shot; excellent lighting, and a beautiful model.  I really like this one...9.', '2005-09-11 03:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694434, 227075, 27164, '<td valign="top">A bit bright for my taste, and seems either too grainy or oversharpened.  6</td>', 'A bit bright for my taste, and seems either too grainy or oversharpened.  6', '2005-09-11 03:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694438, 225751, 36762, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I love this in black and white. Great high contrast shot. I wouldn''t change anything.</td>', 'Great photo. I love this in black and white. Great high contrast shot. I wouldn''t change anything.', '2005-09-11 03:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694439, 225533, 36762, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully done. I''ve always liked these masks.</td>', 'Wonderfully done. I''ve always liked these masks.', '2005-09-11 03:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694440, 226676, 36762, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2005-09-11 03:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694441, 227112, 36762, '<td valign="top">This photo looks like one that would be hung in a train museum. Great job.</td>', 'This photo looks like one that would be hung in a train museum. Great job.', '2005-09-11 03:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694448, 226000, 36762, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this photo. Great job.</td>', 'I like everything about this photo. Great job.', '2005-09-11 03:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694456, 225510, 44017, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, like the spider would have been more... maybe, dramtic, if there was more detail on the spider. Always like bug macro shots!</td>', 'Cool shot, like the spider would have been more... maybe, dramtic, if there was more detail on the spider. Always like bug macro shots!', '2005-09-11 03:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694457, 226558, 44017, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I''m stuck staring at it!</td>', 'Great shot, I''m stuck staring at it!', '2005-09-11 03:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694479, 225905, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well, the shoes are a clear touch of genius.  Actually, even without the shoes it''s marvellous, gritty, intellectual assault and battery; Quixotic Tarantino.  10.</td>', 'Well, the shoes are a clear touch of genius.  Actually, even without the shoes it''s marvellous, gritty, intellectual assault and battery; Quixotic Tarantino.  10.', '2005-09-11 05:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694483, 227052, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, tortuous image and title.  8</td>', 'Beautiful, tortuous image and title.  8', '2005-09-11 05:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694488, 225147, 30364, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, fascinating image.  Great subjects, deft composition and of course all sorts of contrast, both literal and figurative.  10.</td>', 'Wonderful, fascinating image.  Great subjects, deft composition and of course all sorts of contrast, both literal and figurative.  10.', '2005-09-11 05:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694491, 225981, 30364, '<td valign="top">Simple idea but elegantly executed.  7</td>', 'Simple idea but elegantly executed.  7', '2005-09-11 05:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694494, 226930, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lots of people try to do this and screw it up (me, for instance).  You didn''t; you''ve captured the mad, frantic rush to get airborne beautifully.  Plus great contrast, of course.  8</td>', 'Lots of people try to do this and screw it up (me, for instance).  You didn''t; you''ve captured the mad, frantic rush to get airborne beautifully.  Plus great contrast, of course.  8', '2005-09-11 05:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694496, 226706, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love this.  All sorts of contrast here ... tonal, textural and figurative!  It''s a dramatic image.  8</td>', 'Love this.  All sorts of contrast here ... tonal, textural and figurative!  It''s a dramatic image.  8', '2005-09-11 05:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694497, 226908, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very well seen and stylishly executed.  7</td>', 'Very well seen and stylishly executed.  7', '2005-09-11 05:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694500, 226107, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Moody and therefore contrasty in more ways than one.  Don''t wear this poor model out!  She''s good but not inexhaustible.  8</td>', 'Very nice.  Moody and therefore contrasty in more ways than one.  Don''t wear this poor model out!  She''s good but not inexhaustible.  8', '2005-09-11 05:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694501, 227074, 30364, '<td valign="top">Simple and stylish.  By far the best of the silhouette images.  8</td>', 'Simple and stylish.  By far the best of the silhouette images.  8', '2005-09-11 05:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694502, 226658, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is very good.  Interesting and satisfying.  Great title ... so apt.  8.</td>', 'This is very good.  Interesting and satisfying.  Great title ... so apt.  8.', '2005-09-11 05:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694504, 226758, 30364, '<td valign="top">A terrific ''street'' image (well not literally street, but I know you know what I mean).  It''s got everything I love .. it''s graphically and intellectually challenging, and it breathes real life.   10</td>', 'A terrific ''street'' image (well not literally street, but I know you know what I mean).  It''s got everything I love .. it''s graphically and intellectually challenging, and it breathes real life.   10', '2005-09-11 05:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694506, 224971, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s stylish and lovely.  Beautifully lit and processed.  9</td>', 'That''s stylish and lovely.  Beautifully lit and processed.  9', '2005-09-11 05:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694507, 226657, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting here, and the perspective/point-of-view.  Such an interesting, challenging image.  8</td>', 'Love the lighting here, and the perspective/point-of-view.  Such an interesting, challenging image.  8', '2005-09-11 05:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694509, 227073, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love it.  It''s visually stunning, but the central figure absolutely makes it.  It''s got a strange, surreal feel to it.  9</td>', 'Love it.  It''s visually stunning, but the central figure absolutely makes it.  It''s got a strange, surreal feel to it.  9', '2005-09-11 05:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694511, 225597, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love this kind of gritty, hard image.  Well composed and confidently cropped &amp; processed.  8</td>', 'Love this kind of gritty, hard image.  Well composed and confidently cropped & processed.  8', '2005-09-11 05:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
