(1694519, 226791, 39629, '<td valign="top">Love the photo,  I''m always going to be a sucker for Springer Spaniels, lovely dog, cannot figure out how you ever got one to sit still long enough ( unless there was food involved)<br/></td>', 'Love the photo,  I''m always going to be a sucker for Springer Spaniels, lovely dog, cannot figure out how you ever got one to sit still long enough ( unless there was food involved)', '2005-09-11 06:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694541, 225006, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice simple image. I like the format, and the reflectio on the inside side of the cup. The cup doesn''t quite seem horizontal to me. Could be my eyes tho! 8.</td>', 'Nice simple image. I like the format, and the reflectio on the inside side of the cup. The cup doesn''t quite seem horizontal to me. Could be my eyes tho! 8.', '2005-09-11 07:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694573, 225751, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo of a wonderful subject.  Good choice for this challenge, and processed accordingly.  7</td>', 'Very nice photo of a wonderful subject.  Good choice for this challenge, and processed accordingly.  7', '2005-09-11 08:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694574, 225752, 30364, '<td valign="top">Interesting and a little disorienting due to the odd shapes and angles.  Which makes it a particularly good subject for this challenge.  7</td>', 'Interesting and a little disorienting due to the odd shapes and angles.  Which makes it a particularly good subject for this challenge.  7', '2005-09-11 08:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694575, 225711, 30364, '<td valign="top">Several contrasts in one ... clever &amp; effective.  7</td>', 'Several contrasts in one ... clever & effective.  7', '2005-09-11 08:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694579, 225093, 30364, '<td valign="top">Clever and effective.  Brilliant composition/crop.  Some will say not much contrast in the literal sense.  Who cares? - it''s still very good.  8</td>', 'Clever and effective.  Brilliant composition/crop.  Some will say not much contrast in the literal sense.  Who cares? - it''s still very good.  8', '2005-09-11 08:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694583, 226511, 30364, '<td valign="top">Striking image ... the spectacular water jets against the dark sky of course supply the contrast, but the positioning of the children is what makes it so interesting.  7</td>', 'Striking image ... the spectacular water jets against the dark sky of course supply the contrast, but the positioning of the children is what makes it so interesting.  7', '2005-09-11 08:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694585, 226564, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well composed and interesting image.  Encourages the viewer to think about what might be going on; I like that.  Maybe the tiny glimpse of (paving?  jetty?) at the bottom would be better cropped out?  7</td>', 'Well composed and interesting image.  Encourages the viewer to think about what might be going on; I like that.  Maybe the tiny glimpse of (paving?  jetty?) at the bottom would be better cropped out?  7', '2005-09-11 08:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694586, 227083, 30364, '<td valign="top">Effective high-contrast processing.  Hopefully the fact that the actual composition is also high-contrast will be recognised too.  7</td>', 'Effective high-contrast processing.  Hopefully the fact that the actual composition is also high-contrast will be recognised too.  7', '2005-09-11 08:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694589, 225799, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very unusual and effective.  It''s cleverly composed and processed, but it is the original idea that makes it such a strong entry.  8</td>', 'Very unusual and effective.  It''s cleverly composed and processed, but it is the original idea that makes it such a strong entry.  8', '2005-09-11 08:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694591, 227058, 3306, '<td valign="top">excellent capture. A very suggestive picture filled with implied meaning even down to the bats. This is one that can be examined and discussed for quite a while. There are so many contrasts to be seen, black;white, male;female, young;old, etc. etc.  I have to give you a 10 on your observant eye and capturing the moment. Super!</td>', 'excellent capture. A very suggestive picture filled with implied meaning even down to the bats. This is one that can be examined and discussed for quite a while. There are so many contrasts to be seen, black;white, male;female, young;old, etc. etc.  I have to give you a 10 on your observant eye and capturing the moment. Super!', '2005-09-11 08:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694592, 225962, 30364, '<td valign="top">I was going to say "obvious", but nobody else thought of it (including me).  And I''m pleased about that because you have composed and executed the photograph superbly, and I''d have probably made a hash of it!  Bravo!  8</td>', 'I was going to say "obvious", but nobody else thought of it (including me).  And I''m pleased about that because you have composed and executed the photograph superbly, and I''d have probably made a hash of it!  Bravo!  8', '2005-09-11 08:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
