(1694616, 225273, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''ve already done three 10''s (my record) so this has to be a 10 point 5.  Contrasts abound ... light, tone, texture, weight, structure, exposure, processing and of course composition; all have got bags of contrast.  Of these, it''s the composition that''s most impressive ... what looks at first like a casual, serendipitous city scene has actually been meticulously assembled and ordered with the eye of an artist.</td>', 'I''ve already done three 10''s (my record) so this has to be a 10 point 5.  Contrasts abound ... light, tone, texture, weight, structure, exposure, processing and of course composition; all have got bags of contrast.  Of these, it''s the composition that''s most impressive ... what looks at first like a casual, serendipitous city scene has actually been meticulously assembled and ordered with the eye of an artist.', '2005-09-11 08:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1694617, 225407, 41918, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, although a little soft. Lighting feels a bit flat. 8.</td>', 'Nice portrait, although a little soft. Lighting feels a bit flat. 8.', '2005-09-11 08:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
