(1695130, 227058, 18349, '<td valign="top">Visually thought-provoking and quite a contrast on many levels.  The juxtaposition of the man of color, the white lady, the haves and the have nots, the youth and the aging, the directions in which they are looking (as well as the directions their lives have taken them)...they all come together nicely.  Gotta wonder what those inflatable bats are for.  I wish there was a tiny bit more room at the feet, but that''s neither here nor there.  Well done.  :)</td>', 'Visually thought-provoking and quite a contrast on many levels.  The juxtaposition of the man of color, the white lady, the haves and the have nots, the youth and the aging, the directions in which they are looking (as well as the directions their lives have taken them)...they all come together nicely.  Gotta wonder what those inflatable bats are for.  I wish there was a tiny bit more room at the feet, but that''s neither here nor there.  Well done.  :)', '2005-09-11 12:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695132, 226853, 18349, '<td valign="top">One of my faves of the challenge.  Great emotion and use of contrast.  Simplicity is so beautiful!  :)</td>', 'One of my faves of the challenge.  Great emotion and use of contrast.  Simplicity is so beautiful!  :)', '2005-09-11 12:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
