(1695172, 226558, 29904, '<td valign="top">Really lovely!<br/>A few changes I would have made: the clouds make it look leaning Lt. I would rotate clockwise slightly, maybe 2-3 degrees.  Also you could bump up saturation to get more color in the clouds, maybe.  Also when takeing the shot, if you have manual ability on your camera.  Shut down the aperature, like f8 to get more of a star shape in your sun, but that may blur your water?  Something to play with.  Othewise the water is just delicious!  Beautiful zoom!  Good contrast. -9</td>', 'Really lovely!A few changes I would have made: the clouds make it look leaning Lt. I would rotate clockwise slightly, maybe 2-3 degrees.  Also you could bump up saturation to get more color in the clouds, maybe.  Also when takeing the shot, if you have manual ability on your camera.  Shut down the aperature, like f8 to get more of a star shape in your sun, but that may blur your water?  Something to play with.  Othewise the water is just delicious!  Beautiful zoom!  Good contrast. -9', '2005-09-11 13:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
