(1695257, 225711, 44034, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors and good shadows.  Are these chalks?  It is really difficult to even get an idea of size.</td>', 'Fantastic colors and good shadows.  Are these chalks?  It is really difficult to even get an idea of size.', '2005-09-11 13:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
