(1695288, 224736, 27845, '<td valign="top">I''d say this is bear_music''s... feels slightly familliar :) Nice colours, good darkness/light balance. The boat would add much more to the athmosphere if it was wooden. 8.</td>', 'I''d say this is bear_music''s... feels slightly familliar :) Nice colours, good darkness/light balance. The boat would add much more to the athmosphere if it was wooden. 8.', '2005-09-11 14:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695292, 225623, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent high contrast image.  The contrast adds to the tension and supports the ''unknown destination'' theme of the image... nice work :)</td>', 'This is an excellent high contrast image.  The contrast adds to the tension and supports the ''unknown destination'' theme of the image... nice work :)', '2005-09-11 14:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695295, 226854, 22379, '<td valign="top">do i care for the image - no <br/>are the colours some of the best contrast in the challenge - yes<br/> <br/>Soccar jerseys and jockey jerseys are both prime examples of colour contrast, i''m surprised there werent more. This is a great action shot also. Looks like the guy is gonna kick him in the face... maybe i do like soccar after all hahah.</td>', 'do i care for the image - no are the colours some of the best contrast in the challenge - yes Soccar jerseys and jockey jerseys are both prime examples of colour contrast, i''m surprised there werent more. This is a great action shot also. Looks like the guy is gonna kick him in the face... maybe i do like soccar after all hahah.', '2005-09-11 14:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695304, 226823, 37005, '<td valign="top">This is so well done!  I can imagine it up on a wall.  The contrasting is done softly and almost subtly...very nice.</td>', 'This is so well done!  I can imagine it up on a wall.  The contrasting is done softly and almost subtly...very nice.', '2005-09-11 14:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695314, 226783, 37005, '<td valign="top">Of the many flower shots this is my favorite.  You captured the High Contrast medium very well in the backlit sunflower and your b&amp;w work is done beautifully.  Kudos to a lovely photograph.</td>', 'Of the many flower shots this is my favorite.  You captured the High Contrast medium very well in the backlit sunflower and your b&w work is done beautifully.  Kudos to a lovely photograph.', '2005-09-11 14:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695317, 224855, 37005, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  My only critique is the amount of background in the upper 1/2 of the photo above the guys head, I find myself distracted.  Great shot though.</td>', 'I really like this.  My only critique is the amount of background in the upper 1/2 of the photo above the guys head, I find myself distracted.  Great shot though.', '2005-09-11 14:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
