(1695485, 225623, 31133, '<td valign="top">My favorite kind of shots are tracks, paths, and roads - so you''ve won me over from the start. The fog in the distance is wonderful. Wish the lower part was as crisp as the middle parts though. I''d also like to see the bridge a little better, less dark. Love these lines!</td>', 'My favorite kind of shots are tracks, paths, and roads - so you''ve won me over from the start. The fog in the distance is wonderful. Wish the lower part was as crisp as the middle parts though. I''d also like to see the bridge a little better, less dark. Love these lines!', '2005-09-11 16:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
