(1695641, 226144, 41675, '<td valign="top">Although I like the shot itself (although I wonder if your model hates the way the water distorted her body-tee hee), for me, the blues and blacks are similar in tonal values. Also, the black border is a bit too thick. I think it would be better as a 1 or 2 pt. border.</td>', 'Although I like the shot itself (although I wonder if your model hates the way the water distorted her body-tee hee), for me, the blues and blacks are similar in tonal values. Also, the black border is a bit too thick. I think it would be better as a 1 or 2 pt. border.', '2005-09-11 18:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695642, 224171, 40977, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop or shot would have eliminated the wall on the right bottom which IMO is a bit distracting.  Love the originality ... nice job.</td>', 'A tighter crop or shot would have eliminated the wall on the right bottom which IMO is a bit distracting.  Love the originality ... nice job.', '2005-09-11 18:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695643, 225738, 40977, '<td valign="top">Would have like to see a bit more pop to the colors, but a nice job overall.</td>', 'Would have like to see a bit more pop to the colors, but a nice job overall.', '2005-09-11 18:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1695644, 224519, 40977, '<td valign="top">cool angle. nice job.</td>', 'cool angle. nice job.', '2005-09-11 18:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
