(1695678, 226861, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, while there is some contrast, it''s not as dramatic as other entries in this challenge. I do like the simplicity and composition of your shot however.</td>', 'For me, while there is some contrast, it''s not as dramatic as other entries in this challenge. I do like the simplicity and composition of your shot however.', '2005-09-11 18:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
