(1695685, 227095, 41675, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if this is real, miniturized or what, kind of cool though.</td>', 'I can''t tell if this is real, miniturized or what, kind of cool though.', '2005-09-11 19:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
