(1696237, 227022, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me there is some contrast, but other areas like in the upper left and the boys skin tones are similar (he looks cold - poor thing).</td>', 'For me there is some contrast, but other areas like in the upper left and the boys skin tones are similar (he looks cold - poor thing).', '2005-09-11 22:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
