(1696883, 225810, 18197, '<td valign="top">Okay, I confess. The bug wasn''t really on my lens, it was in a window. I used my macro lens from a distance of about 15 inches. The title just seemed to work. Sorry for the deception. And thanks for the comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-13 19:33:45.</i></td>', 'Okay, I confess. The bug wasn''t really on my lens, it was in a window. I used my macro lens from a distance of about 15 inches. The title just seemed to work. Sorry for the deception. And thanks for the comments.', '2005-09-12 01:41:43.000000', '2005-09-13 20:33:45.000000', 0),
