(1697356, 226000, 30364, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on first Blue, Lesley.  It''s a very fine image, but there''s several more that are even better in your portfolio, so I hope this ribbon will encourage people to dig deeper into your work ... it''s a rewarding and instructive experience, especially for those interested in discovering where art and photography merge.</td>', 'Congratulations on first Blue, Lesley.  It''s a very fine image, but there''s several more that are even better in your portfolio, so I hope this ribbon will encourage people to dig deeper into your work ... it''s a rewarding and instructive experience, especially for those interested in discovering where art and photography merge.', '2005-09-12 02:36:17.000000', NULL, 0),
