(1697607, 224608, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roadrunner:</b></div><hr/><i> ive seen this somewhere before, same name and all..nice try </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, you are partly right.  This is a second take on my series that I did on Usefilm on January 6, 2005!!  I liked it back then and decided to follow the same line for this challenge.<br/> <br/>As for the name...I don''t know what you are talking about.  As far as I remember I haven''t used that name before.  Please explain.<br/> <br/>Judi</td>', 'Originally posted by roadrunner: ive seen this somewhere before, same name and all..nice try   Yes, you are partly right.  This is a second take on my series that I did on Usefilm on January 6, 2005!!  I liked it back then and decided to follow the same line for this challenge. As for the name...I don''t know what you are talking about.  As far as I remember I haven''t used that name before.  Please explain. Judi', '2005-09-12 03:21:15.000000', NULL, 0),
