(1697786, 226676, 255, '<td valign="top">i am stunned that this did not ribbon.</td>', 'i am stunned that this did not ribbon.', '2005-09-12 05:28:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697788, 226000, 255, '<td valign="top">you are just awesome, doris. :)</td>', 'you are just awesome, doris. :)', '2005-09-12 05:28:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697814, 224736, 30364, '<td valign="top">I had figured it was yours as soon as I saw it, and so I deliberately saved it so I could compose an especially juicy comment.  Alas, I entirely forgot to get back to it!  So now I''ll just say I''m pleased you have got a little bit more of the recognition you deserve ,,, for terrific but often bold photography, and patient but always sharply focused advice.  You''re DPC''s premier mentor, Robert.  Bravo!</td>', 'I had figured it was yours as soon as I saw it, and so I deliberately saved it so I could compose an especially juicy comment.  Alas, I entirely forgot to get back to it!  So now I''ll just say I''m pleased you have got a little bit more of the recognition you deserve ,,, for terrific but often bold photography, and patient but always sharply focused advice.  You''re DPC''s premier mentor, Robert.  Bravo!', '2005-09-12 05:41:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697820, 226014, 30861, '<td valign="top">This image actually scored very well (commenting to your disappointment with the score) when you consider that it has major "high key" elements mixed in with the "high contrast" components. It''s like it''s two different pictures; a HC eye-and-eyelashes show superimposed on a HK eyebrows-and-face shot. It''s a striking image, which is why it placed so well IMO, but it''s visually shizophrenic, which might explain the relatively large number of 4 votes.</td>', 'This image actually scored very well (commenting to your disappointment with the score) when you consider that it has major "high key" elements mixed in with the "high contrast" components. It''s like it''s two different pictures; a HC eye-and-eyelashes show superimposed on a HK eyebrows-and-face shot. It''s a striking image, which is why it placed so well IMO, but it''s visually shizophrenic, which might explain the relatively large number of 4 votes.', '2005-09-12 05:44:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697860, 225751, 16241, '<td valign="top">excellent contrasts!</td>', 'excellent contrasts!', '2005-09-12 06:00:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697872, 226823, 11897, '<td valign="top">Very nice Gordon, scored you high, well done.</td>', 'Very nice Gordon, scored you high, well done.', '2005-09-12 06:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697873, 226781, 23430, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot I''m surprised it didn''t do much better. I really like the crop. It''s a well balanced shot. It''s hard to no what to enter when shots like this don''t make the top 10.</td>', 'I really liked this shot I''m surprised it didn''t do much better. I really like the crop. It''s a well balanced shot. It''s hard to no what to enter when shots like this don''t make the top 10.', '2005-09-12 06:10:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697901, 226675, 30861, '<td valign="top">Really nice finish here. I love this image. Definitely one of the very strongest color-contrast shots. I''d sort of expected it to ribbon, and it nearly did.</td>', 'Really nice finish here. I love this image. Definitely one of the very strongest color-contrast shots. I''d sort of expected it to ribbon, and it nearly did.', '2005-09-12 06:29:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697904, 226665, 30861, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. I''d have bumbed it from 7 to 8 or 9 if it weren''t for the PP haloing on the figure. I''ll admit it had crossed my mind that this was the work of a certain icelander :-)</td>', 'I really like this shot. I''d have bumbed it from 7 to 8 or 9 if it weren''t for the PP haloing on the figure. I''ll admit it had crossed my mind that this was the work of a certain icelander :-)', '2005-09-12 06:31:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697905, 226676, 30861, '<td valign="top">Great finish manny. I find it interesting to compare this witht he color version, because this one seems softer (and not in a positive way) than the color one. Whatever, very strong image, as usual. I think this is the first time I''ve beaten out onw of your shots, so i''m happy :-)</td>', 'Great finish manny. I find it interesting to compare this witht he color version, because this one seems softer (and not in a positive way) than the color one. Whatever, very strong image, as usual. I think this is the first time I''ve beaten out onw of your shots, so i''m happy :-)', '2005-09-12 06:32:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697913, 224736, 22459, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon Rob, you look like you are having a lot of fun with the new toys, which are helping to produce some excellent images, well done.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon Rob, you look like you are having a lot of fun with the new toys, which are helping to produce some excellent images, well done.', '2005-09-12 06:37:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697939, 224736, 40459, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This should be hanging on my wall!!!</td>', 'Wow!  This should be hanging on my wall!!!', '2005-09-12 07:07:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697943, 226562, 23394, '<td valign="top">i love it, ian, and can''t believe how overlooked and underrated this image is.  my guess that going bw would have given it a bit of a bump.</td>', 'i love it, ian, and can''t believe how overlooked and underrated this image is.  my guess that going bw would have given it a bit of a bump.', '2005-09-12 07:09:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697977, 224736, 18677, '<td valign="top">Wow, this one is awesome!  My favorite in the challenge.  Congratulations on the well-deserved ribbon!</td>', 'Wow, this one is awesome!  My favorite in the challenge.  Congratulations on the well-deserved ribbon!', '2005-09-12 07:27:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1697993, 224736, 26255, '<td valign="top">Congrats bear!!!! Well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Congrats bear!!!! Well deserved ribbon.', '2005-09-12 07:39:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698000, 226675, 36616, '<td valign="top">Knew this was a high scorer - if only for the "wow, that''s different factor"<br/>Personally I love it for all sorts of reasons.<br/>Well done Matt</td>', 'Knew this was a high scorer - if only for the "wow, that''s different factor"Personally I love it for all sorts of reasons.Well done Matt', '2005-09-12 07:45:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698001, 226000, 14386, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT!  You are on a roll!  Well-deserved win.  Great tones.  What else is there to say?  What else is there to prove?<br/> <br/>Manny</td>', 'EXCELLENT!  You are on a roll!  Well-deserved win.  Great tones.  What else is there to say?  What else is there to prove? Manny', '2005-09-12 07:46:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698006, 226675, 37215, '<td valign="top">I knew it would do well - the colours are so good and it is well shot despite not getting a second chance!<br/>Deserves its place or higher! Well done Matthew.</td>', 'I knew it would do well - the colours are so good and it is well shot despite not getting a second chance!Deserves its place or higher! Well done Matthew.', '2005-09-12 07:51:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698008, 226000, 16301, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, congrats!</td>', 'Love this shot, congrats!', '2005-09-12 07:52:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698022, 224736, 32997, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Great use of contrast..congrats.</td>', 'Beautiful! Great use of contrast..congrats.', '2005-09-12 07:59:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698024, 225407, 42031, '<td valign="top">This first challenge was a real learning experience. I thought there was enough contrast between the shadow and the rest of the photo. I do see what some said about it needing to pop more. I guess being relatively new to Photoshop and all it has to offer was clear, as in playing with this photo since, I realize it had much more potential. Live and learn. But thanks to all for the helpful comments. My nephew was glad to be my subject and I am thankful that even though it didn''t score well, you all had nice things to say about him and the portrait itself. As for the low score, I agree, it wasn''t contrast-y enough.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-12 07:02:53.</i></td>', 'This first challenge was a real learning experience. I thought there was enough contrast between the shadow and the rest of the photo. I do see what some said about it needing to pop more. I guess being relatively new to Photoshop and all it has to offer was clear, as in playing with this photo since, I realize it had much more potential. Live and learn. But thanks to all for the helpful comments. My nephew was glad to be my subject and I am thankful that even though it didn''t score well, you all had nice things to say about him and the portrait itself. As for the low score, I agree, it wasn''t contrast-y enough.', '2005-09-12 08:01:02.000000', '2005-09-12 08:02:53.000000', 0),
(1698025, 226000, 32997, '<td valign="top">Just another ordinarily brilliant shot..at least from you. Wow!<br/> I missed this challenge..congrats!</td>', 'Just another ordinarily brilliant shot..at least from you. Wow! I missed this challenge..congrats!', '2005-09-12 08:01:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698026, 226000, 19746, '<td valign="top">Nice Lesley!  Such an honest and well defined shot and you''ve composed this fantastically well.  Perfect DOF and congrats on another ribbon :) <br/> <br/>Certainly showcasing our countrymen/women/children in the DPC top 10 with your portraiture!  <br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Nice Lesley!  Such an honest and well defined shot and you''ve composed this fantastically well.  Perfect DOF and congrats on another ribbon :)  Certainly showcasing our countrymen/women/children in the DPC top 10 with your portraiture!   Alex', '2005-09-12 08:02:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698029, 226823, 32997, '<td valign="top">Missed the challenge..sure am glad I didn''t miss this shot..fantastic work!</td>', 'Missed the challenge..sure am glad I didn''t miss this shot..fantastic work!', '2005-09-12 08:03:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698035, 224736, 28299, '<td valign="top">Way to go!!!! Awesome photo!</td>', 'Way to go!!!! Awesome photo!', '2005-09-12 08:09:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698036, 226573, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot, was hoping it would make it higher up the chart...</td>', 'I really liked this shot, was hoping it would make it higher up the chart...', '2005-09-12 08:10:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698041, 226658, 11738, '<td valign="top">Je suis déçu de la position finale de cette image.  Elle vaut beaucoup plus que le pointage qu''elle a reçu.  Beau travail.  Çà fait du bien que tu sois de retour.</td>', 'Je suis déçu de la position finale de cette image.  Elle vaut beaucoup plus que le pointage qu''elle a reçu.  Beau travail.  Çà fait du bien que tu sois de retour.', '2005-09-12 08:12:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698051, 225799, 28299, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, now I see this is yours! And it is fantastic!! Love the out of the box fine art approach. Congrats on a great finish!</td>', 'Oh yeah, now I see this is yours! And it is fantastic!! Love the out of the box fine art approach. Congrats on a great finish!', '2005-09-12 08:22:32.000000', NULL, 0),
