(1698402, 227058, 8624, '<td valign="top">I sat on this photo during the voting period, intending to come back to it because it struck me as a really terrific submission for the theme. I never got back to voting and I am sorry for that as this picture really moved me. The two people, sitting so close, but so disconnected from one another seems very sad to me. As you mention in your notes the two bats form a barrier between the two people and they both have expressions that say they''d rather be anywhere else but where they are sitting. The technical quality of the shot is OK, but the story is top notch. adding to my favorites.<br/></td>', 'I sat on this photo during the voting period, intending to come back to it because it struck me as a really terrific submission for the theme. I never got back to voting and I am sorry for that as this picture really moved me. The two people, sitting so close, but so disconnected from one another seems very sad to me. As you mention in your notes the two bats form a barrier between the two people and they both have expressions that say they''d rather be anywhere else but where they are sitting. The technical quality of the shot is OK, but the story is top notch. adding to my favorites.', '2005-09-12 10:14:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698420, 224736, 37005, '<td valign="top">Bear-absolutely beautiful shot!  Congrats on the ribbon!!</td>', 'Bear-absolutely beautiful shot!  Congrats on the ribbon!!', '2005-09-12 10:16:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698524, 225239, 32754, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, it hurt my eyes to look at this: BUT I DIDN''T CARE! I wanted to do something totally different and out of the box and wildly creative and that''s what I''m proud of: myself for being willing to take a chance. thank you for the three 10s, one 9, and all the 5 to 7s..thanks for looking beyond the basics and into the wild world.</td>', 'I have to admit, it hurt my eyes to look at this: BUT I DIDN''T CARE! I wanted to do something totally different and out of the box and wildly creative and that''s what I''m proud of: myself for being willing to take a chance. thank you for the three 10s, one 9, and all the 5 to 7s..thanks for looking beyond the basics and into the wild world.', '2005-09-12 10:34:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1698564, 226942, 35804, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by muur88:</b></div><hr/><i> interesting idea.  i like how you have captured the hand.  i find myself strangely drawn to the small marking/reflection on the very right/center edge of the perfume bottle.  from one angle it looks like a smiling upside down cartoon head and from a slightly different one, a big grinned puppy dog.  very trippy stuff. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>YES! This made my day...you actually looked at this long enough to see the face! : }</td>', 'Originally posted by muur88: interesting idea.  i like how you have captured the hand.  i find myself strangely drawn to the small marking/reflection on the very right/center edge of the perfume bottle.  from one angle it looks like a smiling upside down cartoon head and from a slightly different one, a big grinned puppy dog.  very trippy stuff.   YES! This made my day...you actually looked at this long enough to see the face! : }', '2005-09-12 10:43:14.000000', NULL, 0),
