(1700607, 226676, 19708, '<td valign="top">Guess I have to go against the majority here on this one Manny.<br/>Composition and subject is, as always, first-rate.<br/>In this instance, I don''t feel the processing was in your normal high standards.<br/>Too harsh in many ways, especially around the flowers, and a bit odd around her right upper arm (focus/clarity?).<br/>Did you consider a softer finish on the flowers by chance? A bit of gaussion blur?<br/>Just personal preference/opinion.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the Magazine shots by the way.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Guess I have to go against the majority here on this one Manny.Composition and subject is, as always, first-rate.In this instance, I don''t feel the processing was in your normal high standards.Too harsh in many ways, especially around the flowers, and a bit odd around her right upper arm (focus/clarity?).Did you consider a softer finish on the flowers by chance? A bit of gaussion blur?Just personal preference/opinion. Congrats on the Magazine shots by the way. ', '2005-09-12 19:30:12.000000', NULL, 0),
