(1701479, 226417, 32997, '<td valign="top">Saw your post..so here is my comment..the dog is very cute, I like his eyes, and he seems to be in focus. With a neutral background I think it might help if you made sure it wasn''t in the foreground..it becomes distracting...maybe it would help to try catching the dog from up above, so that the background becomes less apparent (and it would still fit the challenge).<br/>Sure does look like a nice dog...hope any of this helps.</td>', 'Saw your post..so here is my comment..the dog is very cute, I like his eyes, and he seems to be in focus. With a neutral background I think it might help if you made sure it wasn''t in the foreground..it becomes distracting...maybe it would help to try catching the dog from up above, so that the background becomes less apparent (and it would still fit the challenge).Sure does look like a nice dog...hope any of this helps.', '2005-09-12 22:07:43.000000', NULL, 0),
