(1702915, 225423, 39629, '<td valign="top">When this photo was taken Taupo was in the middle of a pollen explosion from the literally millions of thos damn pine trees in our region.  It was that heavy that during the day you could clearly see a yellow green cloud of it and it actually obscured scenery at times, played hell with allergy sufferers and gave one hell of a good sunset that night, apart from the slight haze that it caused it was spectacular</td>', 'When this photo was taken Taupo was in the middle of a pollen explosion from the literally millions of thos damn pine trees in our region.  It was that heavy that during the day you could clearly see a yellow green cloud of it and it actually obscured scenery at times, played hell with allergy sufferers and gave one hell of a good sunset that night, apart from the slight haze that it caused it was spectacular', '2005-09-13 08:42:55.000000', NULL, 0),
