(1704423, 226557, 13602, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> Cool image.  Looks like he really enjoys his music.  Was this from the Johann Strauss International Festival at the Athenaeum? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No it was a concert here on a little stage, in my little town, in north of Romania. Enjoying and feeling the music is what he really does here, even if it maybe looks that way, he was only playing keyboards and no vocals at this point. Thanks.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-13 15:36:18.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: Cool image.  Looks like he really enjoys his music.  Was this from the Johann Strauss International Festival at the Athenaeum?   No it was a concert here on a little stage, in my little town, in north of Romania. Enjoying and feeling the music is what he really does here, even if it maybe looks that way, he was only playing keyboards and no vocals at this point. Thanks.', '2005-09-13 16:36:01.000000', '2005-09-13 16:36:18.000000', 0),
