(1704626, 225239, 27421, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments on my photos... &amp; I DO have a Brown Ribbon, so you can not top that with this photo... I am always leary to over process photos for fear they will be DQ''ed. I have to be honest with you, I did not rate this photo high (3) because I tend to vote higher for works that resemble photos... I know I am wrong, and try to be open minded, because this is a digital work of art (and it originated in a camera). I guess since I am a novice Photoshop user, that is my main hangup. If I had more experience and expertise in Photoshop, perhaps I would be more open minded to new and different techniques.... I am trying to improve with that aspect of my experience...</td>', 'Thanks for your comments on my photos... & I DO have a Brown Ribbon, so you can not top that with this photo... I am always leary to over process photos for fear they will be DQ''ed. I have to be honest with you, I did not rate this photo high (3) because I tend to vote higher for works that resemble photos... I know I am wrong, and try to be open minded, because this is a digital work of art (and it originated in a camera). I guess since I am a novice Photoshop user, that is my main hangup. If I had more experience and expertise in Photoshop, perhaps I would be more open minded to new and different techniques.... I am trying to improve with that aspect of my experience...', '2005-09-13 17:38:22.000000', NULL, 0),
