(2015918, 224855, 27763, '<td valign="top">I added this to my favorites long ago (during the voting period for this challenge, maybe), and I could have sworn that I commented on it, but apparently I didn''t.<br/> <br/>Anyway, I''ll leave a comment now.  I really like this one.  He seems to have a great, but very subtle, expression in his eyes that, as a pet owner, I can really relate to.  And it works really well in high contrast, too.<br/> <br/>P.S.  I love Amber''s comment.  What a wild dream!  <br/> <br/>P.P.S.  The pillow pattern doesn''t bother me one bit!</td>', 'I added this to my favorites long ago (during the voting period for this challenge, maybe), and I could have sworn that I commented on it, but apparently I didn''t. Anyway, I''ll leave a comment now.  I really like this one.  He seems to have a great, but very subtle, expression in his eyes that, as a pet owner, I can really relate to.  And it works really well in high contrast, too. P.S.  I love Amber''s comment.  What a wild dream!   P.P.S.  The pillow pattern doesn''t bother me one bit!', '2006-01-08 20:20:43.000000', NULL, 0),
