(2349462, 227052, 28710, '<td valign="top">Liking the great depth of the picture as well as that totally wicked lens flare. Damn that''s sweet. I''d love to know how to do that. Lens flare is one of my favorite mood enhancing effects.</td>', 'Liking the great depth of the picture as well as that totally wicked lens flare. Damn that''s sweet. I''d love to know how to do that. Lens flare is one of my favorite mood enhancing effects.', '2006-04-27 02:44:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2355808, 225799, 27845, '<td valign="top">This image as been in my favourites for a few months now and I still like coming back to it at enjoy the way it portrays an everyday action. Not only did you take a pleasently different approach by cutting off the image just above the hips, thus leaving the action of reaching which one usually associates with stretched arms, out of the frame. You also managed to give it a very charming quality with your high contrast post processing. What really did it for me, I guess, is your use of vertical noise to echo the upward movement of the model.</td>', 'This image as been in my favourites for a few months now and I still like coming back to it at enjoy the way it portrays an everyday action. Not only did you take a pleasently different approach by cutting off the image just above the hips, thus leaving the action of reaching which one usually associates with stretched arms, out of the frame. You also managed to give it a very charming quality with your high contrast post processing. What really did it for me, I guess, is your use of vertical noise to echo the upward movement of the model.', '2006-04-29 05:34:51.000000', NULL, 0),
